"Adds CAPTCHA to all Drupal forms, regardless of the Captcha Points "
"list. Note, that the captcha point <em>default challenge</em> will be "
"used as the challenge type for the created CAPTCHA challenges."
msgstr ""
"Itongeza CAPTCHA kuri buri fomu ya Drupal, hatitawe ku rutonde rwa "
"**Captcha Points**. Bamenye ko ahaboneka ho kuri CAPTCHA yitwa "
"<em>default challenge</em> aribwo buzakoreshwa nk’ubwoko "
"bw’ikibazo (challenge) kuri CAPTCHA zakozwe."

msgid "Additionally add CAPTCHA challenges on admin forms"
msgstr ""
"Byongeyeho ongera ibibazo bya CAPTCHA ku mpapuro zo kwinjira/ubuyobozi "
