msgstr ""
"Ugomba guhitamo agaciro keretse niba iyi ari iyungurura ridasabwa "
"(ritaryoherezwa) kandi ridakenewe."

msgid "Enable to hide items that do not contain this relationship"
msgstr "Fasha guhisha ibintu bidafite iyi sano"

