"ugahumuriza aho umurongo w’ishusho (image) utahindurwa. Niba "
"usunitse umurongo (field) kudahindurwa, uzaba ugihari mu ifishi yo "
"guhindura amakuru, ariko impinduka zakozwe kuri uwo murongo "
"zizakoreshwa kuri <em>zose</em> izahinduwe (translations) z’ayo "
"makuru."

