"This field cardinality is set to @cardinality and cannot be "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Iri shami (field) ryashyizweho cardinality kuri @cardinality kandi "
"ntirishobora guhindurwa."

msgid "Controls if unused files should be marked temporary"
msgstr ""
"Igenzura niba dosiye zitemezwa zigomba gufatwa nk’uko ari iz’igihe "
"gito (temporary)."

msgid ""
"Could not apply @style image style to @uri because the style does not "
