msgstr ""
"Igaragaza iyo bloc ku mpapuro zifite uko bisa n’ibyo gusubiza "
"(response status) byose bihuye. Nta na kimwe gikishijwe, iyo bloc "
"igaragara ku mpapuro zose. Izindi status zo gusubiza ntikoreshwa."

