msgstr ""
"Amakuru y’idosiye by’agateganyo ntiyashoboye kwandikwa kubera ko "
"bidakunda."

msgid "Temporary file could not be opened for file upload"
msgstr ""
"Idosiye by'agateganyo ntibyashobotse gufungurwa hagamijwe kohereza "
