"Please make sure to update all webform related "
"<code>hook_form_BASE_FORM_ID_alter()</code> and "
"<code>hook_form_FORM_ID_alter()</code> hooks."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka menya neza ko uhuza (uvugurura) imishinga yose ifitanye "
"isano na webform ya <code>hook_form_BASE_FORM_ID_alter()</code> na "
