msgid "Delete the selected variants"
msgstr "Siba amahitamo yatoranijwe"

msgid "Delete all variants"
msgstr "Siba amahitamo yose"

msgid "Do not delete any variants"
msgstr "Ntugahanagure na rimwe utundi duhu twose (variants)."

msgid "Please select variants to be applied to the webform."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka hitamo amoko (variants) agomba gukenerwa kugezwa kuri "
"webform."

msgid "The selected webform variants have been applied and deleted."
msgstr ""
"Ibice byatoranyijwe by’urubuga rw’impapuro (webform) byashyizweho "
"kandi birahanaguwe."

msgid "The webform variant %title has been applied and deleted."
msgstr "Itandukaniro rya webform %title ryashyizweho rikanakurwaho."

msgid ""
"The selected webform variants have been applied and all variants have "
"been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Amahinduka y’ibikoresho byatoranyijwe bya webform yashyizweho, kandi "
"uburyo bwose bwahinduwe bwasibwe."

msgid ""
"The webform variant %title has been applied and all variants have been "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Ihitamo ry’imwe rya webform %title ryashyizweho kandi amahitamo yose "
"yarasibwe."

msgid "The selected webform variants have been applied."
msgstr ""
"Ibyiciro by’uburyo bwo kwishyiriraho (webform) byatoranyijwe bimaze "
"gukurikizwa."

msgid "The webform variant %title has been applied."
msgstr "Uburyo bwa webform %title bukozeho."

msgid "The webform variant %name has been deleted."
msgstr "Impinduro ya webform %name yarasibwe."

msgid "Edit @label variant"
msgstr "Hindura uburyo @label variant"

msgid "The webform variant was successfully added."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo guhindura bwa webform bwongewe neza."

msgid "The webform variant was successfully updated."
msgstr "Ihinduka rya webform ryagezweho kugezwa neza."

msgid ""
"Select variants and then click submit, which will redirect you to the "
"@operation form."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo ibice (variants) hanyuma ukande kuri **submit**, bizakuyobora "
"kuri fomu ya **@operation**."

msgid "Filter webforms default category"
msgstr "Shungura kategori gasanzwe y’imbuga z’ubumenyi (webforms)"

msgid ""
"Select the filter webforms default category selected on the <a "
"href=\":href\">webform overview page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo icyiciro cy’isanzwe cy’urubuga rw’amakuru (filter) "
"rwatoranyijwe kuri <a href=\":href\">urupapuro rw’ihuriro "
"ry’urubuga rw’amakuru (webform overview)</a>."

msgid "Filter webforms default state"
msgstr "Haga akayunguruzo ku miterere isanzwe y’imenyekanisha (webforms)"

msgid ""
"Select the filter webforms default state selected on the <a "
"href=\":href\">webform overview page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo uburyo bwo gufungura (default state) bwo guhungabanya (filter) "
"ku <a href=\":href\">urupapuro rw’incamake rwa webform</a>."

msgid "Form URL path settings"
msgstr "Amasetingi y’inzira (URL path) y’ifishi"

msgid "Select available variants"
msgstr "Hitamo ibishobora kuboneka by’uturango dutandukanye (variants)"

msgid "All excluded variants must be manually removed from existing webforms."
msgstr ""
"Amahitamo yose yavanyweho agomba gukurwaho n’intoki muri webforms "
"zisanzwe zihari."

msgid "Allow element to be populated using query string parameters."
msgstr ""
"Bemerera ko ikintu cyuzuzwa hifashishijwe ibipimo by’umurongo (query "
"string parameters)."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module disables page caching of pages that "
"include a CAPTCHA challenge."
msgstr ""
"Menya ko modire ya CAPTCHA ihagarika kubika urupapuro mu bubiko bwo ku "
"rubuga (page caching) ku mpapuro zifite ikibazo cya CAPTCHA."

msgid ""
"This is used after a submission has been saved and finalized to the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bikoreshwa nyuma y’uko gutanga (submission) bibitswe kandi "
"byemejwe (finalized) mu bubiko bwa database."

msgid "Provides a form element for enabling and tracking webform variants."
msgstr ""
"Bitanga ikintu cyifashishwa mu buryo bwo gukora ifishi igufasha gukora "
"no gukurikirana uburyo butandukanye bwa webform."

msgid ""
"<strong>ATTENTION DEVELOPERS!!!</strong> Please make sure to download "
"and update the <a href=\":href\">Input Mask</a> library to version "
"5.0.x"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ITONDERA ABATEKINISIYERI B’ITERIMI (DEVELOPERS)!!!</strong> "
"Nyamuneka menya neza ko ushakisha ukakuramo kandi ukavugurura "
"laibulali ya <a href=\":href\">Input Mask</a> kugera ku bwoko bwa "
"5.0.x"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":href\">Learn more about updating the Webform module's "
"external libraries</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href\">Soma byinshi ku bijyanye no kuvugurura ibintu byo "
"hanze (external libraries) bya module ya Webform</a>"

msgid ""
"Learn more about <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/api/form-api\">Form API in Drupal "
"8</a>."
msgstr ""
"Menya byinshi kuri <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/api/form-api\">Form API muri "
"Drupal 8</a>."

msgid "Do not schedule email if the action should be triggered in the past"
msgstr ""
"Ntukohereze imeri niba igikorwa giteganyijwe kubera ko cyagombye kuba "
"cyatangiye kera (mu gihe gishize)."

msgid "Given name on card"
msgstr "Izina (ryawe) ku ikarita"

msgid "Card expiry month"
msgstr "Ukwezi ibarura rya konti irangira"

msgid "Card expiry year"
msgstr "Umwaka w’igihe ikarita izarangiriraho"

msgid "Transaction currency"
msgstr "Amani y’ubucuruzi (transaction)"

