msgid "Type of downloadable archive"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw’inyandiko zishobora gukurwa (archive)"

msgid "Customize my table"
msgstr "Hindura imbonerahamwe yanjye"

msgid "Allow users to customize the results"
msgstr "Emera abayikoresha guhindura uko ibisubizo bimeze"

msgid "Cast remote post data"
msgstr "Ohereza amakuru y’ipositi yo hanze (remote)"

msgid "Allow users to customize the results table"
msgstr "Emerera abakoresha guhindura uko imbonerahamwe y’ibisubizo imeze"

msgid ""
"Anonymous user limits are only tracked by the user's browser session. "
"It is recommended that limits per user only be used on forms "
"restricted to authenticated users."
msgstr ""
"Imipaka y’umukoresha utazwi (anonymous) ibarwa gusa hakurikijwe "
"igihembwe cy’iseshi rya porogaramu y’urwo rikoreshwa (browser "
"session). Birasabwa ko imipaka ku mukoresha ikoreshejwe gusa ku "
"byangombwa (forms) bikozwe ziba zifungurirwa abakoresha bemerewe "
"(authenticated users) gusa."

msgid "Option/checkbox settings"
msgstr "Amasahani/checkbox (amahitamo)"

msgid "Disable the option/checkbox"
msgstr "Guhagarika iyi myandikire/agasanduku gatoranywamo (checkbox)"

msgid "Remove the option/checkbox"
msgstr "Kuraho inzitizi/checkbox ihitamo"

msgid ""
"This message is displayed when the remaining submission is greater "
"than one."
msgstr "Ubutumwa bwerekanwa igihe ibisigaye mu itangwa birenze kimwe."

msgid "One remaining message"
msgstr "Ubutumwa bumwe buzasigaye"

msgid ""
"This message is displayed when there is only one remaining submission "
"available."
msgstr "Ubutumwa butangwa iyo hasigaye indi submission imwe gusa."

msgid "None remaining message"
msgstr "Nta butumwa busigaye."

msgid "This message is displayed when there are remaining submissions allows."
msgstr "Ubutumwa bugaragazwa iyo hari ibisubizo bisigaye byemeretwa."

msgid "This message is displayed when there are not submissions limits."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bwerekanwa igihe nta mbanziriza ntarengwa z’imishinga "
"bihari."

msgid ""
"The message is displayed when an element has validation error is "
"submitted."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bwerekanwa iyo igikorwa (element) cyagaragaje amakosa yemeza "
"(validation) bigeze gutangirwa."

msgid "Define options or checkbox submission limits."
msgstr "Shyiraho amahitamo cyangwa imipaka yo kwemeza ubisubizo bwa checkbox."

msgid "Examples for Developers | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Ingero z’abatekinisiye (Developers) | Drupal.org"

msgid "more @options"
msgstr "birenzeho @options"

msgid "Users can customize the submission results table for all webforms"
msgstr ""
"Abakoresha bashobora guhindura imbonerahamwe y’ingaruka zo gutanga "
"(submission results) kuri webforms zose."

msgid "Customize default table"
msgstr "Hindura imbonerahamwe isanzwe"

msgid ""
"Below you can customize your dedicated results table, which is "
"displayed only to you."
msgstr ""
"Hasi aha ushobora kwihinduramo imbonerahamwe y’ibisubizo byihariye, "
"igaragara kuri wowe wenyine."

msgid ""
"Below you can customize the default results table, which is displayed "
"to all users."
msgstr ""
"Hano hepfo ushobora guhitamo imbonerahamwe y’ibisubizo isanzwe, "
"igaragazwa ku bakoresha bose."

msgid "Your customized table has been saved."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe yawe wahinduye imaze kubikwa."

msgid "The default customized table has been saved."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe yihariye isanzwe yabitswe."

msgid "Your customized table has been reset."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe wihariye washyizeho yasubijwe ku buryo busanzwe."

msgid "The default customized table has been reset."
msgstr ""
"Imbonerahamwe y’ihanzwe (customized) isanzwe isubijwe mu buryo "
"busanzwe."

msgid "lowercase letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes"
msgstr ""
"inyuguti nto (lowercase), imibare, n’uduce dukoresha "
"“underscore”, n’amabari “dashes”"

msgid "No orphaned submission found."
msgstr "Nta gisohoro cy’ingenzi kitagira nyiracyo (orphaned) cyabonetse."

msgid "Are you sure you want remove @total orphaned webform submissions?"
msgstr ""
"Wizeye neza ko ushaka gukuraho ibyoherezwa bya webform bikiri mu "
"bwigunge (@total)?"

msgid "Deleting @total orphaned webform submissions…"
msgstr ""
"Gusiba @total ibisohokayanditswe by’amanindamyanya (orphaned) bya "
"webform…"

msgid ""
"Lowercase letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes. (i.e. "
"element-key)"
msgstr ""
"Amabaruwa aciye inyuma (lowercase), imibare, imikirizo (underscores), "
"n’imitego (dashes). (ni ukuvuga element-key)"

msgid "Minimum value can not exceed the maximum value."
msgstr "Agaciro ntarengwa ntigomba kurenza agaciro ntarengwa-mubisanzwe."

msgid "Label for the minimum value in the scale."
msgstr "Izina ry’agaciro ntarengwa kuri urwego."

msgid "Automatically prefix and increment the table's rows and elements"
msgstr ""
"Bikora ku buryo bwikora bifatanya inyuguti (prefix) kandi bikongera "
"umubare w’imirongo n’ibintu bya tabele"

msgid "Table row settings"
msgstr "Amahugurwa y’umurongo mu mbonerahamwe"

msgid "Invalid signature file detected and deleted. (@see @url)"
msgstr ""
"Idosiye y’ umukono (signature) itemewe irabonetse maze irahanagurwa. "
"(@see @url)"

msgid ""
"Invalid signature file detected and deleted. (@see <a "
"href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"
msgstr ""
"Idosiye y’ikimenyetso (signature) itari yo irahagaragajwe maze "
"irasibanganywa. (reba kuri <a href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"

msgid "Enable form sharing"
msgstr "Koresha gusangiza imisuzuma (form)"

msgid "Enable form sharing for webform nodes"
msgstr "Gushoboza gusangira imikoranire (form) kuri webform nodes"

msgid "Shared form theme"
msgstr "Insanganyamatsiko y’ifishi ihuriweho"

msgid "Display shared form title"
msgstr "Garagaza umutwe w’ifishi ihuriweho"

msgid "Shared form page attributes"
msgstr "Amahahuzahamwe yihariye y’urupapuro rw’Ifishi Rihuriweho"

msgid "Default shared form theme"
msgstr "Insanganyamatsiko ngenderwaho y’ifishi isangiwe"

msgid "Allows webforms to be shared on other websites using an iframe."
msgstr "Bemerera webforms gusangirwa ku yindi mbuga ukoresheje iframe."

msgid "Code copied to clipboard…"
msgstr "Kode yandukuwe kuri clipboard…"

msgid ""
"To test anonymous user access to the below embedded webform, please "
"log out or open the below link in a new private or incognito window."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ugerageze uburyo abashyitsi batumwe (anonymous) bagera kuri "
"webform iri hepfo iri mu buryo bwashizwemo, nyamukana (log out) "
"cyangwa fungura urwo ruto rwihuza (link) hepfo mu idirishya rishya "
"ryihariye (private) cyangwa mu buryo bwa incognito."

msgid ""
"Choose how you want to embed the webform and then copy-n-paste the "
"below code snippet directly into the HTML source of any webpage."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo uko ushaka gushyiramo webform, hanyuma uhite ukoporora-ukomeze "
"(copy-n-paste) igice cyayo cy’inyandiko iri hepfo mu isoko rya HTML "
"(HTML source) ry’urupapuro urwo ari rwo rwose."

msgid ""
"Resizing iframe -- The embedded webform will be responsive and "
"adjusted to fit within the page using an iframe and JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Guhindura ingano ya iframe — Uburyo bwo kohereza amakuru (embedded "
"webform) buzahinduka bube bunoze ku bipimo by’ibikubiyemo, kandi "
"buhindurwe ngo buhuze n’urupapuro hakoreshejwe iframe na JavaScript."

msgid ""
"Fixed iframe -- The embedded webform will be a fixed size on the page "
"using an iframe with a scrollbar."
msgstr ""
"Iframe ihamye — Urupapuro rwashyizwemo (embedded webform) ruzaba "
"rufite ubunini buhamye ku ipaji, ukoresheje iframe ifite umurongo wo "
"kuguruka (scrollbar)."

msgid "Resizing iframe code"
msgstr "Guhindura ubunini bw’inyandiko ya iframe"

msgid "Form sharing enabled"
msgstr "Guhurizanya ifishi byemejwe"

msgid "Form sharing is enabled for all webforms."
msgstr "Guhinduranya (gufatanya) imiterere byemewe kuri formulaire zose."

msgid "If checked, form sharing will be enabled for this webform."
msgstr "Niba byatoranijwe, gusangiza ifishi bizabonerwa ku iyi webform."

msgid "If checking, form sharing will be enabled for all webform nodes."
msgstr ""
"Niba ugenzura, gucagura ifishi (form) bizemererwa kuri buri node yo "
"kuri webform."

msgid "Select the theme that will be used to render all shared webforms."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo insanganyamatsiko izakoreshwa mu gutangiza (render) urubuga "
"rwose rw’inyandiko zisangiwe (webforms)."

msgid "Sort the options by their (translated) labels."
msgstr "Shyira urutonde rw’ amahitamo ukurikije amazina yabo (ahinduwe)."

msgid "Share webform variants"
msgstr "Tangira gusangiza amoko y’inyandiko zohererezwa (webform)"

msgid ""
"Provides an element that generates or loads a file that can be "
"attached to a submission or email."
msgstr ""
"Itanga agace gakora cyangwa gakuzamo dosiye ishobora guhererekanywa "
"n’iyoohereza (submission) cyangwa imeyili."

msgid "Share variants"
msgstr "Sangira ibyihindaguriro (variants)"

