msgid "Disable the tracking of user IP address"
msgstr "Kureka gukurikirana aderesi ya IP y’umukoresha"

msgid "Disable the tracking of user IP addresses for all webforms"
msgstr ""
"Hagarika gukurikirana aderesi za IP z’abakoresha kuri formulari zose "
"zo kuri urubuga"

msgid "If checked, a user's IP address will not be recorded for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, aderesi ya IP y’umukoresha ntizajya ifatwa mu "
"buryo bwo kwandika kuri formulaire zose za interineti."

msgid "Webforms for Everyone"
msgstr "Inzira zo kwifashisha (Webforms) kuri buri wese"

msgid ""
"This presentation explores how site owners, site builders, and "
"developers can leverage the Webform module for Drupal 8 to build "
"complex and robust forms for their end-users."
msgstr ""
"Iyi nyigisho ivuga uko ba nyirububasha b’urubuga, abafatanyabikorwa "
"bashyiraho ibikubiye ku rubuga, n’abatekinisiye bashobora gukoresha "
"module ya Webform muri Drupal 8 kugira ngo bakore impapuro/ibyandiko "
"byuzuye kandi bihamye (complex and robust forms) ku baguzi b’iherezo "
"(end-users)."

msgid "Broken/missing webform variant plugin."
msgstr "Plugin ya webform variant iri kubura/yangiritse."

msgid "<code>:htmldecode</code> decodes HTML entities in returned value."
msgstr ""
"<code>:htmldecode</code> ivunikira ama-entities ya HTML muri agaciro "
"kagaruwe."

msgid "Hide the next button when auto-forwarding"
msgstr "Hisha buto ikurikira mugihe wohereza imodoka (auto-forward)"

msgid "Default delete button label"
msgstr "Ubutumwa busanzwe bwo gusiba (delete) buto"

msgid ""
"Check if Webform Clientside Validation module is installed when using "
"the Clientside Validation module"
msgstr ""
"Reba niba modire ya **Webform Clientside Validation** iri yashyizweho "
"igihe ukoresha modire ya **Clientside Validation**."

msgid "Webform: Clientside validation"
msgstr "Urubuga: Validasiyo kuruhande rw’umukiriya"

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module installed."
msgstr "Module ya Webform Clientside Validation yashyizweho."

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module not installed."
msgstr "Ubufasha bwa Webform Clientside Validation ntabwo bwashizweho."

msgid ""
"The Webform Clientside Validation module helps support Webform "
"Clientside Validation integration. <a href=\":href\">Disable Webform "
"Clientside Validation warning</a>"
msgstr ""
"Module ya **Webform Clientside Validation** ifasha gushyigikira ihuzwa "
"rya **Webform Clientside Validation** ku ruhande rw’umukiriya. <a "
"href=\":href\">Kuzimya imenyesha rya Webform Clientside Validation</a>"

msgid "Helps support Webform Clientside Validation integration."
msgstr "Ifasha gushyigikira ihuzwa rya Webform Clientside Validation."

msgid "Show add element button"
msgstr "Erekana buto yo kongeramo ikintu"

msgid "If unchecked, the add button will be removed from each table row."
msgstr ""
"Niba bitagenwe (bitaratoranijwe), buto yo kongeramo izakurwaho mu "
"murongo umwe na umwe wa buri mbonerahamwe."

msgid "If left blank all webforms will be listed in the select menu."
msgstr ""
"Niba usize ubusa, ama webforms yose azagaragara mu rutonde "
"rwatoranyiramo."

msgid ""
"This is displayed after a draft or submission has been saved to the "
"database. The delete button is also included within the submission "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bigaragazwa nyuma y’uko inyandiko itagihindurwa cyangwa "
"yoherejwe ibitswe muri database. Buto yo kuyisiba nayo iba ihari mu "
"makuru y’uko iyi nyandiko yoherejwe."

msgid "Open delete confirmation form in a modal dialog."
msgstr ""
"Fungura urupapuro rwo kwemeza ko ushaka gusiba mu idirishya "
"ry’imbanziriza rihagarikwa (modal)."

msgid "<code>:clear</code> removes the token when it is not replaced."
msgstr "<code>:clear</code> ikuraho ikimenyetso (token) igihe ridakishyirwaho."

msgid "Navigate between cards when the left or right arrow is pressed"
msgstr ""
"Binyuramo hagati ya amakarita iyo watsindiye umuheto w’ibumoso "
"cyangwa ubugororangingo."

msgid "Include submission data"
msgstr "Kongeramo amakuru y’iyoherezwa"

msgid "Display webforms as a top-level item in toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Erekana amafishi y’urubuga (webforms) nk’iyiri kurwego rw’imbere "
"(top-level) mu murongo w’ikoresho (toolbar)"

msgid "Navigate between cards using left or right arrow keys"
msgstr ""
"Hinduranya hagati y’amakarita ukoresheje imikurya y’umuheto "
"ibumoso cyangwa iburyo"

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be able to move between cards using the left or "
"right arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"Niba byagenzuwe, abakoresha bazashobora kwimuka hagati y’ikarita "
"bakoresheje imisambi ibumoso cyangwa iburyo."

msgid ""
"Display Webforms as a top-level administration menu item in the "
"toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Erekana imbonerahamwe y’uturanguranganga (Webforms) nk’iteme "
"ry’ubuyobozi ry’icyiciro cya mbere mu rubaho rw’amahitamo "
"(toolbar)"

msgid ""
"If checked, the Webforms section will be displayed as a top-level "
"administration menu item in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Kiirejejwe, igice cya Webforms kizerekanwa nk’itemu y’ubuyobozi "
"bwo ku rwego rwo hejuru muri toolbar."

msgid ""
"Computing complex or multiple values with or without Ajax can be "
"resource intensive and may have performance implications. When "
"possible try limiting or combining computations or consider using "
"custom Twig functions, JavaScript, or PHP."
msgstr ""
"Gukoramo imibare igoye cyangwa ubusanzwe burebana indangagaciro "
"nyinshi, yaba ikoreshejwe na Ajax cyangwa itari byo, bishobora kuba "
"bisaba umutwaro ukabije ku bikoresho kandi bikagira ingaruka ku "
"mikorere. Iyo bishoboka gerageza kugabanya cyangwa guhuza izo kubara, "
"cyangwa se tekereza gukoresha imikorere yihariye ya Twig, JavaScript, "
"cyangwa PHP."

msgid "Include submission properties"
msgstr "Shyiramo ibiranga kohereza"

msgid "Submitted properties and values are:"
msgstr "Ibintu byatanzwe n’indangagaciro zabyo ni ibi bikurikira:"

msgid "Include submission properties:"
msgstr "Kongeramo ibiranga iyoherezwa:"

msgid "Select the webform that you would like to display in this block."
msgstr "Hitamo urubuga wifuza kwerekana muri iyi block."

msgid "You can also use paragraphs tokens."
msgstr "Urashobora kandi gukoresha itangamirimizo (paragraphs) tokens."

msgid "Submit %title form"
msgstr "Ohereza ifishi ya %title"

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the element is never displayed. The element will only be "
"visible within the form builder and hidden from all other displays "
"including submission details, results, and download."
msgstr ""
"Niba itahinduwe, iyi ngingo ntizigera igaragara. Izagaragara gusa mu "
"mwubatsi w’ifishi (form builder) kandi izihishe mu bindi byose "
"bigaragara, harimo ibisobanuro by’iyoherezwa, ibisubizo, n’igihe "
"cyo gukuramo."

msgid "Webform: jQuery UI Datepicker"
msgstr "Webform: Ukoresha iKoranabuhanga rya jQuery UI Datepicker"

msgid "Form elements attributes"
msgstr "Abirimo biranga (attributes) by’ibikoresho by’ifishi"

msgid "Protect all webforms with Antibot"
msgstr "Kurinda ibipapuro by’urubuga (webforms) byose hakoreshejwe Antibot"

msgid "Provided by the @plugin_id mail plugin."
msgstr "Bihatangwa na plugin ya imeri ya @plugin_id."

msgid ""
"Entered text will be displayed on the handlers administrative page and "
"replace this handler's default description."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa wanditse buzagaragara ku rupapuro rw’ubuyobozi rufite aho "
"abagenzuzi (handlers) bakorerwa kandi bugasimbura ibisobanuro bisanzwe "
"by’uyu muyoboro (handler)."

msgid "Entered text will be displayed on the variants administrative page."
msgstr "Ubutumwa bwanditse buzerekanwa ku ipaji y’ubuyobozi ya variants."

msgid "Provides a form element to collect height in feet and inches."
msgstr ""
"Itanga agace k’imiterere (form) cyo gukusanya uburebure mu birenge "
"(feet) no mu santimetero (inches)."

msgid "Allows users to view the Webform module's help page."
msgstr ""
"Byemerera abakoresha kureba urupapuro rw’inyunganizi (help) "
"rw’ihuzamiterere rya Webform."

msgid "Delete (token) URL"
msgstr "Siba (token) URL"

msgid ""
"The URL that can used to delete the webform submission. The webform "
"must be configured to allow users to delete a submission using a "
"secure token."
msgstr ""
"URL ishobora gukoreshwa mu gusiba iyoherezwa ry’ifishi (webform). "
"Ifishi igomba kuba yagizweho yemera ko abakoresha basiba iyoherezwa "
"bafashijwe na kode yizewe (secure token)."

msgid "Allow deleting a submission using token"
msgstr "Emerera gusiba ukohererezwa ukoresheje token"

msgid ""
"If checked users will be able to delete a submission using the "
"webform's URL appended with the submission's (secure) token."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, abakoresha bashobora gusiba itangwa ukoresheje URL "
"ya webform ihujwe n’ifunguro (token) (ryizewe) ry’itangwa."

msgid ""
"Only webforms that are open to new submissions can be deleted using "
"the secure token."
msgstr ""
"Amafishi y’urubuga (webforms) yonyine yemerewe kwakira ibitekerezo "
"bishya ni yo ashobora gusibwa hifashishijwe itokeni yizewe."

