msgstr "Ishusho inyandiko/src"

msgid "Image text (@value)"
msgstr "Umwandiko w’ishusho (@value)"

msgid "Image src (@value)"
msgstr "Ifoto src (@value)"

msgid "Provides a vertical tabs element."
msgstr ""
"Itanga igikoresho cy’ama-tab atambitse mu buryo buhagaritse "
"(vertical tabs)."

msgid "State (Name)"
msgstr "Rya Leta (Izina)"

msgid ""
"The state of the webform submission. (unsaved, draft, completed, "
"updated, locked, or converted)"
msgstr ""
"Imiterere y’iyoherezwa ry’urubuga (webform) (ritarabikwa, "
"inyandiko ifite ingingo zateguwe, ryarangiye, rirasubiwemo "
"(rwaravuguruwe), rufunzwe, cyangwa rwayahinduwe)"

msgid "State (Label)"
msgstr "Ijambo (Amazina)"

msgid ""
"The state raw value untranslated of the webform submission. (Unsaved, "
"Draft, Completed, Updated, Locked, or Converted)"
msgstr ""
"Agaciro gakce kitarahinduwe k’uko kohereza ifishi (webform) "
"byabitswe. (Itabitswe, Ikinyandiko kigitegereje, Byarangiye, "
"Byavuguruwe, Byafunzwe, cyangwa Byahinduwe)"

msgid "The phone number is not valid. (e.g. @example)"
msgstr "Nimero ya telefone ntabwo ifite agaciro. (urugero: @example)"

msgid "Default wizard/cards end label"
msgstr "Label y’iherezo ry’imbanzirizamushinga/karita zisanzwe"

msgid "Please note, the date picker will disable unchecked days of the week."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka menya ko guhitamo itariki bizahagarika iminsi yo mu cyumweru "
"itagenwe."

msgid "Delete this @item?"
msgid_plural "Delete these @items?"
msgstr[0] "Siba iyi @item?"
msgstr[1] "Siba izi @items?"

