msgid "Submit the sitemap to search engines."
msgstr "Ohereza ihuzabikorwa ry’urubuga (sitemap) ku mbuga zishakisha."

msgid "Default priority"
msgstr "Ubukuru busanzwe (priority)"

msgid "Indexed"
msgstr "Biteganyijwe mu ndangurangero (indexed)"

msgid "Minimum sitemap lifetime"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa urubuga rw’imapu (sitemap) rukomeza kubaho"

msgid "No minimum"
msgstr "Nta ntarengwa ribagishijeho"

msgid "Number of links in each sitemap page"
msgstr "Umubare w’inguge (links) kuri buri ipaji yo muri sitemap"

msgid "Maximum number of sitemap links to process at once"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w’ibihuha by’amasitemap byo gutunganya icyarimwe"

msgid ""
"If you have problems running cron or rebuilding the sitemap, you may "
"want to lower this value."
msgstr ""
"Niba ufite ibibazo byo gukora cron cyangwa kongera kubaka sitemap, "
"ushobora kuba ushaka kugabanya iyi gaciro."

msgid "Sitemap cache directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bwa cache ya sitemap"

msgid "Invalid base URL."
msgstr "URL ntiboneye."

msgid "Your sitemap is up to date and does not need to be rebuilt."
msgstr ""
"Maherakokorwa yawe (sitemap) agezweho kandi ntakeneye gusubirwamo "
"kubakwa."

msgid "The priority of this URL relative to other URLs on your site."
msgstr ""
"Icyo URL iyi ifite mu rwego rwo kurusha izindi URL ziri ku rubuga "
"rwawe."

msgid "Default (@value)"
msgstr "Par défaut (@value)"

msgid "Rebuilding Sitemap"
msgstr "Kongera kubaka Sitemap"

msgid "Click on the table headers to change sorting."
msgstr "Kanda ku imitwe y’imbonerahamwe kugirango uhindure uko itondekwa."

msgid "Path to link"
msgstr "Inzira y’aho ihuza igana"

msgid "There is already an existing link in the sitemap with the path %link."
msgstr "Harisanzwe hariho ihuza rihari kuri sitemap rifite inzira %link."

msgid "The custom link for %loc was saved."
msgstr "Uhuza rukoreshwa ku buryo bwihariye kuri %loc rwakuweho (rwasigiwe)."

msgid "The custom link for %loc has been deleted."
msgstr "Ihuza rihariye (custom link) ry’abahariye %loc ryasibwe."

msgid "Adds user configurable links to the sitemap."
msgstr "Yongera amahuza ashobora gutegurwa n’ukoresha kuri sitemapu."

msgid "Submit the sitemap to the following engines"
msgstr "Ohereza sitemap kuri moteri zikurikira"

msgid "Do not submit more often than every"
msgstr "Ntukohereze kenshi kuruta buri"

msgid "Only submit if the sitemap has been updated since the last submission."
msgstr "Ohereza gusa iyo sitemap imaze kuvugururwa kuva mu kohereza kwa nyuma."

msgid "Custom submission URLs"
msgstr "Aderesi z’ubwo kohereza (submission) ukoresheje ibyo wahisemo"

msgid "Submitted the sitemap to %url and received response @code."
msgstr "Yashyikirije sitemap kuri %url maze ahabwa igisubizo @code."

msgid "Search Engines"
msgstr "Imashini zishakisha"

msgid "Automatic (recommended)"
msgstr "Byikora (byemewe)"

msgid "(highest)"
msgstr "(iby’ingenzi kurusha ibindi)"

msgid "(normal)"
msgstr "(bisanzwe)"

msgid "(lowest)"
msgstr "(imo hasi cyane)"

msgid "Please increase the number of links per page."
msgstr "Ndashaka ko wongera umubare w’insores/links kuri buri ipaji."

msgid "Include a stylesheet in the sitemaps for humans."
msgstr "Shyiramo stylesheet muri sitemaps hagamijwe abantu."

msgid "Save and restore any custom inclusion and priority links."
msgstr ""
"Bika kandi usubize byimazeyo ibyo guhuza (inclusion) byawe byose "
"n’ibihuza byashyizwe ku rwego rwo hejuru (priority)."

msgid "Inclusion: @value"
msgstr "Kwinjiza: @value"

msgid "Priority: @value"
msgstr "Icyo mbere: @value"

msgid ""
"Changing these type settings will affect any items of this type that "
"have either inclusion or priority set to default."
msgstr ""
"Guhindura aya makwirandira y’ubu bwoko bizagira ingaruka ku bintu "
"byose by’ubu bwoko bifite iyinjizamo (inclusion) cyangwa ingaruka "
"(priority) byashyizwe kuri default."

msgid ""
"How frequently the page is likely to change. This value provides "
"general information to search engines and may not correlate exactly to "
"how often they crawl the page."
msgstr ""
"Uko urupapuro rishobora guhinduka kenshi. Iri banga ritanga amakuru "
"rusange ku bushakashatsi bwa moteri kandi rishobora kutahuza neza "
"n’uko zihuta gusikana uru rupapuro kenshi."

msgid "The directory %directory does not exist or is not writable."
msgstr "Icyerekezo %directory ntikirabaho cyangwa ntigishobora kwandikirwamo."

msgid "Select which link types you would like to rebuild"
msgstr "Hitamo ubwoko bw’ingingo (link) ushaka kongera kubaka"

msgid ""
"If no link types are selected, the sitemap files will just be "
"regenerated."
msgstr ""
"Niba nta bwoko bw’insamanza (link types) bwatoranyijwe, dosiye zo "
"kuri sitemap zizongera gukorwa gusa."

msgid ""
"Check the <a href=\"@status-report\">status report</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Reba <a href=\"@status-report\">raporo y’imimerere</a> kugira ngo "
"ubone andi makuru."

msgid "Last modification date format"
msgstr "Imiterere y’itariki yo guhindurwa bwa nyuma"

msgid "Enable developer mode to expose additional settings."
msgstr ""
"Koresha uburyo bwihariye bw’abatezimbere (developer mode) kugira ngo "
"ushobore kugaragaza ibindi bikoresho (settings) byiyongera."

msgid ""
"Enter one URL per line. The token [sitemap] will be replaced with the "
"URL to your sitemap. For example: %example-before would become "
"%example-after."
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo URL imwe kuri buri murongo. Ikimenyetso [sitemap] "
"kizasimburwa na URL iriho sitemap yawe. Kurugero: %example-before "
"byahinduka %example-after."

msgid "Invalid URL %url."
msgstr "URL idakwiye %url."

msgid "Prefetch URL aliases during sitemap generation."
msgstr "Banza ubone alias za URL mu gihe cyo kubyara sitemap."

msgid ""
"If there are problems with rebuilding the sitemap, you may want to "
"manually set this value. If you have more than @max links, an index "
"with multiple sitemap pages will be generated. There is a maximum of "
"@max sitemap pages."
msgstr ""
"Niba hari ibibazo mu gusubiramo kubaka sitema, ushobora gukenera "
"kubanza gushyiraho iyi ndangagaciro ku buryo bw’intoki. Niba ufite "
"urutonde ruruta @max rw’inland za links, hazaboneka index ifite "
"impapuro nyinshi za sitema. Hariho umubare ntarengwa wa @max "
"w’impapuro za sitema."

msgid "This is the default base URL used for sitemaps and sitemap links."
msgstr ""
"Uru ni rwo URL shingiro (base URL) rusanzwe rukoreshwa ku mamephu "
"y’urubuga (sitemaps) no ku binyungo bya sitemap."

msgid "Regenerating Sitemap"
msgstr "Irimo gusubiramo Sitemap"

msgid "Update cached files"
msgstr "Kuvugurura dosiye zibitswe (cache)"

msgid "Rebuild links"
msgstr "Ongera wubake imihuza"

msgid "Submit to search engines"
msgstr "Ohereza kuri moteri zishakisha"

msgid "The sitemaps were not successfully regenerated."
msgstr "Imepapuro zo kurandurira urubuga (sitemaps) ntizongeye kubyara neza."

msgid "The sitemap links were rebuilt."
msgstr "Ihuza za sitemapu byongeye kubakwa."

msgid "The sitemap links were not successfully rebuilt."
msgstr "Amalinki yo mu mbuga ya site (sitemap) ntiyabashije kongera gushingwa."

msgid ""
"The front page path can be changed in the <a "
"href=\"@url-frontpage\">site information configuration</a>."
msgstr ""
"Inzira y’urupapuro rw’imbere ishobora guhindurwa muri <a "
"href=\"@url-frontpage\">igenamiterere ry’amakuru y’urubuga</a>."

msgid "Delete custom link"
msgstr "Siba ihuza ryihariye"

msgid ""
"When enabled, this will fetch all URL aliases at once instead of one "
"at a time during sitemap generation. For medium or large sites, it is "
"recommended to disable this feature as it uses a lot of memory."
msgstr ""
"Iyo byabonetse, ibi bizafata indangamazwa zose za URL icyarimwe aho "
"gufata imwe imwe mu gihe cyo kubyara sitemap. Ku rubuga ruto rwinshi "
"cyangwa rurerure, birasabwa kuzimya iyi mikorere kuko ikoreshwa cyane "
"muri memory."

msgid "Disable cron generation of sitemap files."
msgstr "Hagarika kurema dosiye za sitemapi ukoresheje cron."

msgid "Sitemap settings"
msgstr "Amazautiro ya sitemap"

msgid "Select the frequency of changes."
msgstr "Hitamo inshuro impinduka zikorerwamo."

msgid "Default change frequency"
msgstr "Impinduka zisanzwe zikorwa kenshi (default)"

msgid "Custom Entities Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’amadosiye yihariye (Custom Entities)"

msgid "Check XSL functionality"
msgstr "Reba niba imikorere ya XSL ikora neza"

msgid "Decide to prefetch aliases"
msgstr "Hitamo kubanza kwinjiza (prefetch) ama-aliases"

msgid "Set chunk size"
msgstr "Shyiraho ingano y’icyiciro (chunk)."

