msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Ubuhinduzi"

msgid "A locally hosted document, such as a PDF file."
msgstr "Inyandiko ikorerwa aho iherereye, urugero nk’ifaili ya PDF."

msgid "A locally hosted image file."
msgstr "Ifoto ibikwa kuri seriveri yaho (localhost)."

msgid "A video hosted on an external site (for example, YouTube or Vimeo)."
msgstr "Video iri ku rubuga rw’inyongera (urugero, YouTube cyangwa Vimeo)."

msgid "Webform submission operations bulk form"
msgstr ""
"Ibyakozwe ku ifishi rusange (bulk) yo kohereza ibyemezo by’ifishi "
"(webform)"

msgid "Enable hoverIntent"
msgstr "Kwagura hoverIntent"

msgid ""
"Provides a workaround for the common problem that users with 'Use the "
"administration pages and help' permission see menu links they don't "
"have access permission for. Deprecated from Drupal 10.3 and above."
msgstr ""
"Itanga igisubizo gihindura ibintu (workaround) ku kibazo gisanzwe "
"abahawe uruhushya rwa “Koresha impapuro z’ubuyobozi na ubufasha” "
"(Use the administration pages and help) bahura nacyo, aho babonera "
"kuri menu amahuza badafite uburenganzira bwo kuyabona. Byahagaritswe "
"guhera muri Drupal 10.3 n’izirengeje."

msgid "Admin Toolbar Search (Alt+a)"
msgstr "Gushakisha kuri Admin Toolbar (Alt+a)"

msgid "Enable keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Gushoboza inzira ngufi ukoresheje clavier"

msgid "Enable keyboard shortcut (Alt + a)"
msgstr "Gushoboza inzira ngufi ukoresheje clavier (Alt + a)"

msgid "Enable toggle toolbar keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "Gushoboza inzira ngufi ukoresheje clavier (toggle toolbar)"

msgid "hoverIntent behavior"
msgstr "imyitwarire ya hoverIntent"

msgid "hoverIntent timeout"
msgstr "Igihe cyo gutegereza hoverIntent kirangira"

msgid "Hide Toolbar (Alt+p)"
msgstr "Hisha Toolbar (Alt+p)"

msgid "Toolbar sticky behavior"
msgstr "Imyitwarire yihagarara ya toolbar"

msgid "Toolbar hoverIntent behavior"
msgstr "Imyitwarire ya hoverIntent ya toolbar"

msgid "hoverIntent timeout (ms)"
msgstr "igihe cyo gutegereza hoverIntent (mili-segondi)"

msgid "Maximum depth of displayed nested menu items."
msgstr ""
"Ubuimbitse ntarengwa bw’urutonde rw’imenyu rucukura (nested) "
"rwerekanwa."

msgid "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"

msgid ""
"The features of the <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> module "
"are included in Drupal core since version 10.3 and therefore "
"<strong>it should be uninstalled</strong>.<br>Since the module is no "
"longer needed, it <em>will</em> be removed in future releases of "
"<em>Admin Toolbar</em> when support for versions lower than 10.3 is "
"dropped.<br>\n"
"See issues: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> and <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ibiranga module ya <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> "
"byashyizwemo muri Drupal core guhera ku buryo bwa 10.3, bityo "
"<strong>igomba gukurwaho</strong>.<br>Uko module itagikenewe, "
"<em>bizakorwa ko</em> ikurwamo mu bice bizaza bya <em>Admin "
"Toolbar</em> igihe ubufasha ku verisiyo ziri munsi ya 10.3 buzaba "
"bwarahagaritswe.<br>\n"
"Reba ibibazo: <a "
"href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> na <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."

msgid ""
"If set, the search input will be focused when the user presses the "
"keys: \"Alt + a\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with any "
"existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, igice cyo gushakisha kizajya kugaragara "
"(gukorerwaho) iyo umukoresha akande urufunguzo: “Alt + "
"a”.<br>Zimya iyi igenamiterere niba ibuza/itabangamiye indi "
"igenamiterere y’imfunguzo ihari."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module provides a better user experience for the "
"default Drupal Toolbar.<br>It is a drop-down menu that allows quicker "
"access to all the administration pages in a more efficient way, with "
"fewer clicks and less scrolling.<br><br>The following settings mostly "
"provide advanced configuration of the JavaScript behavior of the "
"Toolbar sticky and hoverIntent."
msgstr ""
"Ukoresha “Admin Toolbar” itanga uburambe bwiza bwabakoresha kuri "
"“Drupal Toolbar” isanzwe.<br>Ni menu yamanuka igufasha kugera vuba "
"ku mipaji yose yo kuyobora (administration) mu buryo bugezweho kandi "
"bunoze, ku bikoresho bike (clicks) no ku kuganziriza hasi (scrolling) "
"bike.<br><br>Amahinduka akurikira ahanini atanga iboneza rihambaye "
"(advanced) ry’imyitwarire ya JavaScript y’igitabya (Toolbar) "
"gihoraho (sticky) n’uburyo bwo kunaniza ku-kwimenyekanisha "
"(hoverIntent)."

msgid ""
"By default, the Admin Toolbar sticky behavior is <em>enabled</em> so "
"it stays at the top of the browser window when scrolling up or "
"down.<br>Select <em>Disabled</em> to disable Admin Toolbar's sticky "
"behavior so it stays at the top of the page when scrolling up/down and "
"does not follow the browser window."
msgstr ""
"Mburabuzi, imikorere ya Admin Toolbar yo gukomera ku mwanya "
"(<em>sticky</em>) irahari, bityo igakomeza kuba hejuru y’idirishya "
"ry’umusakatuli igihe uhagurukira hejuru cyangwa ushuka hasi.<br "
"Hitamo <em>Disabled</em> kugira ngo uhagarike iyo mikoreshereze ya "
"Admin Toolbar ikomera ku mwanya, bityo ikomeze kuba hejuru "
"y’urupapuro gusa igihe uhagurukira hejuru/hasi kandi itakurikira "
"idirishya ry’umusakatuli."

msgid ""
"If set, the toolbar will be hidden or visible when the user presses "
"the keys: \"Alt + p\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with "
"any existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, igikoresho cyo hejuru kizihishwa cyangwa kigaragare "
"iyo umukoresha akanda urufunguzo: “Alt + p”.<brHagarika iyi "
"nyongera niba ihura n’imisobekere y’ibikoresho by’imikongo "
"(keyboard) isanzweho."

msgid ""
"Provides a smoother user experience, where only menu items which are "
"paused over are expanded, to avoid accidental activations.<br>Disable "
"@hoverintent_source_link to use module's default basic JavaScript "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Iha umukoresha uburambe bunoze kurushaho, aho menu item ziguka gusa "
"iyo zihinduwe hejuru (zibaguwe), kugirango hirindwe ibikorwa "
"bidasohoka ku buryo butunguranye.<br>Zimya @hoverintent_source_link "
"kugira ngo ukoreshe imyitwarire y’ibanze ya JavaScript biza bisanzwe "
"muri iri module."

msgid ""
"Sets the hoverIntent trigger timeout (steps of 250).<br>The higher the "
"value, the longer the menu dropdown stays visible, after the mouse "
"moves out (default: 500ms)."
msgstr ""
"Igena igihe cyo gutangiriraho hoverIntent (ku gipimo cya "
"250).<br>Birenzeho agaciro ni bwo menu imanuka ikomeza kugaragara "
"igihe kirekire, iyo imbeba imaze kuva hejuru yayo (ibisanzwe: 500ms)."

msgid "CKEditor Anchor Link"
msgstr "CKEditor Ihuza ryerekeza (Anchor Link)"

msgid "CKEditor Web link"
msgstr "CKEditor Ihuza ryo kuri urubuga"

msgid ""
"This plugin module adds the better link dialog and anchor related "
"features to CKEditor in Drupal 9"
msgstr ""
"Iyi module ya plugin yongeza idiyalogi y’imbogamizi y’imyandikire "
"ishyizeho link ukoresheje neza ndetse n’ibikorwa bijyanye na anchor "
"kuri CKEditor muri Drupal 9."

msgid "#@anchor_link"
msgstr "#@anchor_link"

msgid "Anchor links (within the same page)"
msgstr "Aho ihuza (muri iyi page imwe)"

msgid "CKEditor Anchor link"
msgstr "CKEditor ihuza rihambira kuri anchor"

msgid "Add a note to the backup"
msgstr "Ongeraho inoti kuri backup"

msgid "was due @time ago"
msgstr "byabayeho mbere @time"

msgid "Created the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Byakozwe Ibyahinduwe by’inyongera rya %label."

msgid "Saved the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Byabitswe Umwirondoro w’Ibigenamiterere %label."

msgid "Label for the Backup Source."
msgstr "Amazina (label) y’aho haporwa ububiko (backup source)."

msgid ""
"%title must contain only letters, numbers, dashes (-) and underscores "
"(_). And Site Tokens."
msgstr ""
"%title igomba kuba ikubiyemo gusa inyuguti, imibare, imikuku mito "
"ihuza (-) n’amanota yo hasi (_). Na Site Tokens."

msgid "Use <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP Date formatting</a>."
msgstr ""
"Koresha <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">imikoreshereze yo gutegura "
"amatariki muri PHP</a>."

msgid "Label for the Backup Destination."
msgstr "Ibiranga aho Ububiko (Backup) buhunikirwa."

msgid ""
"The number of backups to retain. Once this number is reached, the "
"oldest backup will be deleted to make room for the most recent backup. "
"Leave blank to keep all backups."
msgstr ""
"Umubare w’ibikopi byabikwa kugumaho. Iyo uwo mubare umaze kugerwaho, "
"kopi ya kera cyane izahanagurwa kugira ngo haboneke umwanya w’ikopi "
"iheruka. Muyeho ubusa kugira ngo bikopi zose zigumane."

msgid ""
"In order to encrypt backup files, please install the Defuse "
"PHP-encryption library via Composer with the following command: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. See the <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption Documentation Page</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ubashe gushakira dosiye z’inyuma (backup) ibanga, "
"nyamuneka shyiraho isomero rya Defuse PHP-encryption ukoresheje "
"Composer hamwe n’iri tegeko rikurikira: <code>composer require "
"defuse/php-encryption</code>. Reba <a href=\"@docs\">Urupapuro rwa "
"Dokumantasi ya Defuse PHP Encryption</a> kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro "
"birambuye."

msgid "All backups"
msgstr "Aho abakopi b’inyuma bose babikwa"

msgid "Restore completed at @time"
msgstr "Kugarura byarangiye kuri @time"

msgid "Schedules Tab"
msgstr "Aba Bagenzura (Schedules)"

msgid "Download Backup"
msgstr "Kuramo Backup"

msgid "Choose the backup source."
msgstr "Hitamo isoko ryo gufata backup."

msgid "Choose the backup settings profile."
msgstr "Hitamo igenamiterere ry’inyandiko y’ububiko (backup profile)."

msgid "Choose the destination."
msgstr "Hitamo aho ujya."

msgid "Choose the schedule backup you want to run."
msgstr "Hitamo gahunda y’inyandiko zibikuzo (backup) ushaka gukora."

msgid "Backup finished with failure"
msgstr "Icyabitswe kirangiye gitanze intsinzi"

msgid "Exception Message: "
msgstr "Ubutumwa bw’Ikosa:"

msgid ""
"The Backup Destination \"Download\" does not support taking the site "
"offline during backup."
msgstr ""
"Ahantu h’ububiko bw’ikigega “Download” ntibushobora gufata "
"urubuga ruri offline mu gihe cy’ububiko."

msgid ""
"Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status "
"report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as "
"updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr ""
"Bika imibare ijyanye na CAPTCHA muri <a href=\":statusreport\">raporo "
"y’imimerere</a>. Menya ko ibi biza bifite igihombo cy’imikorere, "
"kuko kuvugurura iyo mibare bituma bisubiramo guhanagura cache "
"y’impinduka."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module interacts with page caching (see <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">performance settings</a>). Because the "
"challenge should be unique for each generated form, the caching of the "
"page it appears on is prevented. Make sure that these forms do not "
"appear on too many pages or you will lose much caching efficiency. For "
"example, if you put a CAPTCHA on the user login block, which typically "
"appears on each page for anonymous visitors, caching will practically "
"be disabled. The comment submission forms are another example. In this "
"case you should set the <em>Location of comment submission form</em> "
"to <em>Display on separate page</em> in the comment settings of the "
"relevant <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> for better "
"caching efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Wibuke ko modire ya CAPTCHA ihuza na cache yo ku ipaji (reba <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">imiterere ya performance</a>). Kubera ko "
"ikibazo kigomba kuba kidasubirwamo kuri buri fomu itegurwa, kubika "
"(caching) kw’iyo ipaji igaragaramo birabujijwe. Menya neza ko izi "
"fomu zitagaragara ku mpapuro nyinshi cyane kuko ibyo byagabanya cyane "
"ubushobozi bwa caching. Urugero: niba ushyize CAPTCHA ku blok yo "
"kwinjira kw’umukoresha (user login), iboneka hafi ya ku ipaji zose "
"ku maneko (anonymous visitors), caching izaba itabaye cyangwa hafi yo "
"kuburara. Utundi ni urugero rwa fomu zo kohereza ibitekerezo. Muri "
"icyo gihe, ugomba gushyiraho <em>Ahakorerwa fomu yo kohereza "
"ibitekerezo</em> kuri <em>Kwerekana ku ipaji itandukanye</em> mu "
"igenamiterere ry’ibitekerezo (comment settings) rya <a "
"href=\":contenttypes\">ubwoko bw’ibirimo</a> bwihariye, kugira ngo "
"caching ibe ingirakamaro kurushaho."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">permission</a> "
"won't be offered a challenge. Be sure to grant this permission to the "
"trusted users (e.g. site administrators). If you want to test a "
"protected form, be sure to do it as a user without the <em>Skip "
"CAPTCHA</em> permission (e.g. as anonymous user)."
msgstr ""
"Abakoresha bafite uruhushya rwa <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a "
"href=\":perm\">bazemererwa</a> ntibazahabwa ikibazo cyo kubapima. "
"Menya neza ko uha iri ryoshywa abizewe (urugero, abashinzwe "
"imbuga/abategetsi b’urubuga). Niba ushaka kugerageza ifishi irinzwe, "
"menya neza ko uyigerageza nk’uko wabigenza nk’umukoresha udafite "
"uruhushya rwa <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> (urugero, nk’umukoresha utazwi)."

msgid ""
"CAPTCHA session reuse attack detected on @form_id <br/>Posted CAPTCHA "
"token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Expected captcha token: "
"@expected_captcha_token"
msgstr ""
"Byamenyekanye ko hakozwe igikorwa cyo kongera gukoresha CAPTCHA "
"session kuri @form_id <br/>Ikimenyetso (token) cya CAPTCHA cyoherejwe: "
"@posted_captcha_token <br/>Ikimenyetso (token) cya CAPTCHA cyari "
"gitegerejwe: @expected_captcha_token"

msgid ""
"%form_id post blocked by CAPTCHA module: challenge %challenge (by "
"module %module)."
msgstr ""
"%form_id yatewe guhagarikwa na module ya CAPTCHA: %challenge (n’iyo "
"module %module)."

msgid ""
"Configurable error message that the user gets when it enters an "
"incorrect CAPTCHA answer."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bw’ikosa bushobora guhinduka iboneka ku ukoresha iyo "
"yanditse ibisubizo bitari byo bya CAPTCHA."

msgid ""
"Lower and upper IP addresses should be different. Please correct range "
"%ip_range."
msgstr ""
"Aderesi za IP zo hasi n’iz’hejuru zigomba gutandukana. "
"Nyamunekaosore range %ip_range."

msgid ""
"A CAPTCHA can be added to virtually any Drupal form, through adding an "
"affiliated <em>CAPTCHA Point</em>. Some default <em>CAPTCHA "
"Points</em> are already provided in the <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> "
"section, but arbitrary forms can be easily added and managed."
msgstr ""
"CAPTCHA ishobora kongerwa hafi kuri fomu iyo ari yo yose yo muri "
"Drupal, ukoresheje kongerera <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> ihagazeho. Hariho "
"<em>CAPTCHA Points</em> zimwe na zimwe zishingiyeho zahawe imaze "
"gutangwa mu gice cya <em>CAPTCHA Point</em>, ariko hakorwamo "
"n’ifishi zihitirwa (zitumvikana) zishobora kongerwa byoroshye kandi "
"bigacungwa."

msgid ""
"Enter one IP-address per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. "
"Alternatively you can also define IP-address ranges per row in the "
"format XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. No spaces allowed. Your "
"current IP address is %ip_address."
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo aderesi imwe ya IP ku murongo ukoresheje urwo rwego "
"XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. Uretse ibyo, ushobora no gusobanura indangururizo "
"(ranges) za IP kuri buri murongo ukoresheje urwo rwego "
"XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. Nta mwanya wemerewe. Aderesi ya IP "
"uriho ubu ni %ip_address."

msgid "Reload Captcha"
msgstr "Subiramo Captcha"

msgid "Overlay close"
msgstr "Funga agapfukamunwa"

msgid "Custom (with tokens)"
msgstr "Bihariye (bikoresheje inyuguti zihimbwa: tokens)"

msgid ""
"For token support the <a href=\"@token_url\">token module</a> must be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo hifashishwe token bisaba ko hashizwemo <a "
"href=\"@token_url\">module ya token</a>."

msgid "Plain (mainly for images)"
msgstr "Bigoramye risobanutse (cyane cyane ku mafoto)"

msgid "Enable closing Colorbox by clicking on the background overlay."
msgstr "Gushoboza gufunga Colorbox uko ukanda kuri overlay iri inyuma."

msgid ""
"If the Colorbox should be displayed in a fixed position within the "
"visitor's viewport or relative to the document."
msgstr ""
"Niba Colorbox igomba kwerekanwa ifite umwanya uhagaze imbere mu "
"burebure bw’uburebure bw’urubuga rw’umushyitsi (viewport) "
"cyangwa ikurikire inyandiko."

msgid "Mobile detection"
msgstr "Gusuzuma ibikoresho bikoreshwa kuri terefone zigendanwa"

