msgstr "Akalabarwa ka DOMPurify"

msgid "DOMPurify is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr "DOMPurify isanzwe iri kuri @path. Nta gukuramo bikenewe."

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the DOMPurify library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush ntiyashoboye gukuramo ikayi rya DOMPurify riva kuri @remote. "
"@exception"

msgid "Error: unable to unzip DOMPurify file."
msgstr "Icyitonderwa: ntibyashobotse gukuramo dosiye ya DOMPurify."

msgid "The DOMPurify library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr "Igitapo cya DOMPurify cyaroherejwe neza kuri @path."

msgid "Drush was unable to load the DOMPurify library"
msgstr "Drush ntiyashoboye gupakurura laibulali ya DOMPurify"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is not installed. The Colorbox module uses this "
"library to sanitize HTML captions. Without this library, all captions "
"will be treated as plain text. If you intend to have HTML captions in "
"Colorbox content, download the <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, "
"extract it, and copy the dist directory into the /libraries/DOMPurify "
"folder in your Drupal installation directory. Specifically, the system "
"looks for /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> To "
"avoid potential security issues, please only install the dist "
"directory, and not any other files from the archive.<br /><br /> If "
"you do not intend to use HTML captions, you can suppress this warning "
"on the <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox configuration page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Igitapo cyitwa **DOMPurify** ntabwo cyashyizweho. Ubugenzuzi bwa "
"**Colorbox** bukoresha iyi library mu kweza (sanitizing) inyandiko "
"zishyirwa mu nyandiko (HTML captions). Hatabaho iyi library, "
"ibisobanuro byose bizafatwa nk’inyandiko isanzwe (plain text). Niba "
"ushaka kugira **HTML captions** mu byo ugaragaza muri Colorbox, kura "
"<a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, uyikuremo (extract), hanyuma "
"uhitemo ububiko bwa **dist** ugisubiremo muri dosiye ya "
"**/libraries/DOMPurify** iri mu bushakashatsi bwa Drupal ufite. "
"By’umwihariko, sisitemu ishakisha ku buryo bukurikira: "
"**/libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js**. <br /><br /> Kugira ngo "
"wirinde ibibazo bishobora kubyutsa umutekano, nyamuneka shyiraho "
"**ububiko bwa dist** gusa, ntukayishyiremo andi dosiye zose ziri muri "
"archive.<br /><br /> Niba utateganya gukoresha **HTML captions**, "
"ushobora guhagarika iyi nyandiko igezweho (warning) kuri <a "
"href=\"@config\">urupapuro rw’imyirondoro (configuration) ya "
"Colorbox.</a>"

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is installed. This library will sanitize HTML in "
"Colorbox captions."
msgstr ""
"Ubu rusomero **DOMPurify** rwarashyizweho. Uru rusomero ruzakuraho "
"(rusemese) amakuru ya HTML ari mu nyandiko (caption) za **Colorbox**."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> library is not "
"installed. This library is necessary if you want to use HTML in "
"Colorbox captions. Without it, all captions will be treated as plain "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Ibyohereza <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> ntabwo "
"byashyizweho. Iyi librari irakenewe iyo ushaka gukoresha HTML mu "
"nyandiko (captions) za Colorbox. Iyo itabipo, caption zose zizafatwa "
"nk’inyandiko zisanzwe (plain text)."

msgid ""
"By default, a warning appears on Drupal's status report if this "
"library is missing. Check this box to suppress the warning."
msgstr ""
"Mubisanzwe, ubutumwa bw’ihanura bugaragara kuri raporo y’imimerere "
"ya Drupal iyo iyi librari ibuze. Tiki iyi checkbox ngo wirinde iryo "
"hanura."

