msgstr "Imiterere y’ishusho y’inyandiko ihinduka: Ishusho y’umwimerere"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: @style"
msgstr "Uburyo bw’ishusho ya responsive muri Colorbox: @style"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: Original image"
msgstr ""
"Imiterere y’ishusho irahuzwa (responsive) muri Colorbox: Ishusho "
"y’umwimerere"

msgid "Colorbox Responsive"
msgstr "Colorbox ihuza na responsivite"

msgid ""
"If On (default), Colorbox will add a unique per-request token to the "
"gallery id to avoid images being added manually to galleries. The "
"token was added as a security fix but some see the old behavior as an "
"feature and this settings makes it possible to remove the token."
msgstr ""
"Niba UMWANA (mbisanzwe), Colorbox izongeramo ikimenyetso kidasubirwaho "
"buri cyasohokeshwa (token) ku id ya gallery kugira ngo amashusho "
"atongerwa mu ntoki atinjira muri ayo ma-galeries. Icyo kimenyetso "
"cyongeweho nk’uko byari byitezweho kurengera umutekano, ariko bamwe "
"babibona nk’ihinduka ryari ririho mbere (feature), kandi iyi "
"igenamiterere ituma bishoboka gukuraho icyo kimenyetso."

