msgstr "Colorbox (uburyo bwo kureba)"

msgid "Config Ignore"
msgstr "Ibirengagiza Igenamigambi"

msgid "Config Ignore Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo Kwirengagiza Iboneza"

msgid "List of ignored configurations"
msgstr "Urutonde rw’igenamiterere zihannwe"

msgid "Configuration entity names to ignore"
msgstr "Amazina y’ibice byashyizwe mu igenamiterere byo kwirengagizwa"

msgid "Mode of operation"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukora"

msgid "Configuration Ignore settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo kwirengagiza ibyo ukoresha"

msgid "Ignore certain configuration during imports and exports"
msgstr "Irengagize zimwe igenamiterere mugihe cyo gutumiza no kohereza amakuru"

msgid "Operational mode"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukora"

msgid "lists for import and export ignoring"
msgstr "urutonde rwo gutumiza no kohereza wirengagije"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on import"
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rwa igenamiterere rihuzagurika rirengagijwe mu gihe cyo "
"kubivana muri dosiye"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on export"
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rwa porogaramu z’imiterere (configurations) zirengagijwe mu "
"kohereza (export)"

msgid "Settings for advanced ignoring"
msgstr "Amasaziro yo kwirengagiza byateye imbere"

msgid "List of created ignored configurations"
msgstr "Urutonde rw’igenamiterere byirengagijwe byakozwe"

msgid "List of updated ignored configurations"
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rw’igenamiterere ryavuzweho kwirengagizwa ryongeweho "
"cyangwa rihinduwe"

msgid "List of deleted ignored configurations"
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rwimiterere (configurations) byasibwe byari bimeze nk’aho "
"byirengagijwe"

msgid ""
"This setting controls how complicated the configuration is. If you do "
"not have a use-case for a more advanced set-up the recommendation is "
"to keep it simple."
msgstr ""
"Iyi ntangiriro igenzura uko iboneza rigira urwego ruri hejuru cyangwa "
"ruke rw’ubuhahirane. Niba udafite impamvu yo gukoresha uburyo "
"buhanitse kurushaho, inama ni ukugumana ibyoroshye."

msgid "The configuration ignored in all cases"
msgstr "Uboneza ryirengagijwe igihe cyose"

msgid ""
"One configuration name per line.<br />\n"
"Examples: "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>webform.webform</em>)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> like fields attached to "
"a custom contact form)</li>\n"
"<li>* (will ignore "
"everything)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (will force import for "
"this configuration, even if ignored by a "
"wildcard)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(will ignore the body of the no approval required email setting, but "
"will not ignore other user.mail "
"configuration.)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (will ignore all language "
"collections)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* (will ignore all fr language "
"collection)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* (will ignore all fr "
"field "
"translations)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(will force import for certain field "
"translation)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (will ignore just "
"the site name but in all translations)</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"Izina rimwe rya dosiye rihamye ku murongo umwe.<br />\n"
"Ingero: "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(bizirengagiza ubundi bwoko bwose bwa config entity bwose butangira na "
"<em>webform.webform</em>)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* "
"(bizirengagiza ubundi bwoko bwose bwa config entity butangira na "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> nka field zometse kuri "
"contact form yihariye)</li>\n"
"<li>* (bizirengagiza "
"byose)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (bizahatira gutumiza iyi "
"configuration, nubwo byaba byirengagijwe n’inyuguti igenga "
"wildcard)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(bizirengagiza umubiri (body) w’itegeko/imeri rya “no approval "
"required”, ariko ntibizirengagize izindi configuration za "
"user.mail.)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (bizirengagiza collections zose "
"z’ururimi)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* (bizirengagiza collections zose "
"z’ururimi rwa fr)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* "
"(bizirengagiza translations zose z’ama field za "
"fr)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(bizahatira gutumiza kuri izi translation zimwe zifitanye isano na "
"field)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (bizirengagiza izina "
"ry’urubuga gusa, ariko mu mazina yose y’indimi zose)</li>\n"
"</ul>"

