msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name for this @entity_type. It must only "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Izina ryihariye rishobora gusomwa na mashini kuri iyi @entity_type. "
"Rigomba kuba rikirimo gusa inyuguti nto (lowercase), imibare, "
"n’utudomo tw’inyuguti (underscores)."

msgid "Entity Mask"
msgstr "Ubwohereza Icyitegererezo cy’Ikintu"

msgid ""
"Allows an entity type to borrow the fields and display configuration "
"of another entity type."
msgstr ""
"Byemerera ko urwego (entity type) rumenywa kugura (kwifashisha) "
"imirongo (fields) n’uko igaragara (display configuration) ry’undi "
"rwego rw’umuryango (entity type)."

msgid "Chaos Tools Views"
msgstr "Chaos Tools Views"

msgid ""
"This suite is primarily a set of APIs and tools to improve the "
"developer experience. It also contains a module called the Page "
"Manager whose job is to manage pages. In particular it manages panel "
"pages, but as it grows it will be able to manage far more than just "
"Panels."
msgstr ""
"Iyi suite ahanini igizwe na APIs n’ibikoresho byo kunoza uburambe "
"bw’umukoresha uguteza imbere (developer). Harimo kandi na module "
"yitwa Page Manager ifite inshingano zo gucunga ama page. "
"By’umwihariko icunga panel pages, ariko uko izagenda ikura "
"izashobora no gucunga ibirenze Panels gusa."

msgid ""
"Plugins -- tools to make it easy for modules to let other modules "
"implement plugins from .inc files."
msgstr ""
"Ama-Plugins — ibikoresho byo gufasha modules byoroshye ko zemerera "
"izindi modules gushyira mu bikorwa plugins ziva mu dosiye za .inc."

msgid ""
"Exportables -- tools to make it easier for modules to have objects "
"that live in database or live in code, such as \"default views\"."
msgstr ""
"Exportables—ibikoresho byorohereza modules kugira ibintu bibikwa "
"muri database cyangwa bikabikwa mu code, nk’urugero “default "
"views”."

msgid ""
"AJAX responder -- tools to make it easier for the server to handle "
"AJAX requests and tell the client what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"Igihe gisubiza (AJAX) — ibikoresho byo korohereza seriveri gucunga "
"ibyisabwa bya AJAX no kubwira umukiliya icyo agomba gukora na byo."

msgid "Form tools -- tools to make it easier for forms to deal with AJAX."
msgstr ""
"Ibikoresho by’ifishi — ibikoresho byo gufasha ko imikoreshereze "
"y’imyandiko (forms) ikorana na AJAX mu buryo bworoheje."

msgid ""
"Object caching -- tool to make it easier to edit an object across "
"multiple page requests and cache the editing work."
msgstr ""
"Gucungamutungo kw’ingingo (Object caching) — igikoresho ryo "
"korohereza guhindura ingingo ku mpapuro nyinshi zasabweho mu gihe "
"kimwe no kubika ibyo byakozwe mu gihe cyo kuyihindura mu bubiko."

msgid ""
"Contexts -- the notion of wrapping objects in a unified wrapper and "
"providing an API to create and accept these contexts as input."
msgstr ""
"Ingorane (contexts) — igitekerezo cyo gukoramo ibintu binyuranye "
"tubizinga mu ipaki imwe ihuje, tukaba dufite na API yo kubyibuza no "
"kubira nk’ibyinjijwe."

msgid ""
"Modal dialog -- tool to make it simple to put a form in a modal "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"**Agakwiriye k’igihe gito (modal)** — igikoresho kigufasha "
"gushyira byoroshye ifishi mu idirishya ry’igihe gito (modal)."

msgid ""
"Dependent -- a simple form widget to make form items appear and "
"disappear based upon the selections in another item."
msgstr ""
"Dependent — widjete yoroshye y’ifishi igufasha gutuma ibintu byo "
"muri iyo fomu bigaragara cyangwa bikabura bitewe n’ibyo "
"byatoranyijwe mu kindi kintu."

msgid ""
"Content -- pluggable content types used as panes in Panels and other "
"modules like Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Ibirimo — ubwoko bw’ibirimo bushobora guhindurwa (pluggable) "
"bikoreshwa nk’udupane (panes) muri Panels ndetse no mu yandi "
"makarito nka Dashboard."

msgid "Form wizard -- an API to make multi-step forms much easier."
msgstr ""
"Ubufasha bwo kuyobora ifishi uko bikurikirana (Form wizard) — API "
"ituma gufasha gukora inzira y’ifishi y’inteko nyinshi byoroshye "
"cyane."

msgid ""
"CSS tools -- tools to cache and sanitize CSS easily to make user-input "
"CSS safe."
msgstr ""
"Ibikoresho bya CSS — ibikoresho byo kubika mu bubiko (cache) no "
"kweza CSS byoroshye kugira ngo CSS uyikoresha uyinjiza abone umutekano "
"(kugira ngo itangiza ikibazo)."

msgid "Exposed filter values"
msgstr "Indangagaciro zungurura zigaragara"

msgid ""
"If a value is set for an exposed filter, it will be removed from the "
"block display."
msgstr ""
"Niba agaciro gashyizweho ku cyo muyungurura (exposed filter), "
"kizakurwaho mu kwerekana kwa blok."

msgid "Expose filter value to user"
msgstr "Erekana indangagaciro zungurura ku mushandisi"

msgid ""
"Expose this filter value to visitors? If so, the value set here will "
"be the default."
msgstr ""
"Garagaza agaciro k’iyi filter ku basura? Niba aribyo, agaciro "
"washyize hano ni bwo buzajya buzaba ubw’aho bihereye (default)."

msgid "Expose filter operator to user"
msgstr "Erekana imikorere y’igenzura (filter) ku muntu uyikoresha"

msgid ""
"Expose this filter's operator to visitors? If so, the operator set "
"here will be the default."
msgstr ""
"Erekana uw'iki gikorwa cy’iri shungurura ku banyamuryango? Niba "
"aribyo, icyo gikorwa cyashyizwe hano ni cyo kizaba ari isanzwe."

msgid "Disable filter: @handler"
msgstr "Kureka muyunguruzi: @handler"

msgid "Update Status"
msgstr "Kuvugurura Imiterere"

msgid "Administer blocks"
msgstr "Ushinzwe kuyobora blokini"

msgid "Creating content"
msgstr "Kurema ibikubiyemo"

msgid "Configuration files"
msgstr "Amadosiye yo kugena (configuration)"

msgid "Default moderation state"
msgstr "Imiterere ntagereranywa yo guhindura (moderation)"

msgid "Theme files"
msgstr "Idosiye z’Insanganyamatsiko"

