msgid ""
"The topic of the resource. Typically, the subject will be represented "
"using keywords, key phrases, or classification codes. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary. To describe the spatial or "
"temporal topic of the resource, use the Coverage element."
msgstr ""
"Icyo iyi ngingo y’umutungo ivuga. Benshi na benshi, ingingo "
"(subject) iba isobanuwe hakoreshejwe amagambo y’ingenzi, interuro "
"z’ingenzi cyangwa amehereza ya klasifikasiyo. Inama nziza yifatwa ni "
"uko wakoresha ururimi rwateguwe (controlled vocabulary). Kugira ngo "
"usobanure ingingo y’igihe (temporal) cyangwa iy’ahantu (spatial) "
"uyu mutungo werekeranye na yo, koresha ikintu cya **Coverage**."

msgid ""
"An account of the resource. Description may include but is not limited "
"to: an abstract, a table of contents, a graphical representation, or a "
"free-text account of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro byerekeye umutungo. Ibisobanuro bishobora kubamo ariko "
"ntibigarukira gusa kuri ibi: incamake, urutonde rw’inkuru (table of "
"contents), uko umutungo uhagararirwa mu ishusho (graphical "
"representation), cyangwa ibisobanuro byanditse mu buryo busanzwe "
"(free-text account of the resource)."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making the resource available. Examples of a "
"Publisher include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, "
"the name of a Publisher should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Ikigo (entity) gishinzwe gukangura ko umutungo uboneka. Urugero rwa "
"Publisher rushobora kuba umuntu, urwego/umuryango, cyangwa serivisi. "
"Mu buryo busanzwe, izina rya Publisher rikoreshwa mu kwerekana icyo "
"kigo."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making contributions to the resource. "
"Examples of a Contributor include a person, an organization, or a "
"service. Typically, the name of a Contributor should be used to "
"indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Ikigo rishinzwe gutanga umusanzu ku kintu cy’iyo serivisi. Urugero "
"rw’umusanzu (Contributor) rurimo umuntu, urwego rw’indi miryango "
"(umuryango/ikigo), cyangwa serivisi. Mubisanzwe, izina ry’umusanzu "
"rigomba gukoreshwa kugira ngo bigaragaze icyo kigo."

msgid ""
"A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of "
"the resource. Date may be used to express temporal information at any "
"level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding "
"scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."
msgstr ""
"Igihe runaka (cyangwa italiki) gihuzwa n’ishyirahamwe/igikorwa "
"(event) kibaho mu murongo w’ubuzima (lifecycle) bw’iyo ressource. "
"Itariki ishobora gukoreshwa mu kugaragaza amakuru y’igihe ku rwego "
"urwo ari rwo rwose. Icyifuzo cy’ingamba nziza (best practice) ni "
"ukoresha uburyo bwo kwandika (encoding scheme), nk’urugero, uko "
"byemejwe mu rubuga rwa W3CDTF rwa ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."

msgid ""
"The file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource. "
"Examples of dimensions include size and duration. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the list of "
"Internet Media Types [MIME]."
msgstr ""
"Imiterere y’idosiye, uburyo bwayo bw’umubiri, cyangwa ubunini "
"(ingana) bw’iyo ressource. Urugero rw’ubunini rurimo nko ingano "
"n’uburebure. Uburyo bwiza bwemejwe ni ugukoresha amagambo agenga "
"kandi abaruwe (controlled vocabulary) nko gukoresha urutonde "
"rw’Ubwoko bw’Itangazamakuru kuri Internet [MIME]."

msgid ""
"An unambiguous reference to the resource within a given context. "
"Recommended best practice is to identify the resource by means of a "
"string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr ""
"Inyandiko isobanutse neza yerekana umutungo mu rwego runaka. Uburyo "
"bwiza bwo gukurikiza ni uguhamagarira uwo mutungo ukoresheje umugozi "
"uhuye n’urutonde rw’ubumenyi bwasobanuwe neza rwo kumenyekanisha."

msgid ""
"A related resource from which the described resource is derived. The "
"described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole "
"or in part. Recommended best practice is to identify the related "
"resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Urusobekerane rwifashishwa rumwe n’urwo gusobanurwa bishingiyeho. "
"Insanganyamatsiko isobanuwe ishobora gukomoka kuri urwo rusobekerane "
"rwifashishwa haba mu buryo bwuzuye cyangwa igice. Uburyo bwiza busabwa "
"ni ugusobanura urusobekerane rwifashishwa ukoresheje umurongo uhuza "
"n’uburyo bwemewe bwo gutanga indangamuntu."

msgid ""
"A related resource. Recommended best practice is to identify the "
"related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal "
"identification system."
msgstr ""
"Ubuyobozi bujyanye na bwo. Inama nziza isabwa ni uko umenya umutungo "
"bujyanye na bwo ukoresheje umugereka (string) uhuye n’uburyo bwemewe "
"bwo شنا (*formal identification system*)."

msgid ""
"The spatial or temporal topic of the resource, the spatial "
"applicability of the resource, or the jurisdiction under which the "
"resource is relevant. Spatial topic and spatial applicability may be a "
"named place or a location specified by its geographic coordinates. "
"Temporal topic may be a named period, date, or date range. A "
"jurisdiction may be a named administrative entity or a geographic "
"place to which the resource applies. Recommended best practice is to "
"use a controlled vocabulary such as the Thesaurus of Geographic Names "
"[TGN]. Where appropriate, named places or time periods can be used in "
"preference to numeric identifiers such as sets of coordinates or date "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"Insanganyamatsiko yo mu gihe cyangwa mu by’ubuso bya ingagi "
"(resource), uko ikoreshwa mu by’ubuso byakurikizwa, cyangwa urwego "
"rw’ubutegetsi (jurisdiction) aho iyo ngingo ikoreshwa. "
"Insanganyamatsiko yo mu by’ubuso n’uko ikoreshwa mu by’ubuso "
"bishobora kuba ahantu hahamagajwe (izina) cyangwa ahantu hamenywe "
"hakoreshejwe ihuriro ry’ibipimo by’ubwo butaka (coordinates). "
"Insanganyamatsiko yo mu gihe ishobora kuba igihe cyiswe izina, "
"itariki, cyangwa intera y’itariki. Jurisdiction ishobora kuba urwego "
"rw’ubutegetsi rwuhebuje rwitwa izina cyangwa ahantu ku isi aho iyo "
"ngingo ikurikizwa. Inama y’imigenzo myiza ni ugukoresha ururimi "
"rwagenwe (controlled vocabulary) nka *Thesaurus of Geographic Names* "
"[TGN]. Aho bikwiye, ahantu hahamagajwe cyangwa ibihe by’igihe "
"bishobora gukoreshwa mu mwanya w’uduce tw’imibare nk’uko "
"bishobora kuba seti z’ibipimo by’ubuso (coordinates) cyangwa "
"intera z’itariki."

msgid ""
"Information about rights held in and over the resource. Typically, "
"rights information includes a statement about various property rights "
"associated with the resource, including intellectual property rights."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro bijyanye n’uburenganzira bafitemo cyangwa bubahirizwa ku "
"birebana n’iyo resitiri. Muri rusange, amakuru y’uburenganzira "
"arimo interuro ivuga ku burenganzira butandukanye bujyanye "
"n’umutungo ugaragara kuri iyo resitiri, harimo n’uburenganzira ku "
"by’ubwenge."

msgid ""
"A description that concisely summarizes the content of the page, as "
"appropriate for presentation within a Tweet. Do not re-use the title "
"text as the description, or use this field to describe the general "
"services provided by the website. The string will be truncated, by "
"Twitter, at the word to 200 characters."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro bigufi byumvikana binyura neza mu buryo bwo gusobanura mu "
"ncamake ibyo urupapuro rurimo, nk’uko bikwiye mu kwerekana mu Tweet. "
"Ntukoreshe amagambo yo mu nyandiko y’icyubahiro (title) nka yo "
"ibisobanuro, kandi ntukoreshe iyi nyongeramusaruro mu gusobanura "
"serivisi rusange zitangwa n’urubuga. Ubutumwa buzacibwa n’iyo "
"Twitter, bukabikwa mu amagambo agera kuri 200."

