"resource, but in another format."
msgstr ""
"Urugero rw’inyongera rujyanye n’iryo rwasobanuwe cyane, ariko ruri "
"mu kindi buryo bwo kwerekwa."

msgid ""
"A related resource in which the described resource is physically or "
"logically included."
msgstr ""
"Urugero rumwe rujyanye rwerekeye aho umutungo wabivuzwe uhurijwe mu "
"buryo bw’umubiri cyangwa mu buryo bw’ubwumvikane."

msgid ""
"A related resource that references, cites, or otherwise points to the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"Icyerekezo kijyanye nayo kivuga, cyerekana, cyangwa gifata ku isoko "
"ryasobanuwe, cyangwa kigashyira aho bikomoka."

msgid ""
"A related resource that supplants, displaces, or supersedes the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"Urundi rwego rufitanye isano rusesa, rikumira, cyangwa rusesa burundu "
"urwo rwego rwasobanuwe."

msgid ""
"A related resource that requires the described resource to support its "
"function, delivery, or coherence."
msgstr ""
"Urundi rwego rwerekeye rukeneye urusoko rwanditseho ngo rushobore "
"gukora, gutangwa, cyangwa gukomeza ubwiyunge."

msgid "Date of formal issuance (e.g., publication) of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Itariki yo gutangirwa ku mugaragaro (urugero: iyashyizwe ahagaragara) "
"y’iyo ngingo."

msgid "Mediator"
msgstr "Umuhuza"

msgid "The material or physical carrier of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Ubwoko bw’ibikoresho bifatika cyangwa uwuzitwara (umuharo "
"w’ibikoresho) w’iyo resousi."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is referenced, cited, or otherwise pointed to "
"by the described resource."
msgstr ""
"Icyifashishwa gikomokaho/kirebwa kiboneka kandi cyavuzwe, cyanditsweho "
"nk’igitümwemezo, cyangwa byabindi buryo gihamagariwe/oherezwa "
"n’iyo soko imvugo ivugwaho."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is supplanted, displaced, or superseded by the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"Icyifashishwa bijyanye, gisimbuwe, cyarasimbuwe, cyangwa "
"cyarahagaritswe n’icyo gikoreshwa kivugwa."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is required by the described resource to "
"support its function, delivery, or coherence."
msgstr ""
"Umutungo ujyanye nawo usabwa n’uwo umutungo wasobanuwe kugira ngo "
"ubashe gukora, gutangwa, cyangwa kugira ngo uhuze n’ibisabwa."

msgid "Rights Holder"
msgstr "Ufite uburenganzira"

msgid "A person or organization owning or managing rights over the resource."
msgstr ""
"Umuntu cyangwa umuryango ufite uburenganzira cyangwa uyayobora ku "
"rwego rw’iyo umutungo."

msgid "Spatial characteristics of the resource."
msgstr "Ibiranga umwanya (imiterere y’aho) by’umutungo."

msgid "A list of subunits of the resource."
msgstr "Urutonde rw’ibice bigize umutungo."

msgid "Temporal characteristics of the resource."
msgstr "Ibiranga igihe (igihe) by’umutungo."

msgid "Favicons & touch icons"
msgstr "Favicons & touch icons"

msgid "Handheld-Friendly"
msgstr "Ikoranye-kworoshye kuri telefoni zigendanwa"

msgid "Cleartype"
msgstr "**Cleartype**"

msgid ""
"Provides support for meta tags used to control the mobile browser "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Itanga inkunga ku manota (meta tags) akoreshwa kugenzura uko "
"mushakisha ya telefoni ngendanwa ihura n’urubuga."

msgid "Open Graph - Products"
msgstr "**Open Graph - Ibicuruzwa**"

msgid ""
"A PNG image that is 76px wide by 76px high. Used with the iPad mini "
"and the second-generation iPad (@1x display) on iOS >= 7."
msgstr ""
"Ishusho ya PNG ifite ubugari bwa 76px na uburebure bwa 76px. Ikoreshwa "
"hamwe na iPad mini n’iPad yo mu gisekuru cya kabiri (@1x display) "
"kuri iOS >= 7."

msgid ""
"A PNG image that is 57px wide by 57px high. Used with the non-Retina "
"iPhone, iPod Touch, and Android 2.1+ devices."
msgstr ""
"Ishusho ya PNG ifite ubugari bwa 57px n’uburebure bwa 57px. "
"Bikoreshwa ku bikoresho bya iPhone, iPod Touch na Android 2.1+ "
"bitabamo “Non-Retina”."

msgid "Mobile & UI Adjustments"
msgstr "Guhindura kuri Mobile na UI"

msgid ""
"Meta tags used to control the mobile browser experience. Some of these "
"meta tags have been replaced by newer mobile browsers. These meta tags "
"usually only need to be set globally, rather than per-page."
msgstr ""
"Meta tags zikoreshwa kuyobora uko porogaramu za mobile (mobile "
"browser) zitwara urubuga. Bimwe muri ibyo meta tags byasimbuwe "
"n’abashakisha mobile bashya. Izi meta tags akenshi ziba zikwiriye "
"gushyirwaho ku rwego rwose (global), aho kuba kuri buri page ku giti "
"cyayo."

msgid "Metatag: Mobile & UI Adjustments"
msgstr "Metatag: Guhindura mobile n’imbanzirizamushinga y’imbere (UI)"

msgid ""
"Provides additional Open Graph Protocol meta tags for describing "
"products."
msgstr "Itanga meta tag zindi za Open Graph Protocol zo gusobanura ibicuruzwa."

msgid "Undefined group '%group' on tag '%tag'"
msgstr "Itsinda ritazwi “%group” ku tag “%tag”"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags specially for controlling the summaries displayed "
"when content is shared on <a href='https://twitter.com/'>Twitter</a>."
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rw’amatega (meta tags) byihariye byo kugenzura incamake "
"zigaragara igihe ibirimo biherekezwa (bijyanwa) kuri <a "
"href='https://twitter.com/'>Twitter</a>."

msgid "Custom Tag"
msgstr "Ikirango gihariye"

msgid "Custom tag"
msgstr "Agasanduku kihariye"

msgid "Alternative language links (hreflang)"
msgstr "Ihuza ry’ururimi rundi (hreflang)"

msgid "Default locale (x-default)"
msgstr "Ururimi rusanzwe (x-default)"

msgid ""
"This should point to the version of the page that is for the main or "
"primary locale, e.g. the original version of an article that is "
"translated into other languages."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bigomba kwerekeza ku verisiyo y’urupapuro ruri ku rurimi "
"rw’ingenzi (locale y’ingenzi), urugero nk’iyo verisiyo "
"y’umwimerere y’ingingo itumirwa mu zindi ndimi."

msgid ""
"Provides support for the hreflang meta tag with some extra logic to "
"simplify it."
msgstr ""
"Ifasha ikoreshwa rya meta tag ya hreflang, hamwe n’ubundi buryo "
"bw’inyongera bwo kuyorohereza."

msgid "Apple & iOS"
msgstr "Apple na iOS"

msgid "Custom meta tags used by Apple's software, iOS, Safari, etc."
msgstr ""
"Meta tag zihariye zikoreshwa na porogaramu za Apple, iOS, Safari, "
"n’ibindi."

msgid "Custom meta tags used by the Android OS, browser, etc."
msgstr "Meta tagihariye zikoreshwa na Android OS, mushakisha, n’ibindi."

msgid "Windows & Windows Mobile"
msgstr "Windows na Windows Mobile"

msgid ""
"Custom meta tags used by the Windows and Windows Mobile OSes, IE "
"browser, etc."
msgstr ""
"Meta tags zihariye zikoreshwa na sisitemu y’imikorere ya Windows na "
"Windows Mobile, mushakisha wa Internet Explorer (IE), n’izindi."

msgid "Web app capable?"
msgstr "Ese ishobora kuba ari porogaramu ya interineti (web app)?"

msgid "iOS app link alternative"
msgstr "ihuza rindi rya porogaramu ya iOS"

msgid "Android app link alternative"
msgstr "Ihuza rundi rihuzanya na porogaramu ya Android"

msgid "X-UA-Compatible"
msgstr "X-UA-Compatible"

msgid ""
"The default name displayed with the pinned sites tile (or icon). Set "
"the content attribute to the desired name."
msgstr ""
"Izina risanzwe rigaragara hamwe n’akabuto k’**urubuga ruri muri "
"pinned** (cyangwa ikimenyetso). Shiraho indangagaciro ya **content "
"attribute** ku izina wifuza."

msgid "MSApplication - Allow domain API calls"
msgstr "MSApplication - Emerera guhamagara API za domain"

msgid "MSApplication - Allow domain meta tags"
msgstr "MSApplication - Emerera meta tags z’uturanga (domain)"

msgid "MSApplication - Badge"
msgstr "MSApplication - Igitabo cy’icyapa (Badge)"

msgid "MSApplication - Nav button color"
msgstr "MSApplication - Ibara ry’ahakanda r’ubugufi (nav)"

msgid ""
"Controls the color of the Back and Forward buttons in the pinned site "
"browser window."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura ibara ry’utudomo tw’Imbere n’inyuma (Back na Forward) "
"mu idirishya riri gufatirwaho ry’“site” mu mushakisha."

msgid "MSApplication - Notification"
msgstr "**MSApplication - Imenyesha**"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 150px x 150px"
msgstr ""
"MSApplication – Ikirango gisa n’ukuzenguruka, ingano ya 150px na "
"150px"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 310px x 310px"
msgstr ""
"MSApplication - Agasanduku gafite ishusho y’ikirangantego, 310px na "
"310px"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 70px x 70px"
msgstr "MSApplication - Ishusho/ikimenyetso cya kare (logo), 70px x 70px"

msgid "MSApplication - Wide logo, 310px x 150px"
msgstr ""
"MSApplication - Idufite ndangamuntu yo kwerura (logo nini), 310px x "
"150px"

msgid "MSApplication - Start URL"
msgstr "MSApplication - URL itangiriraho"

msgid "MSApplication - Task separator"
msgstr "MSApplication - Gutandukanya inshingano"

msgid "MSApplication - Tile color"
msgstr "MSApplication - Ibara rya tile"

msgid "The HTML color to use as the background color for the live tile."
msgstr ""
"Ibara rya HTML rigomba gukoreshwa nk’inyuma (background color) "
"ry’itileyiri ibonwa mu buryo bwa live."

msgid "MSApplication - Tile image"
msgstr "MSApplication - Ishusho y’itile"

msgid "The URL to an image to use as the background for the live tile."
msgstr ""
"URL y’agashusho ukoreshwa nk’inyuma (background) y’urubaho (live "
"tile)."

msgid "MSApplication - Tooltip"
msgstr "MSApplication - Toolip"

msgid "Controls the text shown in the tooltip for the pinned site's shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura inyandiko igaragara muri tooltip yo kugufi (shortcut) kwa "
"site yashyizweho hejuru (pinned)."

msgid "MSApplication - Window"
msgstr "MSApplication - Idirishya"

msgid "Open Graph: Image secure URL"
msgstr "Open Graph: Ishusho ifite URL ibyoukiriye (secure)"

msgid ""
"The type of image referenced above. Should be either 'image/gif' for a "
"GIF image, 'image/jpeg' for a JPG/JPEG image, or 'image/png' for a PNG "
"image. Note: there should be one value for each image, and having more "
"than there are images may cause problems."
msgstr ""
"Ubwoko bw’ishusho iriho ibisobanuro hejuru. Biba bikwiye kuba ari "
"kimwe muri ibi: **'image/gif'** ku ishusho ya GIF, **'image/jpeg'** ku "
"ishusho ya JPG/JPEG, cyangwa **'image/png'** ku ishusho ya PNG. "
"Bimenyerewe ko: hagomba kubaho agaciro kamwe kuri buri shusho, kandi "
"kugira agaciro kurusha ayo amashusho aboneka bishobora gutera ibibazo."

msgid ""
"The locale these tags are marked up in, must be in the format "
"language_TERRITORY. Default is 'en_US'."
msgstr ""
"Icyicaro (locale) aya madozi (tags) yanditsemo, kigomba kuba mu buryo "
"**language_TERRITORY**. Impanzwe ni **'en_US'**."

msgid ""
"Other locales this content is available in, must be in the format "
"language_TERRITORY, e.g. 'fr_FR'."
msgstr ""
"Indindi ndimi (locales) iyi iriho, niba ihari, zigomba kuba ziri mu "
"buryo bukurikira language_TERRITORY, urugero 'fr_FR'."

msgid ""
"The page's title, which should be concise; it will be truncated at 70 "
"characters by Twitter. This field is required unless this the 'type' "
"field is set to 'photo'."
msgstr ""
"Icyiswe cy’urupapuro, gikwiriye kuba kigufi; kizagabanywa "
"hakurikijwe inyuguti 70 kuri Twitter. Iri murima rirakenewe keretse "
"niba imiterere “type” yashyizwe kuri “photo”."

msgid "Open Graph: Determiner"
msgstr "Open Graph: Icyemezo-gikorwa"

msgid "Open Graph: Alternative locale"
msgstr "Ifishi y’Ibikorwa (Open Graph): Ururimi rundi (Alternative locale)"

msgid "Twitter Cards: App store country"
msgstr "Twitter Cards: Igihugu cy’ububiko bwa porogaramu"

msgid "Verifies ownership of a site for search engines and other services."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura uwanditseho (ubwigenge) ko urubuga rugengwa n’uwayitumye/ko "
"ruriho kugira ngo imashini zishakisha n’izindi serivisi zibashe "
"kurusuzuma."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are used to confirm site ownership for search engines "
"and other services."
msgstr ""
"Aya meta tags akoreshwa mu kwemeza ko urubuga ari urwawe ku m. moteri "
"zo gushakisha n’izindi serivisi."

msgid "Norton Safe Web"
msgstr "Norton Safe Web"

msgid "Facebook Instant Articles claim URL token."
msgstr "Facebook Instant Articles itangaza URL token."

msgid "Overrides the long site title when using the Apple Add to Home Screen."
msgstr ""
"Irengurira izina ndangurambaga ry’urubuga rirerire (long site title) "
"igihe ukoresha “Apple Add to Home Screen”."

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags specially for controlling advanced functionality "
"with Facebook."
msgstr ""
"Ukoresha urutonde rw’amatagisi ya meta agenewe kugenzura ubushobozi "
"buhanitse kuri Facebook."

msgid "Open Graph: Video Secure URL"
msgstr "Open Graph: Video Secure URL"

msgid ""
"The height of the above video(s). Note: if both the unsecured and "
"secured videos are provided, they should both be the same size."
msgstr ""
"Uburebure bwa video(zi) iri hejuru. Icyitonderwa: niba hatanzwe "
"amashusho adafite umutekano n’ayafite umutekano, bigomba kuba ingano "
"imwe."

msgid "Video Secure URL"
msgstr "Video Secure URL → **Video: URL Ifite Umutekano**"

msgid "Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"
msgstr "Imashini yo Gushakisha ya Google (CSE)"

msgid "Department tag."
msgstr "Akarango k’ishami."

msgid "Content audience"
msgstr "Abagenewe ibi birimo"

msgid "Provides support for meta tags used for Google Custom Search Engine."
msgstr ""
"Ifasha ikoreshwa ry’amagama (meta tags) ikoreshwa kuri Google Custom "
"Search Engine."

msgid "Handheld URL"
msgstr "URL yo kuri telefone y'intoki"

msgid "Provides support for many different favicons."
msgstr "Itanga inkunga kuri favikon nziza zitandukanye."

msgid "Metatag: Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"
msgstr "Metatag: Imashini yishakisha ya Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"

msgid "google_rating"
msgstr "google_rating"

msgid "Android Mobile: Android App Link Alternative"
msgstr "Android Mobile: Ihuza rindi ryo muri Android App Link"

msgid "Android Mobile: Manifest"
msgstr "Android Igendanwa: Manifest"

msgid "Apple Mobile: iTunes App"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Porogaramu ya iTunes"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Capable"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Irashobora Gukora nk’Urubuga (Web App)"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Status bar color"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Ibara ry’ihaburiyumvire (status bar) rya Web App"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Title"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Umutwe wa Porogaramu ya Web"

msgid "Mobile: Cleartype"
msgstr "Mobile: Cleartype"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Format Detection"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Gushakisha imiterere"

msgid "Mobile: Handheld-Friendly"
msgstr "Mobile: Ishyirwa neza ku bikoresho bigendanwa"

msgid "Apple Mobile: iOS App Link Alternative"
msgstr ""
"Apple Mobile: Inyandiko y’Urugero rundi (alternative) ya App kuri "
"iOS"

msgid "Mobile: Mobile Optimized"
msgstr "Mobile: Byihariye bitezweho kuri Mobile"

msgid "Mobile: Theme Color"
msgstr "Mobile: Ibara ry’Insanganyamatsiko"

msgid "Mobile: Viewport"
msgstr "Mobile: Agaciro k’Intera y’Imbonerahamwe"

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an Android mobile app. Should be in "
"the format 'package_name/host_path', e.g. "
"'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'. The 'android-app://' "
"prefix will be included automatically."
msgstr ""
"Urukurikirane rwihariye rwo gufunga (deeplinking) kuri porogaramu "
"ngendanwa ya Android. Rwagombye kuba ruri mu buryo bwa "
"`'package_name/host_path'`, urugero nka "
"`'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'`. Ibirango "
"`'android-app://'` bizongerwamo byikora."

msgid ""
"This informs iOS devices to display a banner to a specific app. If "
"used, it must provide the 'app-id' value, the 'affiliate-data' and "
"'app-argument' values are optional."
msgstr ""
"Ibi byamenyesha ibikoresho bya iOS kwerekana banner kuri porogaramu "
"runaka. Iyo bikoreshejwe, bigomba kuba bitanga agaciro ka "
"**'app-id'**; indangagaciro za **'affiliate-data'** na "
"**'app-argument'** zirahari (zirashoboka)."

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes', the application will run in full-screen mode; the "
"default behavior is to use Safari to display web content."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizwe kuri “yego”, porogaramu izakora mu buryo bwuzuye "
"bwo kwerekana kuri ecran (full-screen); uko bisanzwe bikora ni "
"ukoresha Safari mu kwerekana ibiri kuri urubuga."

msgid ""
"Requires the 'Web app capable' meta tag to be set to 'yes'. May be set "
"to 'default', 'black', or 'black-translucent'."
msgstr ""
"Ikoreshwa ry’amagambo ya meta tag “Web app capable” rigomba "
"gushyirwaho kuri “yes”. Irashobora gushyirwaho kuri “default”, "
"“black”, cyangwa “black-translucent”."

msgid ""
"A legacy meta tag for older versions of Internet Explorer on Windows, "
"use the value 'on' to enable it; this tag is ignored by all other "
"browsers."
msgstr ""
"Itagi ya meta y’amateka (legacy) igenewe verisiyo za kera za "
"Internet Explorer kuri Windows; ukoreshe agaciro “on” kugira ngo "
"ikore; iri tagi irirengagizwa n’abashoranyuma (browsers) bindi "
"byose."

msgid ""
"If set to 'telephone=no' the page will not be checked for phone "
"numbers, which would be presented."
msgstr ""
"Kihetse kuri `'telephone=no'` ni uko urupapuro rutazagenzurwa ngo "
"hamenyekane nimero za telefone, ziba zigaragajwe."

msgid ""
"Some older mobile browsers will expect this meta tag to be set to "
"'true' to indicate that the site has been designed with mobile "
"browsers in mind."
msgstr ""
"Muri porogaramu zimwe na zimwe za telefone zishaje, zishobora kwitega "
"ko iyi meta tag ishyirwaho kuri «true» kugira ngo bigaragaze ko "
"urubuga rwateguwe hagamijwe ibitekerezo by’abakoresha telefoni "
"zigendanwa."

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an iOS mobile app. Should be in the "
"format 'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', e.g. "
"123456/example/hello-screen'. The 'ios-app://' prefix will be included "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Urwego rwihariye rw’imirongo (string) yo gukora deeplinking kuri "
"porogaramu ngendanwa ya iOS. Iteganyijwe kugera mu buryo bwa "
"`'itunes_id/scheme/host_path'`, urugero: "
"`123456/example/hello-screen`. Iburante rya `'ios-app://'` rizongerwa "
"kigingindiro (byikoresha) wenyine."

msgid ""
"Using the value 'width' tells certain mobile Internet Explorer "
"browsers to display as-is, without being resized. Alternatively a "
"numerical width may be used to indicate the desired page width the "
"page should be rendered in: '240' is the suggested default, '176' for "
"older browsers or '480' for newer devices with high DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"Gukoresha agaciro ka `'width'` bituma amwe mu mabara y’Interineti "
"kuri telefone (nka Internet Explorer ku mobile) agaragazwa uko bimeze, "
"hatabayeho kuvangura ubunini bw’urupapuro. Ubundi buryo ni uko "
"wakoresha ubugari (width) bw’umubare werekana ubugari bw’urupapuro "
"wifuza ko rwerekanwamo: `'240'` ni yo isabwa nk’agaciro gasanzwe, "
"`'176'` iy’abashakisha ba kera, cyangwa `'480'` ku bikoresho bishya "
"bifite ecran ifite ubucucike buhanitse (high DPI)."

msgid ""
"Allows tasks to be defined on child domains of the fully qualified "
"domain name associated with the pinned site. Should be either 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Ikoranabikorwa rishyiraho intego (tasks) ku nkuburi ziri munsi ya "
"domain (subdomains) zishingiye ku izina ryuzuye rya domaine ryahujwe "
"na site yafunzwe (pinned site). Bivuye ku buryo bweruye, igomba kuba "
"ari “true” cyangwa “false”."

msgid ""
"Should contain the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a> file that further controls tile "
"customizations."
msgstr ""
"Agomba kuba irimo URL yose ijya kuri dosiye ya <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>umugereka "
"w’imiterere ya porogaramu ya mushakisha</a> ikomeza kugenzura "
"impinduka zihariye z’itile."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string containing 'polling-uri=' (required), "
"'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' and 'polling-uri5=' "
"to indicate the URLs for notifications. May also contain a "
"'frequency=' value to specify how often (in minutes) the URLs will be "
"polled; limited to 30, 60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default). May also "
"contain the value 'cycle=' to control the notifications cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ingingo-nyuguti ihuza n’akamo (**;)** itanditse nk’umurongo "
"(string) irimo ibintu `'polling-uri='` (irabibwa), `'polling-uri2='`, "
"`'polling-uri3='`, `'polling-uri4='`, na `'polling-uri5='` byerekana "
"ama URL y’ubutumwa (notifications). Irashobora kandi kuba irimo "
"agaciro `'frequency='` kerekana uko kenshi (mu minota) ayo ma URL "
"azajya apiganirwa (polling); ibirangwaho ni 30, 60, 360, 720 cyangwa "
"1440 (bisanzwe). Irashobora kandi kuba irimo agaciro `'cycle='` "
"kugenzura uruzinduko (cycle) rw’ubutumwa."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string defining the 'jump' list task. Should "
"contain the 'name=' value to specify the task's name, the "
"'action-uri=' value to set the URL to load when the jump list is "
"clicked, the 'icon-uri=' value to set the URL to an icon file to be "
"displayed, and 'window-type=' set to either 'tab' (default), 'self' or "
"'window' to control how the link opens in the browser."
msgstr ""
"Urudodo rwanditseho udupunya-ngingo (“;”) rugena urutonde "
"rw’“jump” (imirimo yo gusimbuka). Rukwiye kuba rurimo agaciro ka "
"**“name=”** kugira ngo hamenyekane izina rya task, agaciro ka "
"**“action-uri=”** kugira ngo hashyirweho URL igomba gupakururwa "
"iyo “jump list” ihindutse, agaciro ka **“icon-uri=”** kugira "
"ngo hashyirweho URL y’idosiye y’icapiro/ikoni igomba kwerekanwa, "
"n’agaciro ka **“window-type=”** gashyizwe kuri **“tab”** "
"(mbanza), **“self”**, cyangwa **“window”** kugira ngo igenzure "
"uko ihuza (link) rifunguka muri browser."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated value that controls the dimensions of the "
"initial window. Should contain the values 'width=' and 'height=' to "
"control the width and height respectively."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro kitarina (semi-colon) gutandukanijwe igenamigambi rigenzura "
"ingano y’icyinjira (window) cya mbere. Kigomba kuba kirimo "
"indangagaciro ziri mu buryo bwa 'width=' na 'height=' kugira ngo "
"bigenzure ubugari n’uburebure ukurikije uko bikenewe."

msgid "Metatag: Open Graph Products"
msgstr "Metatag: Ibicuruzwa bya Open Graph"

msgid ""
"In the context of search engine optimization, providing an extensive "
"set of meta tags may help improve the site's and pages' rankings, thus "
"may aid with achieving a more prominent display of the content within "
"search engine results. They can also be used to tailor how content is "
"displayed when shared on social networks. For additional information, "
"see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Metatag</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mu rwego rwo kunoza ibyuma byifashishwa mu gushakisha (SEO), gutanga "
"urutonde rwinshi rwa meta tags bishobora gufasha kunoza imyanya "
"y’urubuga n’impapuro, bityo bikanafasha kugira igaragara ryiza "
"ry’iyo contenu mu bisubizo by’imashini zishakisha. Zishobora no "
"gukoreshwa mu guhindura uko contenu igaragara iyo iherewe ku mbuga "
"nkoranyambaga. Ibisobanuro birushijeho, reba <a "
"href=\":online\">inyandiko iri kuri interineti ya Metatag</a>."

msgid ""
"Override each of the <a href=\":defaults\">other defaults</a>, fill in "
"specific values and tokens that each item should have by default. This "
"allows e.g. for all nodes to have different values than taxonomy "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Hindura buri kimwe muri <a href=\":defaults\">izindi ndangagaciro "
"zisanzwe</a>, uzuze indangagaciro zihariye hamwe n’ama-token buri "
"kintu kigomba kugira bisanzwe. Ibi bituma urugero, kuri node zose "
"habaho indangagaciro zitandukanye n’iziri kuri taxonomy terms."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are designed to point visitors to versions of the "
"current page in other languages."
msgstr ""
"Aya meta tag agenewe kuyobora abashyitsi ku byiciro by’urupapuro rwa "
"none biboneka mu zindi ndimi."

msgid "Sitename"
msgstr "Amazina y’urubuga"

msgid ""
"Meta tag patterns are passed down from one level to the next unless "
"they are overridden. To view a summary of the individual meta tags and "
"the pattern for a specific configuration, click on its name below."
msgstr ""
"Imiterere ya meta tags iherezwa (ihabwa) kuva ku rwego rumwe ikagera "
"ku kindi keretse iyo isimbuwe. Kugira ngo urebe incamake ya buri meta "
"tag hamwe n’imiterere yayo kuri igenamiterere runaka, kanda ku izina "
"ryayo riri hepfo."

msgid ""
"The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best "
"results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but "
"at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types "
"supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and "
"video.tv_show."
msgstr ""
"URL y’ishyirahamwe rya videwo igomba kwerekana uko ibintu biri mu "
"byo yifashishwa. Kugira ngo ubone ibisubizo byiza, koresha isoko ifite "
"byibuze ubunini bwa 1200 x 630 pigiseli, ariko nibura 600 x 316 "
"pigiseli ni yo byifuzwa nk’ibisabwa by’ibanze. Ubwoko bw’ibintu "
"bushyigikiwe harimo video.episode, video.movie, video.other, na "
"video.tv_show."

msgid ""
"The type of video referenced above. Should be either  video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show. Note: there should be one "
"value for each video, and having more than there are videos may cause "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"Ubwoko bwa videwo ivugwa haruguru. Biba bigomba kuba ari "
"video.episode, video.movie, video.other, cyangwa video.tv_show. "
"Icyitonderwa: hagomba kubaho agaciro kamwe kuri videwo imwe, kandi "
"kugira ibirenze umubare w’imividio ushobora gutera ibibazo."

msgid "Provides views integration for metatags."
msgstr "Itanga ihuriro rya **views** ryo gukoresha metatags."

msgid "Metatags for @view : @display have been saved."
msgstr "Metatag za @view : @display zibikiwe."

msgid "Edit @language translation for %view: %display metatags"
msgstr ""
"Hindura @language iyerekeranye n’umuheto (translation) kuri %view: "
"%display meta tags"

msgid "Metatag display extender"
msgstr "Kwiyongera kwerekana kwa metatag"

msgid "Metatag settings for this view."
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya meta tag kuri iyi view."

msgid ""
"A link to the preferred page location or URL of the content of this "
"page, to help eliminate duplicate content penalties from search "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"Ihuza riri kuri aderesi (URL) y’aho iyi page y’Ibigize igomba "
"kujya, cyangwa aho yerekeza, kugira ngo bifashe kugabanya ibihano byo "
"kubona “content ihwanye” bishingiye kuri moteri zishakisha."

msgid ""
"The text to display in the title bar of a visitor's web browser when "
"they view this page. This meta tag may also be used as the title of "
"the page when a visitor bookmarks or favorites this page, or as the "
"page title in a search engine result. It is common to append "
"'[site:name]' to the end of this, so the site's name is automatically "
"added. It is recommended that the title is no greater than 55 - 65 "
"characters long, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bugenewe kugaragara mu mwanya w’iminwa (title bar) wa "
"mushakisha ya interineti iyo uyisura abonye iyi page. Iyi meta tag "
"ishobora kandi gukoreshwa nk’iyitwa rya page igihe umushyitsi "
"abitseho (bookmarks/favorites) iyi page, cyangwa nk’iry’iyo page "
"igaragara mu ntagondwa z’ímashini zishakisha (search engine "
"result). Bikunze kongerwaho “[site:name]” ku iherezo ryayo kugira "
"ngo izina rya site rihite ribongerwaho. Birasabwa ko iryo yitwa "
"ritarenza inyuguti 55–65 zose, harimo n’utumana (spaces)."

msgid "URL for a version of this page in %langcode"
msgstr "URL y’icyiciro cy’iyi page muri %langcode"

msgid "Hreflang per language"
msgstr "Hreflang kuri buri rurimi"

msgid ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Sets a "
"cookie</a> on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE "
"format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration "
"date; see the link for full details on the syntax."
msgstr ""
"<a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Ishyiraho "
"ikuki (cookie)</a> kuri mushakisha w’uwasurwa (visitor). Irashobora "
"kuba mu buryo bwa **NAME=VALUE**, cyangwa se mu buryo burushijeho "
"gusobanura burimo inzira (path) n’itariki yo kurangiriraho "
"(expiration date); reba kuri iyi link kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro "
"birambuye ku buryo bwo kuyandika (syntax)."

msgid "Enables metatags for custom routes"
msgstr "Ituma metatag ziboneka kuri inzira z’ikirenga (custom routes)"

msgid "Add meta tag for custom route"
msgstr "Ongeraho meta tag ku murongo (route) wihariye"

msgid "Add custom metatag"
msgstr "Ongeraho meta tag yihariye"

msgid "The path must begin with /"
msgstr "Inzira igomba gutangirana na /"

msgid "The admin routes should not have metatags."
msgstr "Inzira za admin ntizagombye kugira metatag."

msgid "There are already metatags created for this route."
msgstr "Haba hari meta tags zisanzwe zateguwe kuri iyi nzira."

msgid "The path does not exist as an internal Drupal route."
msgstr "Inzira ntibaho nk’aho ibonekera imbere muri Drupal (internal route)."

msgid "Created metatags for the path: @url. Internal route: @route."
msgstr "Byaremwe metatags kuri inzira: @url. Inzira yo imbere: @route."

msgid "The metatags could not be created for the path: @url."
msgstr "Ameta tags ntibyashoboye kubyitirwaho kuri inzira: @url."

msgid "Dublin Core: Instructional Method"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Uburyo bwo kwigisha"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Format Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Ni Imiterere ya"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Part Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Ibigize Byayo"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Referenced By"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Bishingiweho na"

msgid ""
"Information about who can access the resource or an indication of its "
"security status. Access Rights may include information regarding "
"access or restrictions based on privacy, security, or other policies."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro byerekeye uwo bushobora kugera kuri iyi resousi cyangwa "
"ikimenyetso cy’uko irimo urwego rw’umutekano. Uburenganzira bwo "
"kuyigeraho bushobora kuba burimo amakuru yerekeye uko ubuyobozi "
"bukagera cyangwa ibibuza gushingiye ku ibanga, umutekano, cyangwa "
"izindi politiki."

msgid ""
"A bibliographic reference for the resource. Recommended practice is to "
"include sufficient bibliographic detail to identify the resource as "
"unambiguously as possible."
msgstr ""
"Icyerekezo cy’ibitabo/ubumenyi (bibliographic reference) kuri iyo "
"nsoko. Uburyo busabwa ni ugushyiramo ibisobanuro bihagije byo "
"kuyisobanura mu buryo bwuzuye (bibliographic detail) kugira ngo iyi "
"nsoko izamenyekane nta kabuza uko iboneye kandi nta gushidikanya."

msgid ""
"Date of acceptance of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Accepted may be relevant are a thesis (accepted by a university "
"department) or an article (accepted by a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Itariki yemejweho iyo umutungo. Ingero z’imitungo aho Itariki "
"Yemejwe ishobora gukenerwa ni nka impamyabumenyi (yemejwe n’ishami "
"rya kaminuza) cyangwa ingingo (yemejwe n’ikinyamakuru)."

msgid ""
"Date of submission of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Submitted may be relevant are a thesis (submitted to a university "
"department) or an article (submitted to a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Itariki yoherejweho umutungo. Urugero rw’imitungo ishobora gusaba ko "
"habaho Itariki y’oherejweho ni nka thesis (yoherejwe ku ishuri "
"ryigenga rishinzwe kaminuza) cyangwa nk’ingingo (yoherejwe mu "
"kinyamakuru)."

msgid ""
"A process, used to engender knowledge, attitudes and skills, that the "
"described resource is designed to support. Instructional Method will "
"typically include ways of presenting instructional materials or "
"conducting instructional activities, patterns of learner-to-learner "
"and learner-to-instructor interactions, and mechanisms by which group "
"and individual levels of learning are measured. Instructional methods "
"include all aspects of the instruction and learning processes from "
"planning and implementation through evaluation and feedback."
msgstr ""
"Uburyo bwo gukoresha mu guteza imbere ubumenyi, imyitwarire "
"n’ubuhanga, bikaba bigamije ko iyi kintu gisobanuwe gishobora "
"kubishyigikira. Uburyo bwo kwigisha busanzwe burimo uburyo bwo gutanga "
"ibikoresho byo kwigishirizwamo cyangwa gukora ibikorwa byo kwigisha, "
"uko abanyeshuri bigirana (bagenzi-bagenzi) n’uko bigirana "
"n’umwigisha (bagenzi-umwigisha), ndetse n’uburyo bugenwa bwo "
"gupima uko urwego rwo kwiga rwapimwe ku matsinda no ku muntu ku giti "
"cye. Uburyo bwo kwigisha burimo ibintu byose bijyanye n’inzira yo "
"kwigisha no kwiga, kuva mu gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa kugeza mu "
"gusuzuma no gutanga umubwiriza (ubusubiramo)."

msgid ""
"A related resource of which the described resource is a version, "
"edition, or adaptation. Changes in version imply substantive changes "
"in content rather than differences in format."
msgstr ""
"Urusobekerane rurebana n’uru rundi umutungo rivugwaho, ari yo byitwa "
"ko umutungo uvugwa ari verisiyo, ikirungo (edition), cyangwa guhuza "
"(adaptation) byawo. Impinduka zibaho muri verisiyo bivuze impinduka "
"zifite icyo zihindura mu byo biriho kurusha izitandukaniro rishingiye "
"gusa ku buryo bwo kubigaragaza (format)."

msgid ""
"An entity that mediates access to the resource and for whom the "
"resource is intended or useful. In an educational context, a mediator "
"might be a parent, teacher, teaching assistant, or care-giver."
msgstr ""
"Ikigo cyangwa umuhuza uhuza uko umuntu abonera iyo serivisi, kandi "
"bigenewe cyangwa bikamuzanira umumaro. Mu rwego rw’amasomo, umuhuza "
"ashobora kuba ari umubyeyi, umwarimu, umufasha mu kwigisha, cyangwa "
"umwitaho."

msgid ""
"A statement of any changes in ownership and custody of the resource "
"since its creation that are significant for its authenticity, "
"integrity, and interpretation. The statement may include a description "
"of any changes successive custodians made to the resource."
msgstr ""
"Itangazo ry’uko icyemezo cyose cyo guhindura nyirubwite n’uburinzi "
"bw’iyo nyandiko (resource) cyakozwe kuva yaremwe, kandi by’ingenzi "
"ku busugire bwayo (authenticity), uko ibungabungwa (integrity), "
"n’uko isobanurwa. Iryo tangazo rishobora no kugaragaza ibisobanuro "
"by’impinduka uwo buherere bwakurikiyeho (successive custodians) "
"yakoze kuri iyi nyandiko."

msgid "Spatial Coverage"
msgstr "Ikwirakwizwa ry’Umwanya"

msgid ""
"Links a book to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to "
"the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr ""
"Ihuza igitabo na paji ya Facebook y’umwanditsi; bigomba kuba ari URL "
"ziri kuri urupapuro rwa poroﬁli y’umwanditsi cyangwa nimero "
"z’imenyekanisha za Facebook (Facebook profile IDs)."

msgid ""
"The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must "
"be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a "
"recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 "
"x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not "
"be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added "
"many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not "
"specifically the first one."
msgstr ""
"URL y’ishusho igomba kwerekana icyo kirimo. Iyo shusho igomba kuba "
"nibura ipima 200 x 200 pika; 600 x 316 pika ni yo inama yo kuba ari "
"byibuze, kandi ku bisubizo byiza kurushaho koreshwa ishusho ipima "
"byibuze 1200 x 630 pika. Ishyigikira imiterere ya PNG, JPEG na GIF. "
"Ntigomba gukoreshwa iyo og:image:url ikoreshwa. Icyitonderwa: iyo "
"hashyizweho amashusho menshi, serivisi nyinshi (urugero Facebook) "
"zifatira igihagararo kinini, atari cyane cyane icyambere."

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price amount"
msgstr "Agaciro k’Ibicuruzwa byo kuri Open Graph: Ingano y’igiciro"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price currency"
msgstr ""
"Agafishi ka Open Graph ku Bicuruzwa: Amafaranga yo kwishyura "
"(currency)"

msgid "Metatag: Pinterest"
msgstr "Meta tagi: Pinterest"

msgid "Provides support for Pinterest's custom meta tags."
msgstr "Itanga inkunga ku matagi ya meta yihariye ya Pinterest."

msgid "Pinterest: Description"
msgstr "Pinterest: Ibisobanuro"

msgid "Pinterest: ID"
msgstr "Pinterest: ID"

msgid "Pinterest: Media"
msgstr "Pinterest: Iby’itangazamakuru"

msgid "Pinterest: No hover"
msgstr "Pinterest: Nta kanda-yo hejuru (hover)"

msgid "Pinterest: No pin"
msgstr "Pinterest: Nta pin"

msgid "Pinterest: URL"
msgstr "Pinterest: URL"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags used to control how the site's content is consumed "
"by <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rwa meta tags bikoreshwa kugira ngo bigenzure uko ibikubiye "
"kuri uru rubuga bisomwa n’abantu kuri <a "
"href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."

msgid "The Canonical Pinterest object to pin."
msgstr "Ikintu gisa na Pinterest Canonical ugomba gukwiza (pin)."

msgid "The URL of media which should represent the content."
msgstr "URL y’igitangazamakuru kigomba kwerekana icyo gihugu."

msgid ""
"Do not show hovering Save or Search buttons, generated by the "
"Pinterest browser extensions."
msgstr ""
"Ntukwerekane buto zo kubika cyangwa zo gushakisha, bikozwe "
"n’inyongeramusaruro za Pinterest ziri muri mushakisha."

msgid "No pin"
msgstr "Nta pin."

msgid ""
"Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will "
"take precedence over all options below."
msgstr ""
"Ntugakomezeho ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose kuri iyi page. Iyo hitowe, iyi "
"nzira izaba ifite uburenganzira kurusha izindi nzira zose zibivugwa "
"hepfo."

msgid "Do not allow Pinterest visual search to happen from this page."
msgstr ""
"Ntukemere ko isakwa ry’amashusho rya Pinterest rikorwa kuri iyi "
"page."

msgid "The URL which should represent the content."
msgstr "URL igomba kugereranya iyo verisiyo y’ibiriho."

msgid ""
"The custom admin pages for managing Views meta tags at "
"/admin/config/search/metatag/views have been disabled for now, "
"hopefully they'll be back in a future release. Until then, the meta "
"tags can be managed directly on each individual view via the \"Meta "
"tags\" section."
msgstr ""
"Impapuro zihariye z’ubuyobozi (custom admin pages) zo gucunga meta "
"tags za Views kuri **/admin/config/search/metatag/views** zafashwe ko "
"zihagaritswe muri iki gihe. Twizere ko zizagaruka mu yindi verisiyo "
"izaza. Hagati aho, meta tags zishobora gucungwa ukoresheje inzira "
"iboneka kuri view imwe imwe, mu gice cyitwa **“Meta tags”**."

msgid ""
"To view a list of displays with meta tags set up, click on a view "
"name. To view a summary of meta tags configuration for a particular "
"display, click on the display name. If you need to set meta tags for a "
"specific view, choose Add views meta tags. Reverting the meta tags "
"removes the specific configuration and falls back to defaults."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ubone urutonde rw’ibigaragaza (displays) bifite meta tags "
"zashyizweho, kanda ku izina rya view. Kugira ngo urebe incamake ya "
"meta tags zateguwe kuri display runaka, kanda ku izina rya display. "
"Niba ukeneye gushyiraho meta tags kuri view runaka, hitamo **Add views "
"meta tags**. Gusubiza inyuma (reverting) meta tags byakuraho "
"igenamiterere ryihariye kandi bigasubira ku byahiswemo bisanzwe "
"(defaults)."

msgid "Do you want to revert meta tags for @view_name : @display_name?"
msgstr ""
"Urashaka gusubiza inyuma (revert) meta tags kuri @view_name : "
"@display_name?"

msgid ""
"You are about to revert the custom meta tags for the %display_name "
"display on the %view_name view. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Ugiye gusubiza inyuma (revert) meta tags zihariye kuri %display_name "
"nk’uko zigaragara ku %view_name. Iyi ntegikorwa ntishobora gusubizwa "
"inyuma."

msgid "Reverted meta tags for @view_name : @display_name"
msgstr ""
"Hagaruwe inyandiko ya meta yongeye guhindurwa kuri @view_name : "
"@display_name"

msgid "Mobile: Web Manifest"
msgstr "Mobile: Web Manifest"

msgid "Web Manifest"
msgstr "**Web Manifest**"

msgid "Image 'alt'"
msgstr "Igishushanyo “alt”"

msgid ""
"A description of what is in the image, not a caption. If the page "
"specifies an og:image it should specify og:image:alt."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro by’ibiri mu ifoto, si ibisobanuro ngufi (caption). Niba "
"urupapuro ruvuga og:image, igomba kandi guvuga og:image:alt."

msgid "Provides metatag support for Page Manager variants."
msgstr ""
"Itanga inkunga ya metatag ku buryo (variants) bw’abicisha bugufi "
"bafashwa na Page Manager."

msgid ""
"Identify which metatag groups should be available on which entity type "
"/ bundle combination. Unselected groups will not appear on the "
"configuration form for that entity type, reducing the size of the form "
"and increasing performance. If no groups are selected for a type, all "
"groups will appear."
msgstr ""
"Menya neza amatsinda ya metatag agomba kuboneka ku bwoko bw’ikintu "
"(entity type) / ihuriro ryabwo (bundle) bimwe. Amatsinda atatoranyijwe "
"ntazagaragara ku ifishi yo kwiyegeranya (configuration form) y’uwo "
"bwoko bw’ikintu, bityo bikagabanya ingano y’iyo fomu no kongera "
"imikorere (performance). Niba nta tsinda na rimwe ratoranyijwe kuri "
"ubwo bwoko, amatsinda yose azagaragara."

msgid ""
"This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two "
"directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the "
"sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a "
"translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them "
"with a comma. See <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr ""
"Iri meta tag ribwira Google. Hano hari amabwiriza abiri ashyigikirwa "
"kuri ubu: `nositelinkssearchbox` yo kuterekanira igikoresho cyo "
"gushakisha kwa sitelinks, na `notranslate` yo gusaba Google "
"kutagaragaza uburyo bwo gusobanura (translation) urupapuro. Zombi "
"zirashobora kongerwaho; ariko zitandukanywe n’akoma. Reba <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags Google yumva</a> kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye."

msgid "SVG icon"
msgstr "Ishusho igereranya ya SVG"

msgid "Pocket"
msgstr "Pocket"

msgid ""
"Warning: disabling the Global default metatag will prevent any "
"metatags from being used."
msgstr ""
"Iburira: guhagarika “Global default metatag” bizabuza metatags "
"zose gukoreshwa."

msgid ""
"Set the maximum size of an image preview for this page in a search "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Shyiraho ingano ntarengwa y’isesengura ry’igishushanyo (image "
"preview) kuri iyi page mu ntonde y’ibaruramari ry’ubushakashatsi."

msgid "Standard - a default image preview may be shown."
msgstr ""
"Bisanzwe - ishusho yo kureba hakoreshejwe icyitegererezo ishobora "
"kugaragara."

msgid ""
"Large - a larger image preview, up to the width of the viewport, may "
"be shown."
msgstr ""
"Kinini - hasohoka igice kigaragara cy’ishusho kinini kurusha izindi, "
"gishobora kugera ku bugari bwa ecran (viewport)."

msgid "Metatag: Favicons"
msgstr "Metatag: Ama Favicons"

msgid ""
"Provides an absolute URL to a specially formatted version of the "
"current page designed for 'feature phones', mobile phones that do not "
"support modern browser standards. See the <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>official "
"Google Mobile SEO Guide</a> for details on how the page should be "
"formatted."
msgstr ""
"Iha URL yuzuye (absolute) igana ku ipaji ihinduwemo uko bikenewe ku "
"buryo bushingiye ku “feature phones”, ari inyuma ya telefone "
"ngendanwa zidashyigikira amahame ya kijyambere ya mushakisha "
"(browser). Reba iyi <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>Inyandiko "
"Nkuru (official) ya Google Mobile SEO Guide</a> kugira ngo umenye "
"ibisobanuro by’uko iyo ipaji igomba guhindurwa."

msgid "Open Graph: Video duration"
msgstr "Open Graph: Igihe amashusho bimara"

msgid ""
"The date this content will expire, with an optional time value. Needs "
"to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Itariki iki gice cy’iyi nyandiko kizaba gisunikwa (kimara) irangiye, "
"hakajyamo igihe kidahindutse (bidashoboka). Birasabwa ko iba iri mu "
"buryo bwa <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Itariki iyi nyandiko yahinduweho bwa nyuma, hongerwaho agaciro "
"k’igihe gishoboka. Ikeneye kuba mu buryo bwa <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was published on, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Itariki iyi mbuga/iyi nkuru byatangarijweho, hamwe n’igihe gishobora "
"no kuba kivuganyweho (optional). Bikenewe ko biba mu buryo bwa <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format. Can be the same as the 'Article modification date' "
"tag."
msgstr ""
"Itariki iyi nyandiko yahinduwe bwa nyuma, hakiyongeraho indangagaciro "
"y’igihe (bidashoboka ariko bishoboka). Ikeneye kuba mu buryo bwa <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>. Ibyo "
"bishobora kugirana isano n’itariki “Article modification date”."

msgid ""
"Preferred page location or URL to help eliminate duplicate content for "
"search engines, e.g., <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."
msgstr ""
"Ahantu hasabwa ku rupapuro cyangwa URL bihitiyemo gufasha kurandura "
"ibirimo biboneka inshuro nyinshi (duplicate content) ku byemeza "
"imashini zishakisha, urugero: "
"<em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."

msgid "All meta tags in the \"@group\" group."
msgstr "Inyandiko zose za meta mu itsinda rya “@group”."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Pragma meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Bikoreshwa kugenzura niba mushakisha ibika urupapuro runaka muri cache "
"yayo. Ikoreshwa kenshi ntabwo bikoreshwa. Bikwiriye gukoreshwa ihuzwa "
"n’itagisi ya meta ya **Pragma**."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='next' link."
msgstr ""
"Bikoreshwa mu gutanga ibikubiyemo by’amapaji (paginated) "
"hifashishijwe URL ifite isano rel='next'."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Cache-Control "
"meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Byakoreshejwe kugenzura niba mushakisha ishobora kubika iyo page "
"by’agateganyo (cache) kuri mudasobwa/ahantu ho uyikoresha. Ntabwo "
"bikoreshwa kenshi. Bikwiriye gukoreshwa hamwe n’itagisi ya meta ya "
"**Cache-Control**."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='prev' link."
msgstr ""
"Byifashishwa ku bigize urupapuro rufite ibyiciro (pagination) "
"hakoreshejwe guha URL ihuza rya rel='prev'."

msgid ""
"Provides the fifteen <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iha urutonde rwa meta tags cumi n’itanu <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> biva muri <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid ""
"Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iha ama meta tag mirongo ine yongeweho ku <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid "Metatag: Hreflang"
msgstr "Metatag: Hreflang"

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string that must contain the 'polling-uri=' "
"value with the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML file</a>. May also contain 'frequency=' value set to either 30, "
"60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default) which specifies (in minutes) how often "
"the URL should be polled."
msgstr ""
"Urudodo rw’amayobera (string) rwanditse ukoresheje ibimenyetso byo "
"gutandukanya “;” rugomba kubamo agaciro ka **`polling-uri=`** "
"gafite URL yuzuye igana dosiye ya <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML</a>. Rishobora kandi kubamo agaciro ka **`frequency=`** "
"gashyirwaho kuri 30, 60, 360, 720 cyangwa 1440 (isanzwe) bivuga (mu "
"minota) uko URL igomba gukorwa isuzumwa (poll) kenshi."

msgid "Metatag: Page Manager"
msgstr "Metatag: Umuyobozi w’Ipaji"

msgid "If checked, the field will be placed in the sidebar on entity forms."
msgstr ""
"Ki ipasiwe, uriya murimo uzashyirwa muri sidebar ku mpapuro "
"z’ibikoresho (entity forms)."

msgid "Use sidebar: Yes"
msgstr "Koresha iruhande ry’umurongo: Yego"

msgid ""
"Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should "
"expire. The date must to be an <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-compliant "
"date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. "
"'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being "
"cached entirely."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura igihe agaciro k’ikarita y’imbere (cache) yo kuri iyi page "
"igomba kuzabanza gushira muri browser. Itariki igomba kuba iriho "
"nk’<a href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>umugozi "
"w’itariki uhuza na RFC-1123</a>, ishyirwa mu gihe "
"cy’Iburengerazuba bw’isi/Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), urugero: 'Thu, "
"01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Bishyiraho '0' kugira ngo page ibike "
"(cache) ntibikore na gato."

msgid ""
"The number of seconds to wait before refreshing the page. May also "
"force redirect to another page using the format '5; "
"url=https://example.com/', which would be triggered after five "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Umubare w’amasegonda yo gutegereza mbere yo kurushaho kugarura "
"urupapuro. Ashobora no gukoresha itegeko ryo kwimurira kuri urindi "
"rupapuro hakoreshejwe ukoresheje imiterere “5; "
"url=https://example.com/”, ibyo bikazaba bimaze amasegonda atanu."

msgid ""
"The secure URL to an audio file that complements this object. All "
"'http://' URLs will automatically be converted to 'https://'."
msgstr ""
"URL ikingira umutekano yemerera gukoresha dosiye y’ijwi ibihuje "
"n’iyi shusho. Aderesi zose za “http://” zizahita zihindurwamo "
"zibe “https://”."

msgid "Metatag Extended Permissions"
msgstr "Uruhushya rwagutse rwa metatag"

msgid "Access %tag in %group"
msgstr "Fungura %tag muri %group"

msgid ""
"A color in hexadecimal format, e.g. '#0000ff' for blue; must include "
"the '#' symbol. Used by some browsers to control the background color "
"of the toolbar, the color used with an icon, etc."
msgstr ""
"Ibara ryanditswe mu buryo bwa hexadecimal, urugero: `'#0000ff'` ryo ku "
"ibara ry’ubururu; rigomba kubamo ikimenyetso `#`. Bimwe mu byuma "
"by’urubuga (browsers) bikoresha iri bara ryo kugenzura ibara "
"ry’inyuma (background) rya toolbar, irya bikoreshwa n’icon, "
"n’ibindi."

msgid ""
"The <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are used to "
"control how Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn and other social networking "
"sites interpret the site's content.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Indangagaciro za <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta</a> "
"zikoreshwa mu kugenzura uko Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn n’andi "
"mbuga nkoranyambaga bisobanura (bihindura) ibikubiye kurubuga "
"rwawe.<br><br>Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> igufasha kureba uko ibikubiyemo bizagaragara iyo "
"bigabanyijwe kuri Facebook, no gukemura ibibazo byose byabaye ku "
"indangagaciro zawe za Open Graph."

msgid ""
"These <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are for "
"describing products.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Izi <a href='https://ogp.me/'>meta tags zo kuri Open Graph</a> zifasha "
"gusobanura ibicuruzwa.<br><br>Igikoresho cya Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> kiguha uburyo bwo kureba uko ibyo wiyandikishije "
"bizaramburwa iyo bishyizwe kuri Facebook kandi bigufashe gukosora "
"ibibazo byose bigaragara kuri meta tags zawe za Open Graph."

msgid ""
"The URL to a unique image representing the content of the page. Do not "
"use a generic image such as your website logo, author photo, or other "
"image that spans multiple pages. Images larger than 120x120px will be "
"resized and cropped square based on longest dimension. Images smaller "
"than 60x60px will not be shown. If the 'type' is set to Photo then the "
"image must be at least 280x150px."
msgstr ""
"URL y’ishusho idasanzwe ihagararira ibiri kuri iyo page. Ntukoreshe "
"ishushso isanzwe nka logo y’urubuga, ifoto y’umwanditsi, cyangwa "
"indi shusho ikwirakwira ku mapaji menshi. Ishusho ziruta 120x120px "
"zizahindurwamo ingano kandi zikanyagwa kugira ngo zibe kare "
"hakurikijwe uruhande rurerure kurusha izindi (longest dimension). "
"Ishusho zo munsi ya 60x60px ntizigengwa. Niba ‘type’ yashyizwe "
"kuri Photo, icyo gihe iyo shusho igomba kuba nibura 280x150px."

msgid ""
"The full URL for an MP4 video (h.264) or audio (AAC) stream, takes "
"precedence over the other media player field."
msgstr ""
"URL yose yuzuye ya videwo ya MP4 (h.264) cyangwa urumuri rw’ijwi "
"(AAC) ifata umwanya wa mbere kurusha izindi nzego z’itangazamakuru "
"z’uriya mwanya w’uwundi mukinnyi w’itangazamakuru."

msgid ""
"To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle "
"(content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings "
"enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to "
"output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It "
"is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the "
"image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag "
"descriptions for size recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ukoreshe “tokens” mu bibanza by’amasanduku "
"y’amashusho (image fields), agasanduku k’amashusho ku rwego "
"rw’iyo “entity bundle” (nko ku bwoko bw’inyandiko, term, "
"n’ibindi) kigomba kuba gifite igenamiterere ryo kugaragaza "
"“Token” rishoboye (enabled). Byongeye kandi, agasanduku "
"k’amashusho ntikagombye kuba gihishwa (hidden), kandi kigomba kuba "
"cyashyizweho kugaragaza nk’ishusho (output as an image), urugero "
"hakoreshejwe “Thumbnail” (abaca amashusho) nk’uko byateguwe na "
"“field formatter”. Birasabwa kandi gukoresha “image style” "
"ibereye ihindura ingano y’ishusho aho kuyigaragaza uko yari imeze; "
"reba ibisobanuro byihariye kuri “meta tag” kugira ngo urebe "
"ibisabwa ku ngano (size recommendations)."

msgid ""
"This will be able to extract the URL from an image field if the field "
"is configured properly."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bizashobora gukuramo URL mu ifishi y’ishusho igihe iyo ifishi "
"ihamagawe neza."

msgid ""
"Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little "
"known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by "
"browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>most common "
"options</a> are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. "
"If you follow the <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA "
"Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"
msgstr ""
"Byifashishwa mu kugena amanota y’ukwitaho ku buryo bikwiriye "
"abatereranyijwe. Iyi tag ifite ingaruka zito cyane zizwi ku mikorere "
"ya moteri zishakisha (search engine rankings), ariko ishobora "
"gukoreshwa n’abashakisha mu gihe cyo gutekereza ku byerekeye urubuga "
"(browser), inyongeramusaruro z’abashakisha (browser extensions), "
"ndetse n’udushakashatsi dukorerwa ku bikoresho (apps). Ibyo bikunze "
"kugaragara birimo <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>inzira nyinshi "
"zisanzwe</a> ni: rusange, ku bantu bakuze (mature), byahawe imbibi "
"(restricted), imyaka 14, n’ibyizewe ku bana (safe for kids). Niba "
"ukurikiza <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>inyandiko "
"z’imikoreshereze ya RTA</a> ugomba kwinjiza "
"RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"

msgid "@label of @type"
msgstr "@label ya @type"

msgid "@label of @type @entity-type-label"
msgstr "@label ya @type @entity-type-label"

msgid "This plugin will be cloned from these settings for each custom tag."
msgstr ""
"Plugin iyi izokoporwa (cloned) mu byo byashyizwe muri izi ntagi zose "
"(settings) kuri tagi yihariye (custom tag) yiyo yose."

msgid "Place field in collapsed details container"
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo umurima mu kintu cy’amakuru cyagabweho mu buryo bwo "
"gusubira inyuma (collapsed details)"

msgid "Trim method for trimmable tags."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukata ku bice bishobora kugabanywa (trimmable tags)."

msgid "Tag-specific maximum length"
msgstr "Uburebure ntarengwa ntarengwa kuri buri tagi"

msgid "Tag maximum length in characters"
msgstr "Ubugure ntarengwa bw’inyandiko muri imiterere (characters)"

msgid ""
"Adds individual permissions for each meta tag, allowing for "
"fine-grained access to the meta tags. Note: this may lead to "
"performance issues on the permissions admin page, please see the "
"included README.txt file for details."
msgstr ""
"Ongeraho uruhushya ku giti cye kuri buri tagi ya meta, bityo "
"bikemerera kugenzura byimbitse uko hagerwaho kuri izi tagi. "
"Icyitonderwa: ibi bishobora gutera ibibazo by’imikorere "
"(performance) ku ipaji y’ubuyobozi bw’uruhushya, nyamuneka reba "
"dosiye ya README.txt iherekejeho ibisobanuro birambuye."

msgid "Mask icon color"
msgstr "Ibara ry’iyubisi ry’akamenyetso (icon)"

msgid ""
"Color attribute for SVG (mask) icon in hexadecimal format, e.g. "
"'#0000ff'. Setting it will break HTML validation. If not set macOS "
"Safari ignores the Mask Icon entirely, making the Icon: SVG completely "
"useless."
msgstr ""
"Ibara (attribute) rya SVG (mask) ikirango mu buryo bwa hexadecimal, "
"urugero: `#0000ff`. Kuyishyiraho bizavuna bigenzurwa (HTML "
"validation). Niba itashyizweho, macOS Safari yirengagiza rwose Mask "
"Icon, bigatuma Icon: SVG ibe akarusho koko (nta umumaro igira)."

msgid "Mask icon (SVG)"
msgstr "Ishusho y’icyitegererezo (SVG)"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price availability"
msgstr "Gufungura Igishushanyo (Open Graph) ku Igicuruzwa: Ibiciro biraboneka"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Product condition"
msgstr "Open Graph Product: Imiterere y’umusaruro"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Retailer Item ID"
msgstr ""
"**Agafishi ya Open Graph ku Igicuruzwa: Indangamuntu y’Uwacuruzi "
"(Retailer) y’Ikintu**"

msgid "Product condition"
msgstr "Imiterere y’umusaruro"

msgid "The condition of the product."
msgstr "Imimerere y’umusaruro."

msgid "Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "ID y’Ingingo y’Umucuruzi"

msgid "The ID of the product as provided by the retailer."
msgstr ""
"Aho indangamuntu y’umuryango w’inyongeramusaruro (ID) ihabwa "
"n’umucuruzi."

msgid ""
"Empty update script to clear the site's caches so the new token "
"replacement functionality will work."
msgstr ""
"Impindurorwandiko (script) idafite ikintu na kimwe yo gusiba cache za "
"uru rubuga kugira ngo imikorere yo gusimbuza ibimenyetso (tokens) "
"mishya ikore neza."

msgid "Metatag Trimming Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo gukuraho iminyururu ya Metatag"

msgid ""
"Many Meta-Tags can be trimmed on a specific length for search engine "
"optimization.<br/>If the value is set to '0' or left empty, the whole "
"Metatag will be untrimmed."
msgstr ""
"Meta-Tag nyinshi zishobora gucibwa ku burebure runaka hagamijwe kunoza "
"SEO y’ubushakashatsi.<br/>Niba agaciro gashyizwe kuri '0' cyangwa "
"kakasigara ubusa, Metatag yose nticibwa."

msgid "Meta Tags:"
msgstr "Meta tags:"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag after the word on the given value"
msgstr ""
"Kurandura igitekerezo cya Meta (meta tag) uhereye ku ijambo riri kuri "
"iyo ndangagaciro yatanzwe"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag on the given value"
msgstr "Kata (trim) agaciro k’isanduku ya Meta ku gaciro uvuzwe"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag before the word on the given value"
msgstr "Gabanya (trim) tag ya Meta mbere y’ijambo kuri agaciro kapfuyeho."

msgid "Wrap the meta tags in a collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Ongera ufunge utags zo mu mutwe (meta tags) mu gasanduku kagaragazwa "
"nko kurambika (collapsed details)."

msgid ""
"If checked, the contents of the field will be placed inside a "
"collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ibikubiye muri iki gice bizashyirwa mu kirango "
"cy’ibirimo kirimo (collapsed details container)."

msgid "Use details container: Yes"
msgstr "Koresha agasanduku k’udusobanuro: Yego"

msgid "Use details container: No"
msgstr "Koresha akamenyetso k’utumenyekane (details container): Oya"

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958; -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Amakuru y’imiterere y’aho (geo-spatial) mu buryo bwa 'latitude; "
"longitude', urugero '50.167958; -97.133185' ; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='reba Wikipedia kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye ku "
"buryo bwa geografiya y’imipimo (coordinate system)'>reba Wikipedia "
"kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye</a>."

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude, longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>see Wikipedia for "
"details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Amakuru y’uburyo-amakuru (geo-spatial) mu buryo bwa 'latitude, "
"longitude', urugero: '50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>reba Wikipedia kugira ngo "
"ubone ibisobanuro</a>."

msgid "Token Or"
msgstr "Ikimenyetso Cyangwa"

msgid "Add max height value"
msgstr "Ongeramo agaciro k’uburebure ntarengwa (max height)"

msgid "Metatag Custom Routes (Paths)"
msgstr "Imiterere ya Meta yo Gutanga Inzira (Paths) Zihariye"

msgid "Route / Path"
msgstr "Inzira / Inzira y’inyandiko"

msgid ""
"Enter the route (path) for this new configuration, starting with a "
"leading slash.<br />Note: this must already exist as a path in Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Kwinjiza inzira (path) y’iyi igenamigambi rishya, utangire "
"n’umurongo ugana (leading slash).<br />Icyitonderwa: iyi igomba kuba "
"isanzwe ibaho nka path muri Drupal."

msgid "Site validation: SIWECOS"
msgstr "Gusuzuma urubuga: SIWECOS"

msgid "Google Site Verification"
msgstr "Kugenzura Urubuga rwa Google"

msgid "SIWECOS"
msgstr "**SIWECOS**"

msgid "Metatag widget options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y’igikoresho cya metatag"

msgid ""
"Various options for the field widget used on entity forms, e.g. on "
"content type forms."
msgstr ""
"Amahitamo atandukanye agenewe ishyirahamwe ry’igenamigambi (field "
"widget) rikoreshwa ku mpapuro z’ikintu/umuryango (entity forms), "
"urugero ku mpapuro z’icya content type."

msgid "Scroll maximum height"
msgstr "Erekana uburebure ntarengwa ntarengwa bwo kumanuka"

msgid "eg 500px or 8rem"
msgstr "urugero 500px cyangwa 8rem"

msgid ""
"To enable scrolling please enter a value and its units, e.g. 500px, "
"8rem, etc. Removing this value will remove the scroll."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ushobore kuzunguza, andika umubare n’ibipimo byawo, "
"urugero: 500px, 8rem, n’ibindi. Gukuraho uru gaciro bizakuraho "
"n’uruzinduko."

msgid "Define the author of a page."
msgstr "Kugena umwanditsi w’urupapuro."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> is suggested for when the "
"basic content tokens are not flexible enough, e.g. to make a meta tag "
"show the contents of one field if it is filled in or another if the "
"first one is empty."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> irasabwa iyo “token” "
"z’ibanze zitaroroshye bihagije, urugero, kugira ngo tag ya meta "
"yerekane ibiri muri urwego rumwe iyo rwuzuye, cyangwa undi iyo urwa "
"mbere rutaruzuye."

msgid "Href per language"
msgstr "Href ku rurimi buri rurimi"

msgid ""
"This was expected to be an array but it is not: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Byari biteganijwe ko byaba urutonde (array) ariko si byo:  \n"
"%value"

msgid ""
"This could not be unserialized: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Ibi ntibishobora gukurwa mu buryo bwa unserialization:  \n"
"%value"

msgid "Metatag Field Diff"
msgstr "**Itandukaniro ry’irangantego ry’Metatag**"

msgid "Use Maxlength module to force these limits?"
msgstr ""
"Koresha module ya Maxlength kugira ngo ushyireho ibi bigarukira "
"birenze?"

msgid "Install the Maxlength module to enable this option."
msgstr "Shyiramo module ya Maxlength kugira ngo ubashe gufungura iyi miterere."

msgid "Intended workflow"
msgstr "Uburyo bwateganyijwe bwo gukora (workflow)"

msgid ""
"Allows assigning meta tags to be used on custom routes, equivalent to "
"custom paths."
msgstr ""
"Byemerera gushyiraho meta tags zizakoreshwa ku nzira (routes) zigenze, "
"zihwanye na custom paths."

msgid ""
"Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not "
"links should be followed. See <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>the W3C "
"specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same "
"purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr ""
"Erekana kuri za moteri zishakisha n’abandi bakurururubuga (page "
"scrapers) niba inama zihuza (links) zigomba gukurikizwa cyangwa "
"zitakurikizwa. Reba <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>ibisobanuro "
"bya W3C</a> kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye. Icyitonderwa: ibi "
"bifite intego imwe n’uko byakorwa n’umutwe wa HTTP (HTTP header) "
"w’izo ngingo zimwe."

msgid "Max Snippet"
msgstr "Incamake Ngufi Kurushaho"

msgid ""
"Use a number character as a textual snippet for this search result. "
"\"0\" equals \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" will let the search engine decide "
"the most effective length."
msgstr ""
"Koresha intaderi ngirakamaro (character) y’umubare nk’agace "
"k’ikibazo (textual snippet) kuri iyi raporo y’iyi shakisha. "
"“0” ihwanye na “nosnippet”. “-1” izemerera moteri "
"y’ishakisha guhitamo uburebure bukwiye kurushaho."

msgid ""
"Use a maximum of number seconds as a video snippet for videos on this "
"page in search results. \"0\" will use a static a image. \"-1\" means "
"there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Koresha umubare ntarengwa w’amasegonda nk’insimburangingo y’iyo "
"videwo kuri izi videwo ziri kuri iyi page mu nteganyanyandiko "
"z’ishakisha. “0” bizakoresha ifoto ihagaze. “-1” bivuze ko "
"nta mbibi ibaho."

msgid "Max Image Preview"
msgstr "Igaragaza ry’inyandiko nini y’ishusho (Preview)"

msgid "Unavailable after date"
msgstr "Ntiboneka nyuma yitariki"

msgid "Do not show this page in search results after the specified date"
msgstr ""
"Ntugere agaragaze iyi page mu nteganyirizo y’ibisubizo "
"by’ubushakashatsi nyuma y’iyo tariki yagenwe"

msgid ""
"There were no overridden Metatag records that needed to be updated to "
"store the data using JSON."
msgstr ""
"Nta mwanditsi wa Metatag warenze (overridden) wari uhari wakeneye "
"kuvugururwa kugira ngo amakuru abitswe hakoreshejwe JSON."

msgid ""
"Processed @processed of @total updating Metatag records with the "
"Publisher or Name meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Byakozwe @processed kuri @total byo kuvugurura inyandiko za Metatag "
"hamwe na Publisher cyangwa Name meta tags."

msgid "There were no Metatag records to update."
msgstr "Nta nyandiko za Metatag zari zitaragizwa kuvugururwa."

msgid "Removed meta tags from the @config Metatag configuration."
msgstr "Byakuyeho meta tag zavuye muri porogaramu ya @config Metatag."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus is not enabled, nothing to do."
msgstr "Meta tag: Google Plus ntabwo yifashishijwe, nta cyo wakora."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus has been uninstalled."
msgstr "Meta tag: Google Plus yamaze gukurwaho."

msgid ""
"Corrected the Twitter Card \"type\" value in the @config Metatag "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Byakosowe agaciro ka “type” k’ikarita ya Twitter (Twitter Card) "
"muri igenamiterere rya @config Metatag."

msgid "The computed meta tags for the entity."
msgstr "Meta tags zibaruwe kuri iyo *entity*."

msgid "Deprecated module, do not use. Will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr "Module yahagaritswe, ntuyikoreshe. Izakurwaho muri 3.0.0."

msgid ""
"Notes:<ul><li>no other fields are required for a Summary "
"card</li><li>Media player card requires the 'title', 'description', "
"'media player URL', 'media player width', 'media player height' and "
"'image' fields,</li><li>Summary Card with Large Image card requires "
"the 'Summary' field and the 'image' field,</li><li>App Card requires "
"the 'iPhone app ID' field, the 'iPad app ID' field and the 'Google "
"Play app ID' field,</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Inyandiko:<ul><li>ntayandi makuru asabwa kuri “Summary "
"card”</li><li>“Media player card” isaba imirima ya “title”, "
"“description”, “media player URL”, “media player width”, "
"“media player height” n’iyo “image”,</li><li>“Summary Card "
"with Large Image” isaba imirima ya “Summary” n’iyo "
"“image”,</li><li>“App Card” isaba imirima ya “iPhone app "
"ID”, “iPad app ID” na “Google Play app ID”,</li></ul>"

msgid "Separator used with multiple values"
msgstr "Itandukanyirizo rikoreshwa igihe hari indangagaciro nyinshi"

msgid ""
"Controls the separator used when a meta tag allows multiple values. "
"Multiple characters can be used together, it does not have to be one "
"single character long. Defaults to \":default\"."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura itandukanya rikoreshwa iyo meta tag yemera indangagaciro "
"nyinshi. Ushobora gukoresha inyuguti nyinshi hamwe, ntibikenewe ko iba "
"ari inyuguti imwe gusa. Bisanzwe bihuzwa na “:default”."

msgid ""
"Multiple values may be used, separated by `:delimiter`. Note: Tokens "
"that return multiple values will be handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ushobora gukoresha indangagaciro nyinshi, zigacishwa n’akamenyetso "
"ka `:delimiter`. Icyitonderwa: Indangagaciro (tokens) zisubiza "
"indangagaciro nyinshi zizahindurirwa mu buryo bwikora."

msgid ""
"The full URL for loading a media player, specifically an iframe for an "
"embedded video rather than the URL to a page that contains a player. "
"Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"URL yuzuye yo gukuramo/kwamburaho umukinnyi wa media, cyane cyane iyo "
"iframe yo gushyiramo video, aho kuba URL y’urupapuro rufite "
"umukinnyi. Birasabwa iyo ukoresheje ubwoko bwa **Player Card**."

msgid ""
"The height of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Uburebure bwa iframe ya media player, muri pigiseli. Birasabwa mugihe "
"ukoresha ubwoko bwa Player Card."

msgid ""
"The width of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Ubugari bwa iframe ya mutoza w’amashusho (media player), mu bipimo "
"bya pigiseli. Birakenewe iyo ukoresha ubwoko bwa **Player Card**."

msgid ""
"This will be truncated to a maximum of %max characters after any "
"tokens are processed."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bizagabanurwa ku mubare ntarengwa w’inyuguti **%max** nyuma "
"y’uko ibimenyetso (tokens) bimaze gutunganywa."

msgid ""
"Because of how tokens are processed in meta tags, use of the Maxlength "
"module may not provide an accurate representation of the actual "
"current length of each meta tag, so it may cause more problem than it "
"is worth."
msgstr ""
"Ukurikije uko tokens zikorwa muri meta tags, gukoresha module ya "
"Maxlength ntibishobora gutanga uko bingana mu buryo nyabwo "
"n’uburebure buriho kuri buri meta tag, bityo bishobora gutuma habaho "
"ibibazo kurusha uko byakemura."

msgid ""
"Control the Metatag settings pages. Does not control access to the "
"Metatag field on content forms, etc, use the Field Permissions module "
"or hook_form_alter()."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura impapuro z’igenamiterere rya Metatag. Ntabwo igenzura "
"uburenganzira bwo kubona inagenamiterere rya Metatag ku bifishi "
"by’iyandikwa ry’ibikubiyemo (content forms), n’ibindi; ukoreshe "
"module ya **Field Permissions** cyangwa **hook_form_alter()**."

msgid "End of the word trimming"
msgstr "Kurangiza gutema amagambo ku mpera y’umurongo"

msgid "This module provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr "Iyi module itanga inkunga yo gusobanura no gucunga meta tag zihariye."

msgid ""
"The module provides the option to create different <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Custom Tags\"</a> to use for different "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Ubu buryo (module) butanga amahitamo yo gukora <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">“Amatangazo Yihariye (Custom "
"Tags)”</a> atandukanye yo kuyakoresha intego zinyuranye."

msgid "The best way of using Metatag: Custom Tags is as follows:"
msgstr "Uburyo bwiza bwo gukoresha Metatag: Custom Tags ni bukurikira:"

msgid ""
"Create the <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, "
"fill in the specific values that every page should have."
msgstr ""
"Hanga <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, "
"wuzuze indangagaciro zihariye buri ipaji igomba kuba ifite."

msgid "Configure Custom tags below."
msgstr "Hindura amagambo yihariye hepfo."

msgid "Metatag: Custom Tags"
msgstr "Metatag: Utondekanyo twihariye (Custom Tags)"

msgid "Provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr "Itanga inkunga yo gusobanura no gucunga meta tagi zigenze (custom) ."

msgid "Add Custom tag"
msgstr "Ongeraho Tag yihariye"

msgid "Administer Custom tags"
msgstr "Bicunge Inyandiko-Mpuzabikorwa zihariye (Custom tags)"

msgid "Control the main settings pages and modify custom tags."
msgstr ""
"Erekana igenamiterere rikuru ry’amapaji kandi uhindure tagi "
"z’ubushake."

msgid "Delete Custom tag"
msgstr "Hakuraho tag yihariye"

msgid "Specify the name of the custom tag."
msgstr "Erekana izina ry’ikimenyetso (tag) gihariye."

msgid "Specify the description of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Sobanura ibisobanuro by’iyo Tag isanzwe (Custom)."

msgid "Select the HTML element of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Hitamo ikintu cya HTML kiri mu tagi yihariye (Custom)."

msgid "Value attribute"
msgstr "Agaciro ka atribusiyo"

msgid "Created %label Custom tag."
msgstr "Byakozwe %label Ikirango gitegeko (Custom tag)."

msgid "Updated %label Custom tag."
msgstr "Ahinduwe %label Ikirango gihindurwamo."

msgid "Edit Custom tag @label"
msgstr "Hindura ikirango giteguwe @label"

msgid ""
"These custom tags are designed to use the custom purpose on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Izi tagi zidasanzwe zagenewe gukoreshwa ku ntego zidasanzwe ziri kuri "
"urubuga."

msgid "The entities routes metatags must be added by fields."
msgstr ""
"Inzira (routes) za metatags z’izo “entities” zigomba kongerwaho "
"ukoresheje “fields” (imigendekere y’inyongeramusaruro)."

msgid "Trimming options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo gukata"

msgid ""
"A list of characters to trim at the end of all metatags. Provide a "
"single string without any separators, e.g. \"|,.\" (instead of \"| , "
".\"). Note that spaces, tabs, new lines, carriage returns and vertical "
"tabs (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") will be trimmed automatically and do not "
"need to be listed in this field. The trimming is applied at the very "
"end after the tag is trimmed for length, and after the trimming option "
"was executed."
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rw’inyuguti zo guca ku mpera za metatags zose. Tanga "
"agaciro kamwe (string) utabushyiramo utandukanya, urugero: `\"|,.\"` "
"(aho kuba `\"| , .\"`). Menya ko utubanza tw’umwanya, tab, imirongo "
"mishya (new lines), carriage returns, na vertical tabs (`\" "
"\\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\"`) bifashwe bugakomeshwa (trim) byikora kandi "
"ntibikeneye gushyirwa muri iki gice. Gukuraho bikorwa ku mpera nyazo, "
"nyuma y’uko tag igabanyijwe kugira ngo ihure n’uburebure (trim) "
"kandi nyuma y’uko hitanditsweho igenamiterere ryo gukuraho (trimming "
"option)."

msgid "Configuration instance"
msgstr "Urugero rw’imiterere (configuration)"

msgid ""
"Meta tag configuration, stored as either a serialized array or a "
"JSON-encoded string."
msgstr ""
"Imiterere ya meta tag, ibikwa haba mu buryo bwa array iseriyalize "
"(serialized array) cyangwa nk’umugozi wa JSON ugaragazwa ukoze "
"(JSON-encoded string)."

msgid "Expected an array but got null or other type for group: @group_name"
msgstr ""
"Byari byitezwe array, ariko habonetse null cyangwa indi bwoko "
"bw’injyana kuri group: @group_name"

msgid "Optional suffix to add"
msgstr "Imbata y’inyongera ushobora kongeramo"

msgid "Element of the HTML tag. e.g. meta, link, etc."
msgstr "Igice cy’igitambo cya HTML. Urugero: meta, link, n’ibindi."

msgid ""
"The name of the html value attribute. e.g. content, href, charset, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Izina rya attribute y’agaciro ka HTML (value attribute). urugero: "
"content, href, charset, n’ibindi."

msgid ""
"Enter a unique identifier for this custom tag. This identifier can "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores. This is only used "
"internally, it is not used in the actual HTML output."
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo indangamuntu idasanzwe kuri uru rwego rwihariye (custom tag). "
"Iyi ndangamuntu ishobora kuba irimo inyuguti z’inyuguti nto "
"(lowercase), imibare n’amanota yo hasi (underscores). Ikoreshwa gusa "
"imbere mu kazi k’ubuyobozi (internally), kandi ntabwo ikoreshwa mu "
"isohoka nyir’izina rya HTML."

msgid ""
"Select the Value attribute of the Custom tag. This determines which "
"HTML attribute will contain the user-provided content."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo agaciro ka *Value* ku tagi *Custom*. Ibi ni byo bigena ry’uko "
"iyihembwa ya HTML izabikamo amakuru atanzwe n’umukoresha."

msgid ""
"Define the HTML attributes for this custom meta tag. The first "
"attribute serves as the primary identifier and is required. Additional "
"attributes are optional and provide fixed values for all instances of "
"this tag."
msgstr ""
"Sobanura indangagaciro z’HTML z’iri tagi yihariye ya meta. "
"Icyiciro cya mbere kigira nk’iranga nyamukuru kandi kirakenewe. "
"Indangagaciro ziyongera zirahari mu bushake kandi zitanga "
"indangagaciro zihoraho kuri buri enstance z’iyi tagi."

msgid "Primary attribute (Required)"
msgstr "Atribite y’ibanze (Ibanza uko bigenwa)"

msgid "Additional attribute @num"
msgstr "Uruhushya rw’inyongera @num"

msgid "This attribute identifies the meta tag and is required."
msgstr "Iyi biranga bimenyesha meta tag kandi irakenewe."

msgid "This attribute provides a fixed value for all instances of this tag."
msgstr ""
"Icyo kintu gitanga agaciro kagenwe kuri buri cyiciro cy’iki "
"kimenyetso (tag)."

msgid "Common values: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."
msgstr ""
"Indangagaciro zisanzwe: izina, indangagaciro (property), rel, "
"http-equiv, itemprop."

msgid "Additional attribute name (e.g., type, sizes)."
msgstr "Izina ry’inyongera ry’ikiranga (urugero: ubwoko, ubunini)."

msgid ""
"For new tags, defaults to the machine name. For existing tags, this "
"identifies the specific meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Ku byiciro bishya, ihinduka ku izina ry’imashini. Ku byiciro "
"bisanzwe bihari, ibi bigaragaza meta tag yihariye."

msgid "Fixed value for this attribute."
msgstr "Agaciro gihoraho kuri iyi nyandiko (attribute)."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h4>Common Examples:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Basic meta tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"description\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Open Graph tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Link with type:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Additional attribute: type "
"= \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" "
"type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        "
"</ul>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"```html\n"
"        <h4:Iby’ingirakamaro Bikunze Kugaragara:</h4>\n"
"   "
"     <ul>\n"
"          <li><strong>Meta tag y’ibanze:</strong><br>\n"
" "
"           Atributi y’ingenzi: name = \"description\"<br>\n"
"         "
"   Ibyo bigaragara: &lt;meta name=\"description\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          <li><strong>Open Graph "
"tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atributi y’ingenzi: property = "
"\"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Ibyo bigaragara: &lt;meta "
"property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n"
"            Atributi "
"y’ingenzi: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Ibyo "
"bigaragara: &lt;meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" "
"/&gt;</li>\n"
"          <li><strong>Link ifite ubwoko:</strong><br>\n"
"  "
"          Atributi y’ingenzi: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            "
"Atributi y’inyongera: type = \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            "
"Ibyo bigaragara: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" "
"href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"       ```"

msgid "At least one attribute with both name and value must be provided."
msgstr "Nibura hatangwa ikiranga kimwe gifite izina n’agaciro byombi."

msgid "The primary attribute name and value are required."
msgstr "Atribusiyo y’ingenzi (izina) n’agaciro byayo birakenewe."

msgid "A scalable vector graphic (SVG) file."
msgstr "Idosiye ya scalable vector graphic (SVG)."

msgid "Fediverse Creator"
msgstr "Uwaremye wa Fediverse"

msgid "Creator's fediverse account"
msgstr "Akaunti ya fediverse y’umuremyi"

msgid ""
"The fediverse @username for the content creator / author for this "
"page, including the first @ symbol."
msgstr ""
"Izina ry’urusobero (fediverse) ry’@username "
"ry’uwanditse/umwanditsi w’iyi page, harimo n’ikirango cya mbere "
"@."

msgid "Total number of metatags"
msgstr "Umubare wose wa metatag"

msgid "Total number of groups"
msgstr "Umubare wose w’amatsinda"

msgid "Name of group"
msgstr "Izina ry’itsinda"

msgid "Number of metatags"
msgstr "Umubare w’amagambo-meta"

msgid ""
"If provided this string will be added at the end of all meta tags that "
"are trimmed to length."
msgstr ""
"Iyo iyi nyandiko ihanzwe, izongerwa ku iherezo ry’inyandiko zose za "
"meta zicibwa kugera ku burebure bugenwe."

msgid ""
"Set to %none to disable inheritance of the parent value and prevent "
"the output of this metatag entirely."
msgstr ""
"Tegereza kuri %none kugira ngo uhagarike kuragwa agaciro k’umubyeyi "
"kandi wirinde ko iyi metatag itegurwa na busa na gato."

msgid "Unsupported"
msgstr "Ntibishyigikiwe"

msgid "Module Filter"
msgstr "Guhindura Urutonde (Module Filter)"

msgid "These are settings pertaining to the Extend pages of the site."
msgstr ""
"Aya ni amahitamo ajyanye n’utuzu twa “Extend” (Kwagura) bya za "
"site."

msgid "Enhance the Extend page with tabs"
msgstr "Hindura urupapuro rwa Extend ukoresheje utubuto (tabs)"

msgid ""
"Provides many enhancements to the Extend page including the use of "
"tabs for packages."
msgstr ""
"Ifasha kuzamura byinshi ku ipaji ya Extend, harimo no gukoresha "
"amatsinda (tabs) ku bipaketi."

msgid "Settings for the Module Filter module."
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’module ya **Module Filter**."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":project_page\">project page on Drupal.org</a> for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"Reba <a href=\":project_page\">urupapuro rw’ishingiro rwa poroje "
"kuri Drupal.org</a> kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye."

msgid ""
"The modules list page can become quite big when dealing with a fairly "
"large site or even just a dev site meant for testing new and various "
"modules being considered."
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rw’amapaji y’amasomo (modules) rushobora kugenda "
"rwiyongera cyane igihe ufite urubuga runini bihagije, cyangwa "
"n’igihe riri urubuga rwa dev (rwo gupima) rugenewe kugerageza vuba "
"module zitandukanye ndetse n’izindi ziri gutekerezwa."

msgid ""
"What this module aims to accomplish is the ability to quickly find the "
"module you are looking for without having to rely on the browsers "
"search feature which more times than not shows you the module name in "
"the -Required by- or -Depends on- sections of the various modules or "
"even some other location on the page like a menu item."
msgstr ""
"Iby’iyi module igamije kugeraho ni ukugufasha kubona vuba module uri "
"gushaka udakwiye kwishingira ku gikorwa cyo gushakisha kiri muri "
"browser, kuko inshuro nyinshi cyerekana gusa izina rya module mu bice "
"bya -Bishabwa na- cyangwa -Bishingiye kuri- bigaragara ku yindi module "
"zitandukanye, cyangwa no ahandi hantu ku ipaji nko ku kintu kiri muri "
"menu."

msgid ""
"Boolean indicating whether the Extend page should be enhanced with "
"tabs"
msgstr ""
"Boolean igaragaza niba Urupapuro rwa Extend rugomba kunozwa hongerwamo "
"ama-tab (tab)."

msgid "Show module path in modules list"
msgstr "Erekana inzira ya module mu rutonde rw’modules"

msgid ""
"Defines if the relative path of each module will be display in its "
"row."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura niba inzira ihamye (relative path) ya buri module "
"izagaragazwa mu murongo wayo."

msgid ""
"Machine name: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"module-machine-name "
"table-filter-text-source\">@machine-name</span>"
msgstr ""
"Izina ry’imashini: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"module-machine-name "
"table-filter-text-source\">@machine-name</span>"

msgid "Module path: @module-list"
msgstr "Icyerekezo cy’ikigize: @module-list"

msgid "Filter by project"
msgstr "Sefa hakurikijwe umushinga"

msgid "Filter by module name or description"
msgstr "Sefa ku izina ry’iyubakirwa (module) cyangwa ku bisobanuro byayo"

msgid ""
"<strong>@module_name</strong> (<span "
"class=\"admin-missing\">missing</span>)"
msgstr ""
"<strong>@module_name</strong> (<span "
"class=\"admin-missing\">ntaboneka</span>)"

msgid "Filter by module name, description or machine name"
msgstr ""
"Sefa ku izina rya module, ibisobanuro cyangwa izina rikoreshwa mu "
"buryo bwa machine"

msgid "Filter by module or permission"
msgstr "Sefa ukoresheje module cyangwa uruhushya"

msgid "Enable filter on the permissions page"
msgstr "Gushoboza muyunguruzi ku ipaji y’uburenganzira (permissions)."

msgid "Enable filters for use around the administration pages."
msgstr "Gushoboza amafishi yo gukoresha hafi y’impapuro z’ubuyobozi."

msgid "Enable the filter on the permissions page."
msgstr "Koresha Muyunguruzi (filter) ku ipaji y’uburenganzira (permissions)."

msgid "Always show description details"
msgstr "Buri gihe werekane ibisobanuro birambuye"

msgid "Always show the description details"
msgstr "Buri gihe wereke amakuru y’ibisobanuro birambuye"

msgid "By default descriptions are hidden, this will always show them."
msgstr "Mburabuzi ibisobanuro byihishwa, ibi bizabigaragaza buri gihe."

msgid ""
"Allows a user to configure pathauto settings, configure patterns for "
"automated aliases, bulk update and delete URL-aliases."
msgstr ""
"Bemerera umukoresha gushinga imiterere ya Pathauto, gushiraho ingero "
"z’uburyo bwo kubika alias zisomwa mu buryo bwikora, kuvugurura mu "
