msgstr "Amasanidi yoroshye ya XML Sitemap kuri iyi shusho yerekanwa"

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this display changes. Search engine bots may "
"take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"Uko iki kimenyetso gihinduka kenshi. Inyandiko za moteri zishakisha "
"(search engine bots) zishobora kubifata nk’ikimenyetso cy’uko "
"zikwiriye kukibika (index) kenshi."

msgid "Indexed arguments"
msgstr "Impindurabikorwa (ibipimo) byo gushakisha"

msgid ""
"To enable indexing of an argument, you must enable indexing of all "
"previous arguments."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ubone kwinjiza (indexing) ingingo (argument), ugomba gukora "
"indexing ya buri argument yabanje."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap settings for this view."
msgstr "Amahanga yoroshye ya XML Sitemap kuri iyi view."

msgid "Cron generation"
msgstr "Itanga ry’igihe (cron)"

msgid "Cron generation interval"
msgstr "Intera yo kubyara isaha ya Cron"

msgid "Generation duration"
msgstr "Igihe cyo gukora"

msgid "Default variant"
msgstr "Ihitamo ry’ibanze"

msgid "This setting will regenerate all sitemaps including the above changes."
msgstr ""
"Iyi ntangiriro izongera kubyara ama-sitemap yose harimo n’impinduka "
"zavuzwe haruguru."

msgid "Sitemap variant"
msgstr "Itandukaniro ry’urubuga rwa sitemap"

msgid "Sitemap status"
msgstr "Imiterere ya site‑mape"

msgid "Sitemaps can be regenerated on demand here."
msgstr ""
"Amaziga y’urubuga (sitemaps) ashobora kujyirwamo kongera kubyazwa ku "
"mpamvu iyo ari yo yose hano."

msgid "sitemaps"
msgstr "sitemape"

msgid "generating"
msgstr "generating → **gukora**"

msgid ""
"Uncheck this if you intend to only regenerate the sitemaps manually or "
"via drush."
msgstr ""
"Tyo ubyirengagize niba ushaka kongera kubyara ama sitemaps ku buryo "
"bw’intoki gusa cyangwa ukoresheje drush."

msgid "Default sitemap generator"
msgstr "Umwubatsi usanzwe wa sitemap"

msgid "Generates a standard conform hreflang sitemap of your content."
msgstr ""
"Byerekana ahakananganijwe na **hreflang** ya sitemap ihuye n’ibipimo "
"byemewe by’ibikorwa by’inyandiko zawe."

msgid "Generating XML sitemaps"
msgstr "Gushinga ama XML sitemaps"

msgid "Progress of sitemap regeneration"
msgstr "Iterambere ry’iyubakwa ryongezwa rya sitemap"

msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "Sitemaps"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap PHP extensions"
msgstr "Amavidewo yoroshye ya XML Sitemap PHP extensions"

msgid ""
"In order to be able to generate sitemaps, the Simple XML Sitemap "
"module requires the <em>xmlwriter</em> PHP extension to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo bishoboke kubyara ama sitemaps, agaciro ka **Simple XML "
"Sitemap** karasaba ko kwemerera inyongera ya PHP "
"**<em>xmlwriter</em>**."

msgid "Include a stylesheet in the sitemaps for humans"
msgstr "Shyiramo stylesheet mu sitemaps z’abantu"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Views)"
msgstr "Imepeta yoroshye ya XML (Views)"

msgid ""
"Provides integration of the Simple XML Sitemap module with the Views "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ihuriro (integration) rya porogaramu ya Simple XML Sitemap "
"hamwe na module ya Views."

msgid ""
"No view displays are set to be indexed yet. <a href=\"@url\">Edit a "
"view.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Nta byerekanwa (views) bigaragajwe kugirwa ngo byandikwe (indexed) "
"kandi. <a href=\"@url\">Hindura view.</a>"

msgid "The priority this display will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Icyiciro iki kwerekwa bifite mu byerekeranye n’uko imitwaro (bots) "
"y’injini zishakisha ibibonamo."

msgid "Maximum display variations"
msgstr "Itandukaniro ntarengwa ryo kugaragaza"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of link variations to be indexed for this display. "
"If left blank, each argument will create link variations for this "
"display. Use with caution, as a large number of argument values​can "
"significantly increase the number of sitemap links."
msgstr ""
"Umubare ntarengwa w’amavariyasi ya link ashobora kwinjizwa kuri iyi "
"yerekana. Niba usize ubusa, impaka zose zizateza imbere amavariyasi ya "
"link kuri iyi yerekana. Bikoreshwe witonze, kuko umubare munini "
"w’indangagaciro z’impaka ushobora kongera cyane umubare "
"w’inzandiko (sitemap) za link."

msgid "Resume generation"
msgstr "Itangiriro ryo gukora inyandiko y’umwirondoro"

msgid "Add styling and sorting to sitemaps"
msgstr ""
"Ongeraho imiterere no kubishakira uko byashyirwa ku rutonde muri "
"sitemaps"

msgid ""
"If checked, sitemaps will be displayed as tables with sortable entries "
"and thus become much friendlier towards human visitors. Search engines "
"will not care."
msgstr ""
"Ki yanditseho, sitemaps zizagaragazwa nk’imbonerahamwe zifite ibintu "
"bishobora guterwa/ gutondekwa ku buryo bubasha (sortable), bityo "
"zigahinduka byoroheye cyane ku basura abantu. Abashakisha (search "
"engines) ntibazitaho."

msgid ""
"If checked, entity links are generated exclusively for languages the "
"entity has been translated to as long as the language is not excluded "
"below.<br>Otherwise entity links are generated for every language "
"installed on the site apart from languages excluded below.<br>Bear in "
"mind that non-entity paths like homepage will always be generated for "
"every non-excluded language."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranyijwe, imiyoboro (links) y’izo entity iboneka gusa ku "
"ndimi entity imaze guhindurirwamo (translated to) mu gihe ururimi "
"rutatoranyijwe kubahandurwa hepfo (excluded below). Bitandukanye na "
"byo, imiyoboro y’izo entity iboneka ku ndimi zose zashyizweho kuri "
"uru rubuga usibye izatoranyijwe hepfo. Menya kandi ko inzira zitari "
"izo entity nk’urupapuro rw’itangiriro (homepage) buri gihe "
"ziboneka ku ndimi zose zitatoranyijwe. <br>"

msgid ""
"On some hosting providers it is impossible to pass parameters to cron "
"to tell Drupal which URL to bootstrap with. In this case the base URL "
"of sitemap links can be overridden here.<br>Example: <em>@url</em>"
msgstr ""
"Kuri bamwe mu batanga serivisi z’ubakira (hosting), ntibishoboka "
"kohereza ibipimo (parameters) kuri cron ngo ibwire Drupal URL yo "
"gutangiramo (bootstrap) ikoreshe. Muri icyo gihe, URL fatizo (base "
"URL) y’amalinki yo kuri sitemap ishobora guteshwa agaciro "
"hano.<br>Urugero: <em>@url</em>"

msgid ""
"The maximum duration <strong>in seconds</strong> the generation task "
"can run during a single cron run or during one batch process "
"iteration.<br>The higher the number, the quicker the generation "
"process, but higher the risk of PHP timeout errors."
msgstr ""
"Igihe ntarengwa cyo hejuru <strong>mu masegonda</strong> akazi ko "
"kubyaza bishobora kumara mugihe cyo gukora cron imwe, cyangwa mugihe "
"imwe yo gutunganya (batch process iteration).<br>Iyo umubare uba uri "
"hejuru, niko inzira yo kubyaza iba yihuta, ariko haba n’ingaruka zo "
"kwibasirwa n’amakosa yo kugera kuri PHP timeout."

msgid ""
"Administer Simple XML Sitemap settings, alter inclusion settings of "
"content and generate sitemaps on demand."
msgstr ""
"Ushinzwe gucunga igenamiterere rya Simple XML Sitemap, uhindure uburyo "
"bwo gushyiramo ibikubiyemo, kandi wubake/ubyare sitemaps igihe "
"bikenewe."

msgid "Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "Subiramo gukora ama sitemap yose umaze gukanda <em>Save</em>"

msgid "Otherwise the sitemaps will be regenerated during a future cron run."
msgstr ""
"Bitabaye ibyo, sitemaps zizongera kubakwa mugihe cyo gukora cron "
"izabikora mu gihe kizaza."

msgid ""
"The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of "
"search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Icyiciro cyihariye (priority) iyi <em>@bundle</em> izagira mu maso "
"y’uduce tw’imitwe y’imashini zishakisha (search engine bots)."

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search "
"engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"Uko kenshi iyi nteruro ya <em>@bundle</em> ihinduka. Imashini "
"z’ibyiciro byo gushakisha (search engine bots) zishobora gufata ibi "
"nk’ikimenyetso cy’uko zikwiriye kuyi-indexa kenshi."

msgid ""
"Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should "
"be included in the sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Igena niba amashusho yerekezwa n’iyi ngingo ya <em>@bundle</em> "
"agomba gushyirwamo muri sitemap."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Search engines)"
msgstr "Simple XML Ikurikiranyanyandiko (Imashini zishakisha)"

msgid "Search engine ID"
msgstr "Indangamuntu ya moteri yo gushakisha"

msgid "Last submitted"
msgstr "Yoherejwe bwa nyuma"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission settings"
msgstr "Amahame yo gutanga kuri moteri ishakisha rya sitetimap (sitemap)"

msgid "Sitemap submission enabled"
msgstr "Kohereza sitemap byemewe"

msgid "Sitemap submission frequency"
msgstr "Igikorwa cyo kohereza sitemapi kenshi hakurikijwe igihe"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission"
msgstr ""
"Gushyikiriza moteri y’imbuga (sitemap) mu gutangiza no kuyishyira mu "
"rwego rwo gushakisha"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of links one sitemap can hold. If more links are "
"generated than set here, a sitemap index will be created and the links "
"split into several sub-sitemaps.<br>50 000 links is the maximum Google "
"will parse per sitemap, but choosing a lower value may be needed to "
"avoid PHP memory errors on huge sites.<br>If left blank, all links "
"will be shown on a single sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Umubare ntarengwa w’amalinki urubuga-rutonde (sitemap) rushobora "
"kwakira. Niba hakorwa andi malinki kurenza ayo washyize hano, "
"hazakorwa sitemap index maze amalinki akabonekwa mu ma-sitemaps menshi "
"yitiriwe kugabanya.<br>Amalinki 50 000 ni yo Google ntarengwa ishobora "
"gusesengura kuri sitemap imwe, ariko guhitamo agaciro kari hasi "
"birashobora kuba ngombwa kugira ngo wirinde amakosa yo kwibuka (PHP "
"memory errors) ku mbuga nini cyane.<br>Niba ubisize ubusa, amalinki "
"yose azagaragara kuri sitemap imwe."

msgid "Configure, add content to and generate XML sitemaps."
msgstr "Ihindure iboneza, ongeramo ibirimo, kandi utange XML sitemaps."

msgid "Disable language hreflang"
msgstr "Kureka hreflang y’ururimi"

msgid "Remove hreflang markup in HTML"
msgstr "Kuraho `hreflang` mu ikorwa rya HTML"

msgid ""
"Google recommends displaying hreflang definitions either in the HTML "
"markup or in the sitemap, but not in both places.<br>If checked, "
"hreflang definitions created by the language module will be removed "
"from the markup reducing its size."
msgstr ""
"Google irasaba kwerekana ibisobanuro bya hreflang haba mu ifishi ya "
"HTML cyangwa muri sitemap, ariko atari mu byombi icyarimwe.<br>Niba "
"byagenzuwe, ibisobanuro bya hreflang byakozwe na modile y’ururimi "
"bizavanwa mu markup bigabanya ingano yayo."

msgid "published on @time"
msgstr "byashyizwe ahagaragara kuri @time"

msgid "published on @time, regenerating"
msgstr "yashyizwe ahagaragara kuri @time, irimo kubyirindura kabusha"

msgid ""
"The number of entities to process in each queue item.<br>Increasing "
"this number will use more memory but will result in less queries "
"improving generation speed."
msgstr ""
"Umubare w’ibintu (entities) bigomba gutunganywa muri buri kintu "
"cy’umurongo (queue item).<br>Kwiyongera kuri uwo mubare bizakoresha "
"ububiko (memory) bwinshi ariko bizagabanya imibare y’inshuro "
"z’ibibazo (queries) bigafasha kongera umuvuduko wo gukora ibintu "
"(generation)."

msgid "@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed."
msgstr ""
"Ibice biri muri @index byanditse/ byashyizwe mu bubiko buciriritse "
"(queue) kuri @total byatanzwe byarangije gutunganywa."

msgid ""
"All variants belonging to the built-in \"Default hreflang\" sitemap "
"type have been converted to entities. Custom sitemap types added via "
"plugins will have to be recreated manually. See "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. The sitemaps need to be "
"regenerated now."
msgstr ""
"Amoko yose ajyanye n’Ubwoko bwo hasi “Default hreflang” bwa "
"sitemap bubatswe (built-in) byahinduwe biba ibigo (entities). Uburyo "
"bwa sitemap bwiyongereyeho ku buryo bwihariye binyuze muri plugins "
"bizakenera kongera kubyoherezwa/ku byongewe ku buryo bw’intoki. Reba "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. Sitemaps zigomba kongera "
"kubyoherezwa (regenerated) ubu."

msgid "Sitemap types"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa sitemapi"

msgid "Sitemap generator"
msgstr "Umwanditsi w’imyandiko y’ahantu (Sitemap)"

msgid "URL generators"
msgstr "**Urubuga rurema URL (URL generators)**"

msgid "Simple XML sitemap type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bworoshye bwa XML sitemap"

msgid "Add sitemap type"
msgstr "Ongeraho ubwoko bwa sitemap"

msgid ""
"Choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to which search "
"engines.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo amasitemap azoherezwa kuri moteri zishakisha ziteye iyihe. "
"Amasitemap ashobora gutegurwa <a href=\"@url\">ahari</a>."

msgid "No sitemaps have been defined yet. <a href=\"@url\">Add a new one</a>."
msgstr "Nta sitemap zigeze zisobanuwe. <a href=\"@url\">Ongeraho indi</a>."

msgid "Sitemap type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa sitemap"

msgid ""
"No sitemap types have been defined yet. <a href=\"@url\">Add a new "
"one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nta bwoko bwa sitemap bigeze busobanurwa. <a href=\"@url\">Ongeraho "
"iyindi</a>."

msgid "sitemap"
msgstr "urubuga rw’urubuga (sitemap)"

msgid "sitemap type"
msgstr "ubwoko bwa sitemap"

msgid "sitemap types"
msgstr "ubwoko bwa site-ya-inyandiko (sitemap)"

msgid ""
"At least one sitemap needs to be defined for a bundle to be "
"indexable.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nibura sitemap imwe igomba gusobanurwa kugira ngo bundle ibashe "
"kwandikwa (indexable).<br>Sitemaps zishobora gushyirwaho <a "
"href=\"@url\">kuri iyi link</a>."

msgid "Sitemap type %label has been updated."
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa sitemap %label bwaravuguruwe."

msgid "Sitemap type %label has been created."
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa sitemap %label bwakozwe."

msgid ""
"@indexed out of @total queue items have been processed.<br>Each "
"sitemap is published after all of its items have been processed."
msgstr ""
"@indexed out of @total ibintu byo muri iyi queue bimaze "
"gukorwaho.<br>Uko buri sitemap itangizwa biba nyuma y’uko ibintu "
"byayigize byose bimaze gukorwaho."

msgid "Sitemap index generator"
msgstr "Umurebeshya wa sitemap y’icyiciro (index)"

msgid ""
"In order to use the Simple XML Sitemap Views module, the Views URL "
"generator must be <a href=\"@url\">added</a> to a sitemap type."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ukoreshe module ya Simple XML Sitemap Views, Views URL "
"generator igomba <a href=\"@url\">kongererwa</a> ku bwoko bwa sitemap."

msgid ""
"Please configure at least one <a href=\"@sitemaps_url\">sitemap</a> to "
"be of a <a href=\"@types_url\">type</a> that implements the views URL "
"generator."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka shyiraho nibura imwe <a href=\"@sitemaps_url\">site-mapu</a> "
"igomba kuba ifite <a href=\"@types_url\">ubwoko</a> bwubahiriza "
"umukoro wo gutanga URL ukoresheje views URL generator."

msgid "Included in sitemaps: "
msgstr "Byinjijwe muri sitemaps:"

msgid "Excluded from all sitemaps"
msgstr "Bivanze mu mihakana yose y’urubuga (sitemaps)"

msgid "No sitemaps have been selected for submission."
msgstr "Nta sitemapu zatoranyijwe ngo zoherezwe."

msgid "Index this display in sitemap <em>@variant_label</em>"
msgstr "Shyiramo iyi nyandiko muri sitemap <em>@variant_label</em>"

msgid "Default sitemap"
msgstr "Sitemap isanzwe"

msgid ""
"This sitemap will be available under <em>/sitemap.xml</em> in addition "
"to its default path <em>/variant-name/sitemap.xml</em>.<br>Sitemaps "
"can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Iyi sitemap izaboneka munsi ya <em>/sitemap.xml</em> hiyongeraho "
"inzira yayo isanzwe <em>/variant-name/sitemap.xml</em>.<br>Sitemaps "
"zishobora kugirirwa imiterere <a href=\"@url\">hano</a>."

msgid ""
"Prevent per-sitemap duplicate links.<br>Unchecking this may help "
"avoiding PHP memory errors on huge sites."
msgstr ""
"Irinde guhuza amasano abiri ku’urubuga rumwe "
"(sitemap).<br>Kudahitamo ibi bishobora gufasha kwirinda amakosa yo "
