"Submits sitemaps to search engines and notifies IndexNow compatible "
"engines about changes to entities."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ama-sitemap ku mashini zishakisha kandi imenyesha imashini "
"zihuje na IndexNow ku mpinduka zikorwa ku bintu (entities)."

