msgstr "Menyesha imashini zishakisha za IndexNow impinduka <em>bisanzwe</em>"

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>now</em>"
msgstr "Menyesha moteri zishakisha za IndexNow ku mpinduka <em>nonaha</em>"

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms of this type.<br/>Changes include creating, "
"deleting and updating of an entity. This setting can be overridden on "
"the entity form."
msgstr ""
"Ohereza imenyesha ry’impinduka ku mashini zishakisha zihuje na "
"IndexNow, ako kanya nyuma yo kohereza imiterere (forms) y’ubu bwoko "
"bw’iyi kiciro k’isosiyete (entity).<br/>Impinduka zirimo kurema, "
"gusiba no kuvugurura iyo entity. Iyi miterere ishobora guhindurwa ku "
"form y’iyi entity."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting this form."
msgstr ""
"Ohereza imenyesha ry’uko habayeho impinduka ku mashini zishakisha "
"zihuza na IndexNow uko kanya nyuma yo gutanga iyi fomu."

