msgstr "Amahuz’amahinduriro ya IndexNow"

msgid "Submit changes to IndexNow capable engines"
msgstr "Ohereza impinduka kuri moteri zishobora gukoresha IndexNow"

msgid "Preferred IndexNow engine"
msgstr "Imashini y’impuzandengo ya IndexNow ihitamo"

msgid ""
"All IndexNow requests will be sent to the engine selected here. Only "
"one engine needs to be notified, as it will notify other IndexNow "
"compatible engines for you.<br/>For the sake of equality of "
"opportunity, <strong>consider leaving this at "
"<em>Random</em></strong>, so a random engine can be picked on each "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Ibisabwa byose bya IndexNow bizoherezwa kuri moteri yo hano yahisemo. "
"Ni moteri imwe gusa ikwiye kubimenyeshwa, kuko iyo izabimenyesha "
"izindi moteri zifite iboneza bya IndexNow bihuje na zo kuri "
"wowe.<br/>Kugira ngo habeho uburinganire mu amahirwe, <strong tekereza "
"kubisigira kuri <em>Random</em></strong>, kugira ngo moteri ihitwe ku "
"buryo bwa mpuzamahitamo kuri buri bwo kohereza."

msgid "Index on every entity save operation"
msgstr "Kwerekeza kuri buri gikorwa cyo kubika ikintu (entity)"

msgid ""
"If checked, all entity save operations for <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">included entities</a> will trigger "
"notification of IndexNow search engines.<br/>If unchecked, this will "
"only be possible by adding/altering/deleting an entity through a "
"form.<br/>This should be unchecked if there are mass operations "
"performed on entities that are irrelevant to indexing."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranyijwe, kubika (save) byose by’ikintu (entity) bifatanye "
"nko kuri <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">ibikubiyemo (included "
"entities)</a> bizatera kohereza imenyesha ku mbuga zishakisha "
"(IndexNow).<br/>Niba bitatoranyijwe, ibi bizaboneka gusa mu kongera "
"guhindura/gusiba (adding/altering/deleting) ikintu (entity) ukoresheje "
"paji (form).<br/>Ibi bigomba kuba bidatoranyijwe iyo hari ibikorwa "
"byinshi (mass operations) bikorwa kuri entity zidakwiye kubikwa mu "
"kwandikisha (indexing)."

msgid ""
"The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>Drupal state</em>. "
"Consider defining it in <em>settings.php</em> like so:<br/>@code"
msgstr ""
"Urufunguzo rwo kugenzura rwa IndexNow rwabikwa muri <em>Drupal "
"state</em>. Tekereza kurusobanura muri <em>settings.php</em> ku buryo "
"bukurikira:<br/>@code"

