"The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>settings.php</em> and "
"can be safely removed from <em>Drupal state</em>."
msgstr ""
"Urufunguzo rwo kwemeza IndexNow rubikwa muri <em>settings.php</em> "
"kandi rushobora gukurwaho mu buryo bwizewe muri <em>Drupal state</em>."

