msgstr "Mucyo wo kurema urutonde rw’amasayithi (Sitemap URL)"

msgid "Generates sitemap URLs for a sitemap index."
msgstr "Irema URL za sitemapi z’urutonde rw’amapaji (sitemap index)."

msgid "Hide branding"
msgstr "Hisha ikirango cya sosiyete"

msgid ""
"Remove the 'Generated by the Simple XML Sitemap Drupal module' string "
"from the XSL output."
msgstr ""
"Kuraho aho inyandiko yanditse ngo “Generated by the Simple XML "
"Sitemap Drupal module” iba iri muri XSL output."

msgid "Generated by the <a href=\"@url\">@module_name</a> Drupal module."
msgstr "Byakozwe na module ya Drupal <a href=\"@url\">@module_name</a>."

msgid "Add custom internal drupal paths to specific sitemaps."
msgstr ""
"Ongeraho inzira z’imbere za Drupal zakozwe ku buryo bwihariye mu ma "
"sitemaps runaka."

msgid ""
"Specify drupal internal (relative) paths, one per line. Do not forget "
"to prepend the paths with a '/'.<br>Optionally link priority <em>(0.0 "
"- 1.0)</em> can be added by appending it after a space.<br> Optionally "
"link change frequency <em>(always / hourly / daily / weekly / monthly "
"/ yearly / never)</em> can be added by appending it after a space."
msgstr ""
"Andika inzira zo mu buryo bwa Drupal bw’imbere (zirebana n’aho "
"uri), buri imwe ikurikirana ku murongo umwe. Ntukibagirwe kongeramo "
"‘/’ mbere ya inzira.<br>Mu buryo bw’ubushake, urashobora "
"kongeramo uburenganzira bwo guhuza (priority) <em>(0.0 - 1.0)</em> "
"ubishyizeho inyuma y’umwanya.<br>Mu buryo bw’ubushake, ushobora "
"kongeramo inshuro yo guhinduka (change frequency) <em>(always / hourly "
"/ daily / weekly / monthly / yearly / never)</em> ubishyizeho inyuma "
"y’umwanya."

msgid ""
"<strong>Examples:</strong><br><em>/ 1.0 daily</em> -> home page with "
"the highest priority and daily change frequency<br><em>/contact</em> "
"-> contact page with the default priority and no change frequency "
"information"
msgstr ""
"<strong:Ibyitonde:</strong><br><em>/ 1.0 buri munsi</em> -> urupapuro "
"rw’itangiriro rufite uburemere bwo hejuru n’uko impinduka zibaho "
"buri munsi<br><em>/contact</em> -> urupapuro rwa contact rufite "
"uburemere busanzwe (default) kandi nta makuru y’igihe impinduka "
"zibaho"

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The path <em>@path</em> does "
"not exist."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, umurongo @line</strong>: Inzira <em>@path</em> "
"ntibaho."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The path <em>@path</em> needs "
"to start with a '/'."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, umurongo @line</strong>: Inzira <em>@path</em> "
"igomba gutangirira kuri “/”."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The priority setting "
"<em>@priority</em> for path <em>@path</em> is incorrect. Set the "
"priority from 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: Iteganyirizo ry'uko buri gaciro "
"kagenewe <em>@priority</em> ku nzira <em>@path</em> ntabwo ari ko "
"ryagenwe. Shyiraho agaciro k'ibanze kuva 0.0 kugera kuri 1.0."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The changefreq setting "
"<em>@changefreq</em> for path <em>@path</em> is incorrect. The "
"following are the correct values: <em>@changefreq_options</em>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, umurongo @line</strong>: Igenamiterere rya "
"changefreq <em>@changefreq</em> kuri inzira <em>@path</em> ntabwo riri "
"mu buryo bukwiye. Iby’ingenzi bikurikira ni byo bikwiriye: "
"<em>@changefreq_options</em>."

msgid "There are no languages other than the default language available."
msgstr "Nta zindi ndimi zindi usibye indimi zisanzwe (zisanzwe) zihari."

