"Submission settings can be configured <a "
"href=\"@url\">here</a>.<br/>The ping protocol is <strong>being "
"deprecated</strong>, use IndexNow if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Amahanga yo kohereza y’inyandiko ashobora gushyirwaho <a "
"href=\"@url\">aha</a>.<br/>Uburyo bwo kohereza amakuru (ping) "
"<strong>burimo kuva mu ikoreshwa</strong>; niba bishoboka, koresha "
"IndexNow."

msgid "Page submission status (IndexNow protocol)"
msgstr "Imiterere yo kohereza urupapuro (protokole ya IndexNow)"

msgid ""
"This enables/disables sitemap submission; don't forget to choose "
"sitemaps below.<br/>The ping protocol is <strong>being "
"deprecated</strong>, use IndexNow if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bibuza/ bifasha kohereza sitemap; ntukibagirwe guhitamo sitemaps "
"hepfo. <br/>Uburyo bwa ping **burimo gucibwa/kwirukanwa** (bwose "
"**burimo kugirwa intera**), nimba hari aho bukenewe, koresha IndexNow."

msgid ""
"Generates URLs from data sets collected in the "
"hook_simple_sitemap_arbitrary_links_alter hook."
msgstr ""
"Itingurura ama URL bishingiye ku makuru yakusanyijwe mu "
"hook_simple_sitemap_arbitrary_links_alter."

