msgstr "Nabayeho"

msgid "Seznam"
msgstr "Urutonde"

msgid ""
"Generates standard-compliant hreflang XML sitemaps to enhance your "
"site's SEO, notifies search engines of website changes via IndexNow "
"and sitemap ping protocols, and provides a framework for developing "
"other sitemap types."
msgstr ""
"Ibihindura sitemap zo mu buryo bujuje ubuziranenge bwa hreflang XML "
"kugira ngo wongere SEO y’urubuga rwawe, bigaha amakuru motomoni "
"(search engines) impinduka z’urubuga hifashishijwe IndexNow na "
"protokole zo “sitemap ping”, kandi bitanga urubuga rwo guteza "
"imbere ubundi bwoko bwa sitemap."

