msgstr ""
"Hindura ibipimo bya Simple XML Sitemap ku mpapuro z’indi ntangiriro "
"(entity)."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms. Changes include creating, deleting and "
"updating of an entity.<br/>This behavior can be overridden on entity "
"forms. Don't forget to <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">include "
"entities</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ohereza imenyesha ry’impinduka ku mashini zishakisha zihuza na "
"IndexNow bundi buryo bwihuse nyuma yo kohereza amafishi y’ikigo "
"(entity). Izi mpinduka zirimo kurema, gusiba no kuvugurura (update) "
"igikoresho/ikirango (entity).<br/>Ubu buryo bushobora guteshwa ku "
"mafishi y’ikigo. Ntukibagirwe <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">kongeramo "
"entities</a>."

