msgstr "Isuzuma ry’umushinga kuri @name byanze."

msgid "Analysis complete for @project."
msgstr "Isesengura rirangiye kuri @project."

msgid "Processing @name."
msgstr "Turimo gutunganya @name."

msgid "Drupal core and hosting environment"
msgstr "Urwego rwa Drupal core n’aho yakira (hosting environment)"

msgid "Version cannot be detected, check manually."
msgstr ""
"Itangiriro (version) ntirushobora kumenyekana, nyabuneka rigenzure "
"n’intoki."

msgid ""
"No deprecation scanning data available. <a href=\"@url\">Go to the "
"Upgrade Status form</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nta dushakashatsi tw’uko gutinda gukoresha (deprecation) tuboneka. "
"<a href=\"@url\">Jya ku rubuga rw’Imimerere y’Isazaminwa "
"ry’Iterambere (Upgrade Status)</a>."

msgid "Fix now with automation"
msgstr "Hindura ako kanya ukoresheje automasiyo"

msgid "Fix now manually"
msgstr "Emeza ibi nonaha intoki"

msgid ""
"It does not seem like these are covered by automation yet. <a "
"href=\"@drupal-rector\">Contribute to drupal-rector to provide "
"coverage</a>. Fix manually in the meantime."
msgstr ""
"Bisa n’uko ibi bitaravugwa ngo bihite byitabwaho n’uburyo "
"bw’ikoresha ryikora (automation) kugeza ubu. <a "
"href=\"@drupal-rector\">Saba uruhare muri drupal-rector kugira ngo "
"haboneke uko byagerwaho</a>. Hagati aho, bikosore wewe ubwawe."

msgid ""
"Errors without Drupal source version numbers including parse errors "
"and use of APIs from dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Amakosa adafite nimero y’uburyo bwa Drupal ikomokamo, harimo "
"n’amakosa yo gusesengura (parse errors) n’ikoreshwa rya API ziva "
"mu byishingiwe (dependencies)."

msgid ""
"Based on the Drupal deprecation version number of these, fixing them "
"may make the contributed project incompatible with supported Drupal "
"core versions."
msgstr ""
"Bishingiye ku mubare w’ubw’indemerezi (deprecation) bwa Drupal "
"kuri ibyo, kubikosora bishobora gutuma umushinga watanzwe "
"(contributed) udahuye n’imihindagurikire (supported) ya Drupal core "
"ishyigikiwe."

msgid ""
"Based on the Drupal deprecation version number of these, fixing them "
"will likely make them incompatible with your current Drupal version."
msgstr ""
"Bishingiye ku mubare w’iyakirwa rya Drupal (deprecation) ku birimo, "
"kubikosha bishobora gutuma bihuzuranywa nubwo atari byo n’iyo urimo "
"muri Drupal yawe ya ubu."

msgid ""
"Deprecated API use for APIs removed in future Drupal major versions is "
"not required to fix yet."
msgstr ""
"Gukoresha API zifite aho zatakaye (Deprecated) zivanwa mu "
"nsimburangingo z’ingenzi za Drupal zizakurikiraho ntabwo bisabwa "
"guhindura ubu."

msgid "Fix with rector"
msgstr "Fata ukoresheje rector"

msgid ""
"Avoid some manual work by using drupal-rector for fixing issues "
"automatically or Upgrade Rector to generate patches."
msgstr ""
"Irinde imirimo y’iy’intoki ihambaye ukoresheje **drupal-rector** "
"ngo ibashe gukosora ibibazo byikikizigira, cyangwa ukoreshe **Upgrade "
"Rector** kugira ngo itange imishinga (patches)."

msgid ""
"The project machine name @invalid_name is invalid. Is this a project "
"on this site? (For community projects, use the machine name of the "
"drupal.org project itself)."
msgstr ""
"Izina rya mashini y’iyi project **@invalid_name** ntabwo ryemewe. "
"Iyi project iri kuri iyi site? (Ku bijyanye na za project "
"z’ishyirahamwe, koresha izina rya mashini ry’uri project kuri "
"**drupal.org** ubwayo)."

msgid ""
"The project machine names @invalid_names are invalid. Are these "
"projects on this site? (For community projects, use the machine name "
"of the drupal.org project itself)."
msgstr ""
"Izina rihamagarwa n’umusaruro wa project @invalid_names ntabwo ari "
"ryo. Ese aba project bari kuri uru rubuga? (Ku ma project yo mu "
"muryango, koresha izina rya machine (machine name) rya project kuri "
"drupal.org ubwaryo)."

msgid "Using previous results for @name."
msgstr "Ukoresheje ibisubizo byabanje kuri @name."

msgid "Version @current allows to upgrade but @new is available."
msgstr "Version @current iragufasha kuzamura (upgrade), ariko @new iraboneka."

msgid ""
"External dependencies for Upgrade Status are not available. Composer "
"must be used to download the module with dependencies. See <a "
"href=\"@url\">the Upgrade Status project page</a> for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Ibikenerwa hanze (external dependencies) kuri Upgrade Status ntabwo "
"biboneka. Ugomba gukoresha Composer kugirango ukuremo module ifite "
"ibikenerwa bayo. Reba <a href=\"@url\">urupapuro rw’umushinga wa "
"Upgrade Status</a> kugira ngo ubone amabwiriza."

msgid "Export as text"
msgstr "Ohereza nka gihamya yanditseho (nko mu nyandiko)"

msgid "Export selected as HTML"
msgstr "Kohereza ibihombo byatoranijwe nka HTML"

msgid "Export selected as text"
msgstr "Ohereza ibyatoranyijwe nk’inyandiko (text)"

msgid ""
"The likely best action is to remove projects that are uninstalled. Why "
"invest in updating them to be compatible if you are not using them?"
msgstr ""
"Igikorwa cyiza waba ufite amahitamo ni ukureka gukomeza imishinga "
"ihagaritswe (isanzwe ihagaritswe) ikanatirwa. Kuki wogura kuyitezayo "
"ngo ibe ihuje n’ibyiciro biriho, mugihe utayikoresha?"

msgid ""
"Status of this project cannot be determined without scanning the "
"source code here. Use this form to run a scan on these."
msgstr ""
"Imiterere y’iyi mushinga ntishobora kumenyekana hatabanje gusuzuma "
"imisumari y’imvano hano. Koresha iyi fomu ngo ukore isuzuma (scan) "
"kuri iyi."

msgid "Collaborate with maintainers"
msgstr "Shirikiana n’ababungabunga (maintainers)"

msgid ""
"Some or all problems found can be fixed automatically with <a "
"href=\":drupal-rector\">drupal-rector</a>. Make the machine do the "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Bimwe cyangwa ibibazo byose byabonetse bishobora gukosorwa mu buryo "
"bwikora hifashishijwe <a href=\":drupal-rector\">drupal-rector</a>. "
"Reka imashini ikore umurimo."

msgid "Fix manually"
msgstr "Hindura n’intoki"

msgid ""
"It looks like there is no automated fixes for either problems found. "
"Check the report for pointers on how to fix."
msgstr ""
"Bisa n’uko nta gukosorwa byikora bihari ku bibazo byombi "
"byagaragaye. Reba raporo kugira ngo ubone ibimenyetso by’uko "
"wakosora."

msgid "Well done. Congrats! Let's get everything else here!"
msgstr ""
"Byakoze cyane. Ndakushimira! Noneho reka dukomeze n’ibindi byose "
"biri hano!"

msgid "Local scan result"
msgstr "Ibisubizo byo gusikana hafi yaho"

msgid "Drupal.org version"
msgstr "**Itangazo (version) ya Drupal.org**"

msgid "Drupal.org issues"
msgstr "Ibibazo kuri Drupal.org"

msgid "Never checked"
msgstr "Ntagihagurukira ngo byajyweho kureba"

msgid "Last checked @time ago"
msgstr "Byagenzuwe hashize @time"

msgid "Gather data"
msgstr "Kusanya amakuru"

msgid "Fix incompatibilities"
msgstr "Gukosora kutumvikana bitandukanye"

msgid "Relax"
msgstr "Bihumurize / Wihumurize"

msgid ""
"Install <a href=\":composer_deploy\">Composer Deploy</a> or <a "
"href=\":git_deploy\">Git Deploy</a> as appropriate for accurate update "
"recommendations"
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo <a href=\":composer_deploy\">Composer Deploy</a> cyangwa <a "
"href=\":git_deploy\">Git Deploy</a> nk’uko bikwiye, kugira ngo inama "
"z’uko kuvugurura bikwiranye zibe ari zo nyakuri"

msgid "Environment is incompatible"
msgstr "Idirishya/ibidukikije birahuye ntabwo bihuye (ntabwo birahuye)."

msgid "Environment checks passed"
msgstr "Igenzura ry’ibidukikije ryaratsinzwe"

msgid ""
"Starting Upgrade Status on @count projects without HTTP sandboxing "
"because the built-in PHP webserver does not allow for that."
msgstr ""
"Gutangira uko imishinga @count imeze (Upgrade Status) utabisabye HTTP "
"sandboxing kuko itangiriro ry’imbere rya PHP webserver ritabemerera "
"kubikora."

msgid ""
"Starting Upgrade Status on @count projects without HTTP sandboxing. "
"@error"
msgstr ""
"Gutangira uko birebwa uko ibikorwa byamaze kuzamurwa kuri @count "
"poroje bidafite HTTP sandboxing. @error"

