"ngo abyimurire mu bikorwa byemewe, kandi utange ibitekerezo niba "
"byaragezeho (byabayeho)."

msgid "Compatible with next major Drupal core version"
msgstr "Bihuje na verisiyo ikurikira (major) ya Drupal core"

