"Run the report to find out if there are detectable compatibility "
"errors with the modules and themes installed on your site."
msgstr ""
"Koresha raporo urebe niba hari amakosa yo guhuza (compatibility) "
"ashobora kugaragara hamwe n’amamodule n’insanganyamatsiko (themes) "
"byashyizwe kuri iyi webhusayithi yawe."

