msgstr ""
"Amakurikirita y’inyongera y’ingenzi (core extensions) ashaje "
"cyangwa atagikoreshwa yongeweho. Azavanwaho mu verisiyo nkuru "
"izakurikiraho."

msgid ""
"When using PostgreSQL, minimum version is 12 <a href=\":trgm\">with "
"the pg_trgm extension</a> created."
msgstr ""
"Iyo ukoresheje PostgreSQL, byibuze usabwa verisiyo ya 12 <a "
"href=\":trgm\">ifiteho imbuga/inyongera (extension) ya pg_trgm</a> "
"ikaba yarakozwe."

