"The next submission number was increased to @min to make it higher "
"than existing submissions."
msgstr ""
"Umubare w’ubwohererezwa ukurikiraho wiyongereye ukagera kuri @min "
"kugira ngo ube hejuru y’ubwoherereje busanzwe."

