msgstr "Ubwoko bw’igurishwa (entity type) aho iyi nyandiko yoherejwe iva."

msgid ""
"Key-value pairs MUST be specified as \"safe_key: 'Some readable "
"option'\". Use of only alphanumeric characters and underscores is "
"recommended in keys. One option per line. Option groups can be created "
"by using just the group name followed by indented group options."
msgstr ""
"Indangagaciro by-urufunguzo (key-value pairs) BIKOMEYE KUGARAGAZWA nka "
"“safe_key: 'Ihitamo risomeka neza'”. Birasabwa gukoresha gusa "
"inyuguti z’inyuguti (alphanumeric) n’imyirongo yo hasi "
"(underscores) mu nfunganuro (keys). Buri hitamo rigomba kuba riri ku "
"murongo umwe. Amatsinda y’amahitamo ashobora gushingwa hakoreshejwe "
"gusa izina ry’iryo tsinda, hanyuma amahitamo yaryo akandikwa mu "
"buryo bwo kwinjiza (indented)."

msgid ""
"Export creation complete. Your download should begin now. If it does "
"not start, <a href=\":href\">download the file here</a>. This file may "
"only be downloaded once."
msgstr ""
"Kurema koherezwa byarangiye. Gukuramo kwawe bigomba gutangira nonaha. "
"Niba bitangira, <a href=\":href\">kura iyo dosiye hano</a>. Iyi dosiye "
"ishobora gukurwaho rimwe gusa."

