msgstr ""
"Ibi bikoreshwa kuri buto yo “inyuma” yo ku ipaji ibanziriza iyindi "
"mu gihe cyo kuyobora ukoresheje wizard."

msgid "This is used for the next page button within a wizard."
msgstr "Ibi bikoreshwa ku buto ikurikira bwo kujya ku ipaji itaha muri wizard."

msgid "Checkboxes other"
msgstr "Utubuto two guhitamo (checkbox) tubindi"

msgid "Likert answers format"
msgstr "Imyandikire y’ibisubizo bya Likert"

msgid "Answer keys, the raw value stored in the database (key)"
msgstr ""
"Imfunguzo z’ibisubizo, agaciro k’imbere (raw) zibitswe muri "
"databaza (key)"

