msgstr ""
"Agasanduku k’aho kazagaragara muri uwo mwanya kugeza igihe "
"umukoresha atangiye kwinjiza indangagaciro."

msgid "Contents should be visible (open) to the user."
msgstr "Ibirimo bigomba kugaragara (bikakingutse) ku mukozi/umukoresha."

msgid "Private elements are shown only to users with results access."
msgstr ""
"Ibice byihariye bigaragazwa gusa ku bakoresha bafite uburenganzira bwo "
"kureba ibisubizo."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the initial option denoting no selection in a "
"select element."
msgstr ""
"Izina ngombwa ryerekana kuri ihitamo rya mbere ryerekana ko nta bwo "
"hituwe mu rwego rwo guhitamo (select)."

msgid ""
"The value for the initial option denoting no selection in a select "
"element, which is used to determine whether the user submitted a value "
"or not."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro k’iyo ihitamo rya mbere risobanura ko nta kintu "
"cyatoranyijwe muri element yo guhitamo (select), gakoreshwa mu kumenya "
"niba umukoresha yatanze agaciro cyangwa atatanze."

msgid "Other placeholder"
msgstr "Indi mwanya wo kuriha (placeholder)"

msgid "These properties and callbacks are not allowed: @properties"
msgstr ""
"Ibi biranga (properties) na callbacks bikurikira ntibemererwa: "
"@properties"

msgid ""
"Option groups can be created by using just the group name followed by "
"indented group options."
msgstr ""
"Amatsinda y’ihitamo ashobora kuremwa hifashishijwe izina "
"ry’itsinda gusa, rikurikirwa n’ibitandukanijwe (byinjijwe mu "
