msgid "Default total submissions limit message"
msgstr "Ubutumwa busanzwe bwo kugena umubare ntarengwa w’iyoherezwa ryuzuye"

msgid "Default per user submission limit message"
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa busanzwe bwo kugabanya umubare ntarengwa w’ubwohererezwa "
"kuri buri mukoresha"

msgid ""
"An <a href=\":href\">inputmask</a> helps the user with the element by "
"ensuring a predefined format."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href\">Inputmask</a> ifasha umukoresha kuri uru rwego, "
"ihamya ko rugaragaza uburyo bwateganyijwe mbere."

msgid "Email multiple"
msgstr "Ohereza ibintu byinshi"

msgid ""
"A <a href=\":href\">regular expression</a> that the element's value is "
"checked against."
msgstr ""
"<i><a href=\":href\">imyandikiro isanzwe (regular expression)</a></i> "
"isuzugurwa ku buryo agaciro k’iyo element gahuza nayo."

msgid "The maximum number of matches to be displayed."
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w’imyitunyobe izagaragazwa."

msgid ""
"The minimum number of characters a user must type before a search is "
"performed."
msgstr ""
"Umubare ntarengwa w’inyuguti umukoresha agomba kwandika mbere "
"y’uko hashakwa."

msgid "Limit entered value to a maximum number of characters or words."
msgstr ""
"Koresha agaciro winjije mu murongo ntarengwa w’imibare y’inyuguti "
"cyangwa amagambo."

msgid ""
"If checked, all <a href=\":details_href\">Details</a> element's "
"open/close state will be saved using <a "
"href=\":local_storage_href\">Local Storage</a>."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, imiterere yo gufungura/kugufunga ya buri kintu cya "
"<a href=\":details_href\">Details</a> izabikwa hifashishijwe <a "
"href=\":local_storage_href\">Ububiko bwa Local</a>."

msgid ""
"Please check the formats that are available for this element. Leave "
"blank to allow all available formats."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka genzura imiterere iboneka kuri iyi elementi. Tira ubusa ngo "
"wemere imiterere yose iboneka."

msgid "If checked, the 'About text formats' link will be hidden."
msgstr ""
"Ki barnindi, ihuza rya « Uburyo bwo kugaragaza ubutumwa bwerekeye » "
"rizihishwa."

msgid "@title placeholder"
msgstr "@title umwanya w’ahashirwa"

msgid "Determines the placement of the description."
msgstr "Igena aho isobanuro rizashyirwa."

msgid "Page (redirects to new page and displays the confirmation message)"
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro (rwohereza kuri rundi rupapuro rushya kandi rwerekane "
"ubutumwa bwo kubyemeza)"

msgid ""
"Key-value pairs MUST be specified as \"safe_key: 'Some readable "
"options'\". Use of only alphanumeric characters and underscores is "
"recommended in keys. One option per line."
msgstr ""
"Amakibinduranya y’agaciro n’ufunguzo (key-value pairs) BIKWIRAKWA "
"kugaragazwa nka `\"safe_key: 'Amahitamo amwe asomeka'\". Birasabwa "
"gukoresha inyuguti z’inyuguti n’imibare (alphanumeric) "
"n’utubumburangingo (underscores) gusa mu gufunguzo (keys). Hitamo "
"igisubizo kimwe kuri buri murongo."

msgid "Options display"
msgstr "Amahitamo yerekanwa"

msgid "Other option label"
msgstr "Izina ry’iyindi nzira"

msgid "Other maxlength"
msgstr "Ubugari ntarengwa bwinshi"

msgid "Email confirm settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo kwemeza imeri"

msgid "Email confirm description"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro byo kwemeza imeri"

msgid "Email confirm placeholder"
msgstr "Aho kwemeza imeri hagaragara (placeholder)"

msgid "Show reset button"
msgstr "Erekana buto yo gusubiza iboneza (reset)"

msgid "If checked, a reset button will be placed before the rating element."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranijwe, buto yo gusubiramo izashyirwa mbere y’icyiciro "
"cy’amanota."

msgid "Changing from %type"
msgstr "Guhindura uva kuri %type"

msgid "Specifies the minimum date."
msgstr "Igaragaza itariki ya mbere (ntarengwa) iboneye."

msgid "Specifies the maximum date."
msgstr "Bivuga itariki ntarengwa yemewe."

msgid ""
"Datetime element is designed to have sane defaults so any or all can "
"be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Ikintu cya *Datetime* cyateguwe kugira ngo kigire ibihinduka bifatika "
"bisanzwe, ku buryo ibyo ari byo byose bishobora gusigara bitavuzwe."

msgid ""
"Both the date and time components are configurable so they can be "
"output as HTML5 datetime elements or not, as desired."
msgstr ""
"Ibyerekeranye n’itariki n’igihe byose birashobora kugena uko "
"bigenzurwa kugira ngo bitangazwe nk’ibintu bya HTML5 "
"by’itariki-igihe (datetime) cyangwa se bikabikwa uko bikenewe, uko "
"ubishaka."

msgid "Date element"
msgstr "Itariki yo kurangira (Date element)"

msgid "HTML datetime - Use the HTML5 datetime element type."
msgstr ""
"Itariki ya HTML (datetime) — koresha ubwoko bw’icyiciro bwa HTML5 "
"bwayo yitwa `datetime`."

msgid ""
"HTML datetime input (localized) - Use the HTML5 datetime-local element "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Injiza ya HTML datetime (irahujwe n’ururimi) - Koresha ubwoko bwa "
"element ya HTML5 **datetime-local**."

msgid "HTML date input - Use the HTML5 date element type."
msgstr ""
"Iyinjiza y’umunsi mu HTML - Koresha ubwoko bw’ijenerali ya "
"**date** ya HTML5."

msgid "Text input - No HTML5 element, use a normal text field."
msgstr ""
"Ibyinjizwa mu nyandiko - Nta element ya HTML5; koresha umurima usanzwe "
"w’umwandiko."

msgid "None - Do not display a date element"
msgstr "Ntayo—ntugaragaze ikintu cyerekeye itariki"

msgid "A year in either position means that specific year."
msgstr ""
"Umwaka ubwo ari bwo bwose uri ku mwanya uwo ari wo wose usobanuye uwo "
"mwaka by’umwihariko."

msgid "HTML time input - Use a HTML5 time element type."
msgstr ""
"Gukoresha HTML igihe cyo kwinjiza - Hitamo ubwoko bw’#elemen# HTML5 "
"bwo **time**."

msgid "None - Do not display a time element."
msgstr "Nta na hamwe—ntukoreshe cyangwa ngo werekane igihe."

msgid "Delete this variant"
msgstr "Siba iyi variant"

msgid ""
"The flex property specifies the length of the item, relative to the "
"rest of the flexible items inside the same container."
msgstr ""
"Ibyerekeye *flex* bihamagarira uburebure bw’ikintu, ugereranyije "
"n’ibindi bintu bihindagurika (*flexible items*) biri muri uwo mufuka "
"umwe (*container*)."

msgid "Element format"
msgstr "Imiterere y’inyandiko"

msgid "Labels/values, the human-readable value (value)"
msgstr "Amazina/indangagaciro, agaciro kugaragara mu buryo bwumuntu (agaciro)"

msgid "Color swatch size"
msgstr "Ingano y’icyitegererezo cy’amabara"

msgid "Autocomplete minimum number of characters"
msgstr "Autokuzuza umubare ntarengwa w’imyandikire"

msgid "Autocomplete matching operator"
msgstr "Uwo mushoramurongo uhuza n’itangazamakuru (autocomplete)"

msgid "Column header prefix"
msgstr "Ubugari bw’umutwe w’inkingi bw’imbere"

msgid "Column header prefix key delimiter"
msgstr ""
"Urutonde rw’umutwe wa kolomu ikimenyetso gitangizwa na delimiter "
"y’ikirango"

msgid "Column header prefix label delimiter"
msgstr ""
"Icyitonderwa cy’ingaruka y’umutwe w’inkingi (column header) "
"mbere y’itandukanya"

msgid "Toggle details widget state."
msgstr "Hindura leta y’uwijegajega w’ ibisobanuro."

msgid "Form API #states must be manually entered."
msgstr "Imbuga (Form API) #states bigomba kwandikwa intoki."

msgid "Learn more about Drupal's <a href=\":href\">Form API #states</a>."
msgstr "Menya byinshi kuri <a href=\":href\">Form API #states</a> za Drupal."

msgid "of the following is met:"
msgstr "bigeze kuri kimwe muri ibyo bikurikira:"

msgid "Conditional logic (Form API #states) is using a custom %state state."
msgstr ""
"Ukurondora shingiro ukoreshwa mu buryo bwa logique (Form API #states) "
"bukoresha ukoresha %state yihariye nka state."

msgid "Conditional logic (Form API #states) is using multiple triggers."
msgstr ""
"Ukoresha imikurikirane y’imyitwarire yishingiye ku bihe (Form API "
"#states) ikoresha ibitera byinshi."

msgid ""
"Conditional logic (Form API #states) is using multiple nested "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Ubugenzacyemezo bwo gukoreshwa (Form API #states) bukoresha imiterere "
"myinshi yo kugenwa iri mu byiciro bihuze (nested)."

msgid "Conditional logic (Form API #states) is using the %operator operator."
msgstr ""
"Ubusanzwe bwo kugena uko bigenzurwa (Form API #states) bukoresha "
"umukoresha **%operator**."

msgid "Conditional logic (Form API #states) has multiple operators."
msgstr ""
"Ubuganisha bw’amategeko (Form API #states) bufite abashoramari "
"(operators) benshi."

msgid "%name must be on or after %min."
msgstr "%name igomba kuba kuri cyangwa nyuma ya %min."

msgid "%name must be on or before %max."
msgstr "%name igomba kuba iriho kuri cyangwa mbere ya %max."

msgid "Select the date parts and order that should be used in the element."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo ibice by’amatariki n’urutonde bigomba gukoreshwa muri "
"element."

msgid ""
"Select date parts that should be presented as text fields instead of "
"drop-down selectors."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo ibice by’itariki bikwiye kugaragazwa nk’imyandikire "
"(imigenzura yanditse) aho gukoresha amasanduku amanura (drop-down)."

msgid "@title [Time]"
msgstr "@title [Igihe]"

msgid "Entity reference elements"
msgstr "Ibice byerekana umubano (entity reference)"

msgid "File upload elements"
msgstr "Ibikoresho byo gushyiraho dosiye"

msgid "Markup elements"
msgstr "Ibintu by’ikirango (Markup)"

msgid "Range settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’urwego"

msgid "Send on"
msgstr "Ohereza kuri"

msgid ""
"Check this option if the user should be allowed to upload multiple "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo iyi sisitemu niba uwakoresha agomba kwemererwa kohereza dosiye "
"nyinshi."

msgid "Get involved"
msgstr "Shiriki"

msgid "Signature Pad"
msgstr "Icyapa cyo gusinya"

msgid ""
"Controls how videos are displayed in inline help and within the global "
"help section."
msgstr ""
"Igenzura uko amashusho (videos) agaragazwa mu bufasha buhurijwe "
"n’inyandiko (inline help) no mu gice rusange cy’ubufasha (global "
"help)."

msgid "Tableselect sort"
msgstr "**Imbonerahamwe-isobanura gutondeka**"

msgid ""
"'@title' is a '@type' element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered."
msgstr ""
"`@title` ni ikintu cya `@type`, kigeze gubuza gukoreshwa (disabled) "
"kandi ntikizagaragazwa (ntikizikoreshwa mu kwerekanwa)."

msgid ""
"The %title options are being set by the %module_names @module. "
"Altering any of the below options will override these dynamically "
"populated options."
msgstr ""
"Amahitamo ya %title arimo gushyirwaho n’imikorere ya %module_names "
"@module. Guhindura kimwe mu byatoranijwe hepfo bigasimbura ayo "
"mahitamo yashyizweho hakoreshejwe uburyo bw’uburyo bushyirwamo mu "
"buryo bwikora."

msgid ""
"The %title options have been customized. Resetting the below options "
"will allow the %module_names @module to dynamically populate these "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Amahitamo ya %title yarahinduwe. Gusubiramo (reset) aya mahitamo ari "
"munsi bizemerera %module_names @module kuzuza aya mahitamo ukoresheje "
"uburyo bwo kuyabonera uko bikurikirana (dynamically)."

msgid ""
"Accepts any date in any <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">GNU "
"Date Input Format</a>. Strings such as today, +2 months, and Dec 9 "
"2004 are all valid."
msgstr ""
"Byakira itariki iyo ari yo yose ukoresheje <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">Imiterere "
"yo kwinjiza itariki ya GNU</a>. Imirongo nka today, +2 months, na Dec "
"9 2004 byose biremerwa."

msgid ""
"The @title could not be interpreted in <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">GNU "
"Date Input Format</a>."
msgstr ""
"@title ntibishoboraga gusobanurwa neza muri <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">Imiterere "
"y’Ibyinjijwe by’Itariki ya GNU</a>."

msgid "Use min/max validation to define a more specific date range."
msgstr ""
"Koresha igenzura rishingiye kuri min/max kugirango ubone intera "
"y’amatariki yihariye kurushaho."

msgid ""
"HTML5 datetime elements do not gracefully degrade in older browsers "
"and will be displayed as a plain text field without a date or time "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"Ibintu bya HTML5 bishingiye ku itariki n’igihe ntibisubira inyuma mu "
"buryo bwiza mu mushakisha zishaje, bityo bikazerekanwa nk’isanduku "
"isanzwe yanditseho inyandiko, nta mukandara wo guhitamo itariki "
"cyangwa igihe."

msgid ""
"Time format is only applicable for browsers that do not have support "
"for the HTML5 time element. Browsers that support the HTML5 time "
"element will display the time using the user's preferred format."
msgstr ""
"Imiterere y’igihe ireba gusa za mushakisha (browsers) zitagira "
"inkunga y’igisanduku cy’igihe cya HTML5 (HTML5 time element). "
"Mushakisha zishyigikira igikoresho cya HTML5 cyo gutangira igihe "
"zizerekana igihe hakurikijwe imiterere umukoresha yitoranyirije."

msgid ""
"Enter time format using <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/en/function.date.php\">Time Input "
"Format</a>."
msgstr ""
"Egeretsa igihe ukoresheje <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/en/function.date.php\">Imiterere "
"y’iyinjizwa ry’igihe</a>."

msgid ""
"Private file system is not set. This must be changed in <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/file\">settings.php</a>. "
"For more information see: <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/psa-2016-003\">DRUPAL-PSA-2016-003</a>"
msgstr ""
"Sisitemu y’idosiye bwite ntirashyizweho. Ibi bigomba guhinduka muri "
"<a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/file\">settings.php</a>. "
"Uramutse ushaka ibisobanuro birambuye reba: <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/psa-2016-003\">DRUPAL-PSA-2016-003</a>"

msgid ""
"Specifies the legal number intervals. Leave blank to support any "
"number interval."
msgstr ""
"Igaragaza iby’akarusho byemewe by’imibare (umubare "
"w’igihe/ibyiciro). Fubagire ubusa kugira ngo bifashe kuri buri "
"cy’igihe cy’imibare."

msgid ""
"Accepts any time in any <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">GNU "
"Date Input Format</a>. Strings such as now, +2 hours, and 4:30 PM are "
"all valid."
msgstr ""
"Bihabwa ikiringo icyo ari cyo cyose mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose bwa <a "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/tar/manual/html_chapter/tar_7.html#Date-input-formats\">GNU "
"Date Input Format</a>. Imirongo nka *now*, *+2 hours*, na *4:30 PM* "
"byose ni ibisanzwe kandi biremewe."

msgid ""
"If checked, the download file extension will be change from .html to "
".xls."
msgstr ""
"Niba byahinduwe, inyongera y’izina rya dosiye yo gukuramo izahinduka "
"ivuye kuri .html igere kuri .xls."

msgid ""
"%title is a %type element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered. Go to the <a href=\":href\">admin settings</a> page to "
"enable this element."
msgstr ""
"%title ni ikintu cya %type cyamaze guhagarikwa, bityo ntizerekwe. Jya "
"ku ipaji <a href=\":href\">y’imyigenzo yo kuri admin</a> kugira ngo "
"iki kintu gishoboke."

msgid ""
"%title is a %type element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered. Please contact a site administrator."
msgstr ""
"`%title` ni ikintu cya `%type` cyaranzwe kandi ntikirimo kwerekazwa. "
"Nyamuneka hamagara umuyobozi wa urubuga."

msgid ""
"Select roles and users that should be able to populate this element "
"when creating a new submission."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo uruhare n'abakoresha bagomba kuba bashobora kuzuza iki kintu "
"mugihe hashyizweho itangwa rishya."

msgid ""
"Select roles and users that should be able to update this element when "
"updating an existing submission."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo uruhare (roles) n’abakoresha bemerewe kuvugurura iyi element "
"mugihe uhindura (update) itangwa rihari."

msgid ""
"Select roles and users that should be able to view this element when "
"viewing a submission."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo uruhare n’abakoresha bagomba kuba bashobora kureba iyi "
"elementi igihe ureba ifatizo."

msgid "Read the %label element's <a href=\":href\">API documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Soma <a href=\":href\">inyandiko ngengamikorere (API)</a> y’ikintu "
"cya %label."

msgid "A select menu field."
msgstr "Urwego rwo guhitamo (select)"

msgid "Processed text settings"
msgstr "Amasano yo gutunganya inyandiko"

msgid ""
"Allowing N/A is ideal for situations where you wish to make a likert "
"element required, but still want to allow users to opt out of certain "
"questions."
msgstr ""
"Gwemera “N/A” ni byo byiza mu bihe ushaka ko ikintu cya likert "
"kiba kigomba gusubizwa, ariko ukaba ushaka no guha abashaka amahitamo "
"yo kwirengagiza (kwanga) ibindi bibazo bimwe na bimwe."

msgid "N/A answer text"
msgstr "N/A inyandiko y’igisubizo"

msgid "Employee Evaluation"
msgstr "Isuzuma ry’Abakozi"

msgid "Job Seeker Profile"
msgstr "Urwandiko ngiro rw’ushaka akazi"

msgid "Session Evaluation"
msgstr "Isuzuma ry’amasomo y’igihe (Session Evaluation)"

msgid ""
"Below are all available element properties with translatable "
"properties in <strong>bold</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Hano hepfo hari imiterere yose iboneka y’ibice, hamwe n’ibyayo "
"bifite ibishobora guhindurwamo mu <strong>magambo arinzwe</strong>."

msgid "Number settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’ibihamba (numero)"

msgid "Other option settings"
msgstr "Izindi mpanuro z’ibindi bishoboka"

msgid "If checked, a select all checkbox will be added to the header."
msgstr "Niba byagenzuwe, agasanduku ko guhitamo byose kazongerwa mu mutwe."

msgid "Specifies the minimum time."
msgstr "Ibisobanura igihe ntarengwa."

msgid "Specifies the maximum time."
msgstr "Igaragaza igihe ntarengwa."

msgid "Specifies the minute intervals."
msgstr "Bigaragaza intera z’iminota."

msgid "Enter interval in seconds."
msgstr "Shyiramo intera mu masegonda."

msgid "If checked, sent emails will be displayed onscreen to all users."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ubutumwa bwo kuri imeli bwohererezwa buzagaragazwa "
"ku ekran ku bakoresha bose."

msgid ""
"If checked, posted submissions will be displayed onscreen to all "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranyijwe, kohereza gusaba/ibyangombwa bizagaragara ku mpande "
"z’abantu bose."

msgid "E164"
msgstr "E164"

msgid "Valid countries"
msgstr "Amahanga yemerewe"

msgid "Provides CAPTCHA for adding challenges to arbitrary forms."
msgstr ""
"Bitanga CAPTCHA yo kongeramo ibibazo (challenges) ku mpapuro zifatwa "
"uko umuntu bashaka."

msgid ""
"Text or code that is placed directly in front of the input. This can "
"be used to prefix an input with a constant string. Examples: $, #, -."
msgstr ""
"Umwandiko cyangwa kode ishyirwa mbere y’injiza (input). Ibi "
"bishobora gukoreshwa mu kwongeraho prefix y’inyuguti zihoraho "
"(constant string) ku njiza. Urugero: $, #, -."

msgid ""
"Text or code that is placed directly after the input. This can be used "
"to add a unit to an input. Examples: lb, kg, %."
msgstr ""
"Ushyirwa inyuma y’icyinjijwe (input) ukaboneka ihita. Ibi bishobora "
"gukoreshwa mu kongeramo ikinyabupfura ku cyinjijwe. Urugero: lb, kg, "
"%."

msgid ""
"Unable to render elements, please view the below message(s) and the "
"error log."
msgstr ""
"Ntibishoboka gutanga aya mashusho/ibintu (elements), nyamuneka reba "
"ubutumwa buri hasi hamwe n’ikinyamakuru cy’amakosa (error log)."

msgid "Unsaved warning is enabled for all forms."
msgstr ""
"Uburwayi bwo kuburira ku byo utarakiriye kubika burakora kuri</br> "
"imisanzu yose."

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be displayed a warning message when they "
"navigate away from a form with unsaved changes."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, abakoresha bazerekanwa ubutumwa bw’ingaruka "
"(uruburira) igihe bazava kuri formulaire bafite impinduka zitabitswe."

msgid ""
"Expand/collapse all (details) link is automatically added to all "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"Icyo wandika/Cyihishe byose (ibisobanuro) ihuza yongerwa bwikora kuri "
"buri fomu."

msgid "The HTTP method with which the form will be submitted."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kohereza (HTTP method) bukoreshwa mu kohereza ifishi."

msgid "POST (Custom)"
msgstr "POST (Custom) -> **POST (Yihariye)**"

msgid "GET (Custom)"
msgstr "BONA (Ubuheherewe)"

msgid ""
"Code Mirror is used to provide a text editor for YAML, HTML, CSS, and "
"JavaScript configuration settings and messages."
msgstr ""
"Code Mirror ikoreshwa gutanga umwanditsi w’inyandiko ushobora "
"kugufasha kwandika no guhindura igenamiterere rya YAML, HTML, CSS, na "
"JavaScript n’amasohoza y’ayo makuru."

msgid ""
"Input masks are used to ensure predefined and custom formats for text "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Imyandikire yinjizwayo (input masks) ikoreshwa kugira ngo hamenyekane "
"imiterere isanzwe n’iyihariye yemewe y’imyandiko iri mu mirima "
"yanditseho (text fields)."

msgid ""
"Rating plugin for jQuery. Fast, progressive enhancement, touch "
"support, customizable (just swap out the images, or change some CSS), "
"unobtrusive JavaScript (using HTML5 data-* attributes), RTL support. "
"The Rating plugin supports as many stars as you'd like, and also any "
"step size."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro (Rating) ya plugin ya jQuery. Yihuta, ikorwa hakoreshejwe "
"iterambere buhoro (progressive enhancement), ifite inkunga yo gukoraho "
"(touch), irashobora guhindurwa (hindura gusa amashusho, cyangwa "
"uhindureho CSS zimwe), kandi ikaba JavaScript idahungabanya urubuga "
"(ikoresheje ibyuma by’inyandiko bya HTML5 data-*). Ifite inkunga "
"y’ururimi/uko wandikwa iburyo-ibumoso (RTL). Plugin y’Agaciro "
"yemerera inyenyeri z’ubunini ushaka, ndetse no kuba wakwiyongeraho "
"cyangwa ukagenda ukoresheje ingano y’intambwe (step size) iyo ari yo "
"yose."

msgid ""
"Select2 gives you a customizable select box with support for searching "
"and tagging."
msgstr ""
"Select2 iguha agasanduku ko guhitamo (select box) kishobora "
"guhindurwa, gifite ubushobozi bwo gushaka no kongeramo amagambo "
"(tagging)."

msgid ""
"Signature Pad is a JavaScript library for drawing smooth signatures. "
"It is HTML5 canvas based and uses variable width Bézier curve "
"interpolation. It works in all modern desktop and mobile browsers and "
"doesn't depend on any external libraries."
msgstr ""
"Signature Pad ni isomero rya JavaScript rikoreshwa mu gushushanya "
"umukono mu buryo bworoshye kandi buhoraho. Rishingiye kuri HTML5 "
"canvas kandi rikoresha interPOLASI ya Bézier curve ifite ubugari "
"bugenda buhinduka. Rikora mu buryo bwiza ku mashini zigendanwa na "
"mudasobwa zigigezweho zifite ibiranga bigezweho byose (modern "
"browsers), kandi ntishingira ku yandi masomero abigenga."

msgid "Signature Pad is used to provide a signature element."
msgstr ""
"Agasanduku k’uko kwandika umukono gikoreshwa mu gutanga ikintu cyo "
"kwiyandikisha umukono."

msgid ""
"A lightweight, customizable javascript timepicker plugin for jQuery, "
"inspired by Google Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Igikoresho cyo kwerekana igihe cya javascript gito kandi gihindurwamo "
"ukoresheje, plugin ikoresha jQuery, gikurikiye imiterere "
"y’iy’Abakoresha Google Calendar."

