msgstr ""
"Itanga igikoresho cy’ifishi cyo kwerekana gusa, gifite umutwe "
"(title) n’ ibisobanuro (description) bishobora kuba bihari cyangwa "
"bitabaho."

msgid "Provides a form element for entering a telephone number."
msgstr "Itanga ikintu cy’ifishi yo kwinjiza nimero ya telefoni."

msgid "Provides a text format form element."
msgstr "Butanga imiterere y’ikintu (form element) cyo kwinjiza inyandiko."

msgid "Provides a form element for storage of internal information."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ikintu cy’inyandiko (form element) cyo kubikamo amakuru "
"y’imbere (internal information)."

msgid "Composite element options"
msgstr "Amahitamo y’uruhuruzo rufatanyije"

msgid ""
"Provides a form element to collect contact information (name, address, "
"phone, email)."
msgstr ""
"Itanga urwego rw’ifishi yo gukusanya amakuru y’ubuntu (izina, "
"aderesi, nimero ya terefone, imeri)."

msgid ""
"Provides a flex(ible) box container used to layout elements in "
"multiple columns."
msgstr ""
"Itanga agasanduku ukoresha ingengabitekerezo ya flex (uhinduranya) "
"gikoreshwa mugushiraho ibice by’ibigize urubuga mu nzego nyinshi "
"(columns)."

msgid "Provides a form element for uploading and saving an image file."
msgstr ""
"Itanga igikoresho cy’uburyo bwo kohereza no kubika dosiye "
"y’ishusho."

msgid "Likert questions and answers options"
msgstr ""
"Ibibazo bya Likert n’inyandiko z’itonde ry’ihitamo "
"ry’ibisubizo"

msgid ""
"The 'File' element is unavailable because no stream wrappers are "
"available"
msgstr ""
"Ikintu cya “Idosiye” ntikiraboneka kubera ko nta stream wrapper "
"iboneka."

msgid "Provides a form element for time selection."
msgstr "Itanga ikintu (element) cy’ifishi cyo guhitamo igihe."

msgid "Provides a form element for uploading and saving a video file."
msgstr "Iha igikoresho cy’ifishi cyo kohereza no kubika dosiye ya videwo."

msgid "Disable system tray"
msgstr ""
"Komeza uhagarike agasanduku k’inyandiko k’uburyo bwa sisitemu "
"(system tray)"

msgid "Display elements in table columns"
msgstr "Erekana ibintu muri kolamu z’ameza"

msgid ""
"If checked, the <a href=\":href\">autocomplete</a> attribute will be "
"set to off, which disables autocompletion for all form elements."
msgstr ""
"Niba bigenzuwe, umwihariko wa <a href=\":href\">autocomplete</a "
"uzashyirwaho kuba off, bigahagarika autocomplete ku bintu byose bigize "
"ifishi."

msgid "Disable off-canvas system tray"
msgstr "Kudzimya akabati k’amakuru ku mpande kugaragara hanze (off-canvas)"

msgid ""
"Check this option if the user should be allowed to enter multiple "
"entity references using tags."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo iyi dositiri niba wifuza ko umukoresha yemerewe kwinjiza "
"ihuriro ry’ibintu (entity references) byinshi ukoresheje utudomo "
"tw’amatangazo (tags)."

msgid "Provides a form element to display a link."
msgstr "Itanga ikintu cy’ifishi yo kwerekana ihuza."

msgid "Wrapper type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa wrapper"

msgid "Webform Demo: Application/Evaluation System"
msgstr "Urugero rwa Webform: Sisitemu yo Gusaba/Isuzuma"

msgid ""
"If set, this message will be used when an element's allowed number of "
"values is exceeded, instead of the default \"@message\" message."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ubu butumwa buzakoreshwa igihe umubare ntarengwa "
"wemewe w’indangagaciro (values) w’iyo ngingo urenzewe, mu rwego "
"rwo gusimbura ubutumwa busanzwe “@message”."

msgid ""
"If the close date/time is left blank, this webform will never be "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Niba itariki/igihe cyo gufunga bisigaye bifite ubusa, iyi webform "
"ntizigera ifungwe."

msgid "Page title to be shown upon successful submission."
msgstr ""
"Igihe cy’impapuro kigaragazwa inyuma y’uko koherezwa byagenze "
"neza."

msgid ""
"A jQuery plugin for entering and validating international telephone "
"numbers. It adds a flag dropdown to any input, detects the user's "
"country, displays a relevant placeholder and provides "
"formatting/validation methods."
msgstr ""
"Plugin ya jQuery yo kwinjiza no kugenzura nimero z’amatelefoni zo mu "
"mahanga. Ishyiraho rihene (flag) mu buryo bwo guhitamo ku mwinjiriro "
"uwo ariwo wose, igakomeza kumenya igihugu cy’umukoresha, ikerekana "
"indangabiranga (placeholder) iboneye, ndetse ikatanga uburyo bwo "
"gutunganya (formatting) no kugenzura (validation)."

msgid ""
"Select 'Webform from URL' to display this block, when the current "
"request's path contains the selected webform."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo “Webform kuva kuri URL” kugirango werekane iyi bloc, igihe "
"inzira y’ubu isabwa irimo webform yo wahisemo."

msgid ""
"Select 'Webform submission from URL' to display this block, when the "
"current request's path contains a webform submission that was created "
"from the selected webform."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo “Webform submission from URL” kugirango werekane iyi bloc, "
"igihe inzira (path) iriho muri iyi request irimo webform submission "
"yakozwe hifashishijwe muri webform yatoranijwe."

msgid ""
"Select 'Node from URL' to display this block, when the current "
"request's path contains a node that references the selected webform "
"using a dedicated webform field or node."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo “Node from URL” kugira ngo agaragaze iyi block, igihe "
"inzira y’ubusabe iriho (current request’s path) ikubiyemo node "
"ifitanye isano n’urubuga rwatoranyijwe (webform) ukoresheje ikibanza "
"cya webform cyabugenewe cyangwa node."

msgid "Provides an element to render advanced HTML markup and processed text."
msgstr ""
"Itanga igikoresho cyo kwerekana ibyiciro by’HTML byateye imbere "
"hamwe n’inyandiko ibanje gukorwa."

msgid "Tree delimiter"
msgstr "Itandukanya rya Tree"

msgid ""
"Provides a form element to select a single or multiple terms displayed "
"as hierarchical tree or as breadcrumbs using a select menu."
msgstr ""
"Itanga agace k’imiterere (form element) ko guhitamo igitekerezo "
"kimwe cyangwa byinshi bigaragazwa nk’uko ibiti by’imikoranire "
"(hierarchical tree) bigenda, cyangwa nk’udutonde tw’intambwe "
"(breadcrumbs), ukoresheje indangururamajwi y’uburyo bwo guhitamo "
"(select menu)."

msgid "Demo: Application Evaluation"
msgstr "**Demeteri: Isuzuma rya Porogaramu**"

msgid "Limit term depth"
msgstr "Kugabanya uburebure bw’imvano y’amagambo (term depth)"

msgid "Default submission logging"
msgstr "Gushyiraho kwandika ibyoherezwa bisanzwe (logging)"

msgid "Form previous submissions notification"
msgstr "Imenyesha ry’uko ibyifuzo byoherejwe mbere byabonetse"

msgid "Email to address options"
msgstr "Imeri yo kohereza kuri amahitamo y’aderesi"

msgid "Email from address options"
msgstr "Ihitamo ry’aho email yoherezwa (email sender)"

msgid "Return path email"
msgstr "Garura e-mail y’inzira (return path)"

msgid ""
"To uninstall Webform node, delete all content that has the Webform "
"content type."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ukureho node ya Webform, kora iseswa rya byose bikubiyemo "
"ubwoko bw’inyandiko (content type) ya Webform."

msgid ""
"There is data for this element in the database. This setting can no "
"longer be changed."
msgstr ""
"Hariho amakuru y’iyi elementi yabitswe muri database. Iri "
"genamiterere ntirishobora kongera guhindurwa."

msgid ""
"If the open date/time is left blank, this form will immediately be "
"opened."
msgstr ""
"Niba itariki/igihe cyo gufungura gihariweho ubusa, iyi fomu "
"izafungurwa ako kanya."

msgid ""
"A message to be displayed notifying the user that the webform is going "
"to be opening to submissions. The opening message will only be "
"displayed when a webform is scheduled to be opened."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bugenewe kwerekanwa buhamagarira ukoresha ko urupapuro "
"rw’ifishi (webform) ruzaba rufungura kwakira ibihabwa. Ubutumwa bwo "
"gufungura buzagaragazwa gusa igihe webform iteganyijwe gufungurwa."

msgid ""
"A message to be displayed notifying the user that the webform is "
"closed. The closed message will be displayed when a webform's status "
"is closed or a submission limit is reached."
msgstr ""
"Ubutumwa bugenewe kugaragaza umukoresha ko urubuga rw’inyandiko "
"(webform) rwarafunzwe. Ubutumwa bw’uko bwafunzwe buzerekanwa igihe "
"imiterere ya webform iba ifunze cyangwa iyo umubare ntarengwa w’ubwo "
"yohererezwa uba ugeze ku ndunduro."

msgid ""
"If checked, the submit button will be disabled immediately after it is "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranijwe, buto yo kohereza izahagarikwa ako kanya imaze "
"gukandwa."

msgid "Allow your users to save and finish the webform later"
msgstr "Emeze abayikoresha bawe kubika webform hanyuma bakayirangiza nyuma"

msgid "Authenticated and anonymous users"
msgstr "Abakoresha basinywe na abashyitsi (batabifite)"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to enable the <a href=\":href\">automatic purging of "
"draft submissions</a>, to ensure that your database is not filled with "
"abandoned anonymous submissions in draft."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka menya neza ko ushoboza <a href=\":href\">kwohereza kenshi "
"byikora ibicibwa by’ubwanditsi</a>, kugirango hamenyekane ko ububiko "
"bwawe (database) butazuzwa n’ibisigazwa by’abatabitanze "
"(anonymous) byanditswe bikarangira mu buryo bw’ubwanditsi (draft) "
"bitarasohoye."

msgid "Submission behaviors"
msgstr "Imyitwarire yo gutanga ibiganiro"

msgid ""
"If checked, drafts and submissions created by an anonymous user will "
"be reassigned to their user account when they login."
msgstr ""
"Ki yemejwe, inyandiko zo gusakara (drafts) n’inyandiko zemejwe "
"(submissions) zakozwe n’umukoresha utatangajwe izongezwa ku k "
"c’utewe (account) ry’umukoresha ubwo yiyandikishije (login)."

msgid "Log submission events"
msgstr "Kwandika ibyabaye bijyanye no kwohereza ibitekerezo"

msgid "International Telephone Input is used by the Telephone element."
msgstr "International Telephone Input ikoreshwa n’Ikintu cyitwa Telephone."

msgid ""
"A simple jQuery plugin that transforms a select element into a more "
"user friendly graphical interface."
msgstr ""
"Agapaki gatoya ka jQuery plugin gihindura uburyo bwo guhitamo (select) "
"bugahinduka interineti igaragaza kandi ikoroherwa kuyikoresha."

msgid "The username of the user that submitted the webform."
msgstr ""
"Izina ry’ukoresha (username) ry’uwo wohereje urupapuro "
"rw’urubuga (webform)."

msgid ""
"If checked, all submission events will be logged to dedicated "
"submission log available to all webforms and submissions."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ibyabaye byose byo kwiyandikisha bizandikwa mu log "
"yihariye yo kwiyandikisha iboneka kuri buri webform n’abashyikiriza."

msgid "Default reply-to email"
msgstr "Imeri isanzwe yo gusubiza kuri yo"

msgid "Default return path (email)"
msgstr "Inzira isanzwe yo gusubiza (imeri)"

msgid "Set submission source entity: @source_entity"
msgstr "Kwagena inkomoko yoohereza: @source_entity"

msgid ""
"Use this field's %entity_type entity as the webform submission's "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Koresha iyi %entity_type y’uru bwoko rw’ikigo nk’iy’aho "
"bwohererezwa (source entity) y’inyandiko yohererejwe kuri webform."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the current page's entity will be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity. For example, if this webform was displayed "
"on a node's page, the current node would be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity."
msgstr ""
"Niba bidahinzwe, urupapuro ririho ubu rwifashishwa nk’isosiyeti "
"(source entity) iturukirwaho mu ihererekanyabikorwa (webform) "
"ryoherezwa. Kurugero, niba iyi webform yarerekanwe ku ipaji y’node, "
"node iriho ubu ni yo yakoreshejwe nk’isosiyeti iturukirwaho mu "
"ihererekanyabikorwa ry’iyo webform."

msgid "Open value"
msgstr "Fungura agaciro"

msgid "Close value"
msgstr "Funga agaciro"

msgid "Default submission data (YAML)"
msgstr "Détawa ishyikirizwa risanzwe (YAML)"

msgid "The @title close date cannot be before the open date"
msgstr ""
"Itariki yo gufunga ya @title ntishobora kuba mbere y’itariki yo "
"gufungura."

msgid "Initial country"
msgstr "Igihugu cy’inkomoko"

msgid "Image select"
msgstr "Hitamo ifoto"

msgid "Provides a form element for selecting images."
msgstr "Itanga imbonerahamwe (form) yo guhitamo amashusho."

msgid "'@subject' sent to '@to_mail' from '@from_name' [@from_mail]'."
msgstr ""
"‘@subject’ yoherejwe kuri ‘@to_mail’ ivuye kuri "
"‘@from_name’ [@from_mail] ."

msgid "Other (Used when 'other' value is entered)"
msgstr "Ibindi (Bikoreshwa iyo uduhantu “ibindi” winjije)"

msgid "Empty (Used when no option is selected)"
msgstr "Nta cyo (Byakoreshejwe iyo nta gihitamo cyatoranyijwe)"

msgid "Webform Demo: Event Registration System"
msgstr "Urugero rwa Webform: Sisitemu yo Kwiyandikisha ku Mlunzi (Amahugurwa)"

msgid "Webform scheduled email commands"
msgstr ""
"Amabwiriza yoherejwe mu rwego rw’imererwa (scheduled) rya imeri ya "
"Webform"

msgid "Allows webform emails to be scheduled."
msgstr "Ishoboza guteganya imeri zo muri webform."

msgid "Handler @id is not a scheduled email handler."
msgstr ""
"Icyakora @id si umuyoboro w’imerere y’ubutumwa bwa e-mail "
"uteganyijwe."

msgid "Webform Scheduled Email Handler"
msgstr "Igenzura ryo Kohereza Imeri Yateguwe muri Webform"

msgid "scheduled"
msgstr "byateganijwe"

msgid "Scheduled email @action for @handler handler."
msgstr "Imeri yo kohereza yateguwe kuri @action kuri @handler."

msgid "queued to be sent."
msgstr "byategerejwe koherezwa."

msgid "Scheduled email status (@total)"
msgstr "Imimerere y’imerere yoherezwa (kugeza kuri @total)"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended that <a href=\":href\">submission "
"logging</a> is enable to track scheduled emails."
msgstr ""
"Birakomeye gusabwa ko <a href=\":href\">ibikorwa byo kwandika "
"kohereza</a> (submission logging) byemererwa kugira ngo hagaragazwe "
"kandi bikurikiranwe ubutumwa bwohererezwa bugambiriwe (scheduled "
"emails)."

msgid "Send email on"
msgstr "Ohereza imeri kuri"

msgid "Check schedule emails after submissions have been processed."
msgstr ""
"Reba email zo mu gihe cyohererezwa nyuma y’uko ibisohoka bimaze "
"gutunganywa."

msgid "Multiple handlers can be used to schedule multiple emails."
msgstr "Abakoresha benshi bashobora gukoreshwa mu gutegura imeri nyinshi."

msgid "Deleting this handler will unschedule all scheduled emails."
msgstr ""
"Gukuraho iyi handler bizakuraho gutegura (gusiba) imeri zose "
"zateganyijwe."

msgid ""
"Scheduled emails are automatically sent starting at midnight using <a "
"href=\":href\">cron</a>, which is executed at predefined interval."
msgstr ""
"Imeri zatunganijwe zoherezwa mu buryo bwikora guhera saa sita, "
"hifashishijwe <a href=\":href\">cron</a>, itangizwa ikurikije igihe "
"kihariwe mbere."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>not sent</b> for %handler handler because a "
"<em>To</em>, <em>CC</em>, or <em>BCC</em> email was not provided."
msgstr ""
"%submission: Imezi <b>ntyoherejwe</b> kuri %handler kubera ko "
"<em>To</em>, <em>CC</em>, cyangwa <em>BCC</em> yohererejwe atatanzwe."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>not scheduled</b> for %handler handler because "
"%send is not a valid date/token."
msgstr ""
"%submission: Imeri <b>ntyateguwe</b> kuri %handler kuko %send si "
"itariki/ikimenyetso (token) ikwiriye."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>@action</b> by %handler handler to be sent on "
"%date."
msgstr ""
"%submission: Ibaruwa <b>@action</b> yakorwa n’%handler "
"nk’uwabishinzwe izoherezwa kuri %date."

msgid "%submission: Email <b>unscheduled</b> for %handler handler."
msgstr "%submission: Imeri <b>ntirateguwe</b> ku mukoresha wa %handler."

msgid "Unschedule:"
msgstr "Kureka gahunda:"

msgid "Show all webforms"
msgstr "Erekana amadosiye y’urubuga yose (webforms)"

msgid "Select how multiple values are displayed."
msgstr "Hitamo uburyo inyandiko nyinshi zerekanwa."

msgid "Contact Documentation"
msgstr "Menya Dokumenitiki"

msgid "Webform Cookbook"
msgstr "Ubusobanuro bwa Webform (Webform Cookbook)"

msgid "Signature related-projects"
msgstr "Bifitanye isano n’inyandiko zihuye n’imishinga لاifitanye isano"

msgid "Form builder comparison"
msgstr "Kugereranya abubaka imbuga z’ibibazo"

msgid ""
"Webform is much heavier; it has a great deal of functionality enabled "
"right within the one module, and that's on top of supplying all the "
"normal field elements (because it doesn't just use the Field API)"
msgstr ""
"Webform niyo iremereye kurushaho; ifite imikorere myinshi cyane "
"ihindurirwa mu buryo bwikora muri module imwe, kandi ibyo ni byo "
"byiyongeraho no ku bindi byose bisanzwe bigize umurongo w’ama data "
"(kuko itakoresha gusa Field API)"

msgid ""
"Please post comments and feedback to this <a href=\":href\">Google "
"Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka wohereze ibisobanuro n’ibitekerezo kuri iyi <a "
"href=\":href\">Google Sheet</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> library is <a "
"href=\":external_href\">externally hosted libraries</a> and loaded via "
"a Content Delivery Network (CDN)."
msgstr ""
"Igitabo cya <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> ni <a "
"href=\":external_href\">urutonde rw’ibitabo (libraries) rutitungwa "
"hanze</a> kandi rukururwa hakoreshejwe Ikibuga cyo kugeza ibintu kuri "
"enterineti (Content Delivery Network - CDN)."

msgid ""
"A jQuery plugin that makes long, unwieldy select boxes much more "
"user-friendly."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro ka jQuery (plugin) gakoreshwa mu gutuma amahitamo (select "
"boxes) maremare kandi abarambiranye biba byoroshye gukoresha ku buryo "
"bwumvikana kurushaho ku mukoresha."

msgid "Leave blank to use %email as the '@title' email."
msgstr "Siga ubusa kugirango ukoreshe %email nka ‘@title’ email."

msgid "File upload limit"
msgstr "Imipaka yo kohereza dosiye"

msgid "Excluded submission handlers"
msgstr "Abakoresha bateganyirijwe koherezwa baranzwe"

msgid "Purging settings"
msgstr "Gusiba iby’iboneza (purging settings)"

msgid ""
"If checked, source entity can be populated using query string "
"parameters. For example, appending "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 to a webform's URL would "
"set a submission's 'Submitted to' value to 'node:1'."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ikintu fatizo (source entity) gishobora "
"kuzu/kwuzuzwa hifashishijwe ibipimo byoherejwe mu cyinjira (query "
"string parameters). Kurugero, wongereho kuri URL ya webform "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 byagira icyo kwinjiramo "
"(submission) “Submitted to” bisimbukireho bikaba “node:1”."

msgid ""
"Third party settings allow contrib and custom modules to define "
"webform specific customization settings."
msgstr ""
"Igenamiterere ry’abagatatu (third party) remerera ibice "
"by’inyongeramusaruro (contrib) n’ibikorwa byabigenewe gukora "
"(custom modules) gusobanura igenamiterere rihariye ryo kwihindurira "
"urubuga (webform) mu buryo butandukanye."

msgid "Required by @type element."
msgid_plural "Required by @type elements."
msgstr[0] "Birasabwa n’iyo elementi yo kuri @type."
msgstr[1] "Birasabwa n’izo elementi zo kuri @type."

msgid "Duplicate '@label' options"
msgstr "Subiramo amahitamo ya “@label”"

msgid "%name: this element cannot hold more than @count value."
msgid_plural "%name: this element cannot hold more than @count values."
msgstr[0] ""
"%name: iyi element ntishobora kubamo indangagaciro ziruta agaciro ka "
"@count."
msgstr[1] ""
"%name: iyi element ntishobora kubamo indangagaciro ziruta agaciro ka "
"@count."

msgid ""
"Third party settings allow contrib and custom modules to define global "
"settings that are applied to all webforms and submissions."
msgstr ""
"Amahanga atanga ubushobozi (third party settings) yemerera za module "
"z’ubufatanye n’izihariye gusobanura uburyo rusange (global "
"settings) bikoreshwa kuri formulaire zose z’iminota (webforms) "
"ndetse no ku byoherejwe byose (submissions)."

msgid "File upload settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo kohereza dosiye"

msgid ""
"Uncheck the below optional external libraries that you do not want to "
"be used by any webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kuraho agasanduku k’ibipimo by’inyongera byo hanze biri hepfo "
"zitwawe utifuza ko zikoreshwa n’urubuga rwa webforms."

msgid ""
"The default sender address for emailed webform results; often the "
"email address of the maintainer of your forms."
msgstr ""
"Aderesi ya mbere yo koherezera (sender) ibisubizo byoherejwe mu buryo "
"bwa imeri (webform); akenshi iba imeri ya nyirabayazana (maintainer) "
"w’amaform yawe."

msgid "Select available submission handlers"
msgstr "Hitamo ababashinzwe kwakira in'oherezwa baraboneka"

msgid "Wizard previous"
msgstr "Ubuyobozi buheruka"

msgid "wizard previous"
msgstr "ubwambere buribanjirije"

msgid "Wizard next"
msgstr "Wizard ikurikira"

msgid "wizard next"
msgstr "Urukurikirane rw’umuyobozi (wizard) rukurikira"

msgid "Computed settings"
msgstr "Ibyagenwe bihabaruwe"

msgid ""
"This computed element's value will only be available as a token or "
"exported value."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro k’iyi element hashyizweho kizaboneka gusa nk’itokeni "
"cyangwa nk’agaciro koherezwa."

msgid "Computed value/markup"
msgstr "Agaciro/ibirimo (markup) byabaruwe"

msgid ""
"The value will be stored in the database. As a result, it will only be "
"recalculated when the submission is updated. This option is required "
"when accessing the computed element through Views."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro kazabikwa muri databank. Kubera iyo, bizongera kubarwa gusa "
"iyo kohereza (submission) yahinduwe. Iyi niyo ngiro ibanza isabwa "
"mugihe ubonetse ingingo ibarirwa (computed element) ukoresheje Views."

msgid ""
"Provides an item to display computed webform submission values using "
"tokens."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ikintu cyo kwerekana indangagaciro zibarwa zo kohereza urubuga "
"(webform) ukoresheje ibimenyetso (tokens)."

msgid ""
"Provides an item to display computed webform submission values using "
"Twig."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ikintu cyo kwerekana indangagaciro za webform zakozwe "
"hashingiwe n’ibaruramibare ukoresheje Twig."

msgid ""
"Prevent SPAM webform submissions from being submitted without "
"JavaScript enabled using the <a href=\":href_antibot\">antibot</a> "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Kwirinda ko ibitabo by’imitangire ya SPAM byoherezwa ku rubuga "
"utabasha gukora JavaScript ukoresheje uburyo bwa <a "
"href=\":href_antibot\">antibot</a>."

msgid "Default empty option required label"
msgstr ""
"Uburyo busanzwe bw’icyitegererezo cyo kureka ubusa busaba izina "
"ryanditse (label)"

msgid "Default empty option optional label"
msgstr ""
"Ubwoko busanzwe bw’ubusa (nta gihitamo) butuma uhitemba (label "
"y’inyongera)"

msgid "Form prepopulate source entity required"
msgstr ""
"Inkomoko yo kuzuza ifishi (form) mbere igomba kuba ari yo iyihereranye "
"n’iyitegekwa (entity)"

msgid "Form prepopulate source entity type"
msgstr "Ifishi yo kuzuza ubwayo ishingiye ku bwoko bw’urwego rw’isoko"

msgid "Submission user columns"
msgstr "Kohereza abakoresha imitwe y’imirongo"

msgid "Always include private and restricted access elements."
msgstr ""
"Buri gihe shyiramo ibintu bifite uburyo bwo kwinjira bwihariye kandi "
"bugakumirwa (restricted)."

msgid ""
"Below columns are displayed to users who can view previous submissions "
"and/or pending drafts."
msgstr ""
"Amazu akurikira agaragazwa ku bakoresha bashobora kubona ibyoherejwe "
"bisanzwe byabanje gukorwa kandi/ cyangwa inyandiko ngenga zitigeze "
"zijyaho."

msgid "Select settings"
msgstr "Hitamo ibiranga (settings)"

msgid "Default empty option optional"
msgstr "Ihitamo risanzwe ntiryashyizwemo (si ngombwa)"

msgid "The default recipient address for emailed webform results."
msgstr ""
"Aderesi isanzwe igenewe uwakira ku nyandiko zisohoka zavuye muri "
"webform zoherezwa kuri imeri."

msgid ""
"Webform and source entity are automatically detected based on the "
"current page request. You can use the below settings to hardcode the "
"submission limit block's webform and source entity."
msgstr ""
"Urubuga rwa Webform hamwe n’isosiyete y’inkomoko bimenya ubwazo "
"hashingiwe ku ipaji uriho (request) iriho ubu. Ushobora gukoresha "
"ibikurikira kugira ngo ufate mu buryo bukomeye (hardcode) Webform "
"y’ipaki yo kubuza ubwinshi (submission limit) n’isosiyete "
"y’inkomoko."

msgid "An %label id is required."
msgstr "Indangagaciro ya %label irakenewe."

msgid "A valid %label is required."
msgstr "%label yemewe irakenewe."

msgid "Date year range reverse"
msgstr "Itariki—urwego rw’imyaka ugaragaza inyuma (reverse)"

msgid "If checked date year range will be listed from max to min."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatanzwe, urwego rw’imyaka rwatoranyijwe ruzerekanwa kuva ku "
"mwaka w’ikirenga kugera ku uri hasi."

msgid "Time picker input - Use jQuery time picker with custom time format"
msgstr ""
"Icyinjijwe cyo guhitamo igihe - Koresha jQuery time picker ukoresheje "
"uburyo bw’igihe bwateguwe hakurikijwe uko wabuhitamo"

msgid ""
"If character counter is enabled, maxlength will automatically be set "
"to the count maximum."
msgstr ""
"Niba ikibarura cy’imico (character counter) gikoreshejwe, maxlength "
"izashyirwaho byikora ku gipimo ntarengwa cy’iyo mibare."

msgid ""
"@name cannot be longer than %max @type but is currently %length @type "
"long."
msgstr ""
"`@name` ntishobora kurenza %max @type ariko kuri ubu ari %length "
"@type."

msgid "If checked, access controls for included element will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Niba byagenwe, uburenganzira bwo kugenzura (access controls) ku kintu "
"cyashyizwemo buzirengagizwa."

msgid ""
"This webform contains private and/or restricted access elements, which "
"will only be included if the user submitting the form has access to "
"these elements."
msgstr ""
"Iyi webform irimo ibintu byihariye kandi/ cyangwa bigenzurwa, bikaba "
"bizashyirwamo gusa iyo ukoresha uyohereza urupapuro afite "
"uburenganzira bwo kubigeraho."

msgid "Webform handler response tokens."
msgstr ""
"Imisusire y’inyongera (tokens) z’ubusubizo bw’umufatabikorwa wa "
"Webform."

msgid "Empty element message/placeholder"
msgstr "Ubutumwa bwo mu kintu kidafite uduhimbano/umwanya (placeholder)"

msgid "Tidy HTML markup"
msgstr "Isukuye neza insimburangingo za HTML"

msgid "Provides a webform element example."
msgstr "Iha urugero rw’ahashyirwaho (webform) mu buryo bw’iyo ngingo."

msgid "Webform Element Example"
msgstr "Urugero rw’Ikintu (Element) mu Webform"

msgid "Provides an example that shows how to create a Webform element."
msgstr ""
"Igaragaza urugero rwerekana uko wakora ikintu (element) cyo muri "
"Webform."

msgid "Provides an example of a webform submission posted to a remote server."
msgstr ""
"Itanga urugero rwo kohereza (submission) rw’iforumu kuri server "
"remote."

msgid ""
"There are no nodes with webform entity references. Please create add a "
"Webform field to content type."
msgstr ""
"Nta node ifite amahuza y’inyandiko (entity references) ya webform. "
"Nyamuneka ongera iyungururira (field) rya Webform kuri content type."

msgid "There are no webform node references."
msgstr ""
"Nta bifatanywe by’urubuga (webform) biri ku bijyanye n’inyandiko "
"(node references)."

msgid "Provides starter templates that can be used to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Itanga amashusho fatizo (starter templates) ashobora gukoreshwa mu "
"kurema impapuro nshya zo gutanga amakuru (webforms)."

msgid "Advanced HTML markup rendered using a text format."
msgstr ""
"Ishusho y’ibiyigize bya HTML igezweho itangwa hakoreshejwe "
"ukoresheje uburyo bwo kwandika (text format)."

msgid ""
"Requires understanding <a href=\":href\">how to build tables using "
"render arrays</a>."
msgstr ""
"Bikeneye kumenya <a href=\":href\">uko wabaka ameza ukoresheje render "
"arrays</a>."

msgid "Secure value (changeable via server-side code and tokens)."
msgstr ""
"Agaciro kizewe (gashobora guhindurwa hakoreshejwe kode ku ruhande rwa "
"seriveri n’amatokeni)."

msgid "Allows value to be computed using [tokens]."
msgstr "Byemerera agaciro kubarwa hifashishijwe [tokens]."

msgid "Basic HTML markup."
msgstr "Ubuhanga bworoshye bwo kwandika HTML."

msgid ""
"If checked, dismissible promotion messages that appear when the "
"Webform module is updated will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranyijwe, ubutumwa bwo kwamamaza bushobora kwirukanwa "
"buboneka iyo module ya Webform ivugururwa buzahagarikwa."

msgid ""
"Note: Promotions are only visible to users who can <em>administer "
"modules</em>."
msgstr ""
"Icyitonderwa: Ibyamamaza bigaragara gusa ku bakoresha bemerewe "
"<em>gucunga modules</em>."

msgid ""
"If checked, &lt;p&gt; tags, which can add top and bottom margins, will "
"be removed from all single line HTML markup."
msgstr ""
"Niba bibohowe, tagi &lt;p&gt; , zishobora gukuraho/kwongerera imipaka "
"yo hejuru n’iyo hasi (top na bottom margins), zizahanagurwa mu byo "
"kwandika byose bya HTML by’umurongo umwe."

msgid ""
"The admin title will always be displayed when managing elements and "
"viewing & downloading submissions."
msgstr ""
"Umutwe w’umuyobozi (admin title) uzajya werekanwa buri gihe mugihe "
"ugenzura ibintu kandi ureba uko byoherezwe (submissions) ndetse no "
"kubikuramo (download)."

msgid ""
"If an element's title is hidden, the element's admin title will be "
"displayed when viewing a submission."
msgstr ""
"Niba izina ry’iyikintu ryihishe, izina ryaryo ryo muri admin "
"rizagaragara iyo ureba kohereza (submission)."

msgid "Details (opened)"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro (byafunguwe)"

msgid "Details (closed)"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro (byafunzwe)"

msgid "This is a @label value."
msgstr "Iyi ni agaciro ka @label."

msgid "Computed Elements"
msgstr "Ibintu byibarwa"

msgid "These are the terms of service."
msgstr "Aya ni Amasezerano y’Urwego rw’Uko ikoreshwa (Terms of Service)."

msgid ""
"In order to create a link to your terms, wrap the words where you want "
"your link to be in curly brackets."
msgstr ""
"Kugira ngo ukore ihuza ry’amagambo yawe, shyiramo amagambo ushaka ko "
"ihuza ribarirwamo mu mbugi (curly brackets) uhereye imbere."

msgid "Terms of service settings"
msgstr "Amahame agenga serivisi (settings)"

msgid "Provides a terms of service element."
msgstr ""
"Itanga ikintu kigize politiki ngenderwaho ya serivisi (Terms of "
"Service)."

msgid "@form webform remote @type post (@state) to @url failed. @message"
msgstr "@form webform remote @type post (@state) kuri @url byanze. @message"

msgid "Handler instance ID"
msgstr "Indangamuntu ya handler instance"

msgid "Webform example composite"
msgstr "Urugero rwa Webform rufite ibice bihurijwe hamwe"

msgid "Schedule email"
msgstr "Gutegura imeri"

msgid "Trigger/Value"
msgstr "Kureshya/Icyiciro (Trigger/Gukoresha) / Agaciro (Value)"

msgid "Webform settings @label has been saved."
msgstr "Amahugurwa ya Webform @label amaze kubikwa."

msgid ""
"Form is being posted using a custom method. Confirmation page must be "
"handled by the <a href=\":href\">custom form action</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi irioherezwa hakoreshejwe uburyo bwihariye. Utabogamye "
"(confirmation) page igomba kuyoborwa na <a href=\":href\">custom form "
"action</a>."

msgid ""
"Saving of submissions is disabled, submission settings, submission "
"limits, purging and the saving of drafts is disabled. Submissions must "
"be sent via an email or handled using a <a href=\":href\">custom "
"webform handler</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kubika ibohereza byahagaritswe; iboneza ryohereza, imipaka ntarengwa "
"y’iboherezwa, kubisiba (purging) n’ububiko bw’inyandiko ngufi "
"(drafts) nabyo byahagaritswe. Ibohererezwa bigomba koherezwa mu imeri "
"cyangwa bigakoreshwa hifashishijwe <a href=\":href\">umuyobozi "
"wihariye wa webform</a>."

msgid "Required message"
msgstr "Ubutumwa bukenewe"

msgid ""
"Specifies the legal number intervals. Leave blank to support any "
"number interval. Decimals are supported."
msgstr ""
"Igaragaza urwego rw’amasaha yemewe (intervals). Ukoresheje ubusa, "
"ushobora gushyigikira interval iyo ari yo yose. Amahibare (decimals) "
"aremewe."

msgid ""
"You can set sub-element properties using a double underscore between "
"the sub-element's key and sub-element's property "
"(subelement__property). For example, you can add custom attributes or "
"states (conditional logic) to the title sub-element using "
"'title__attributes' and 'title__states'."
msgstr ""
"Ushobora gushyiraho imiterere y’utundi tuntu (sub-element) "
"ukoresheje inyuguti ebyiri zihuza (double underscore) hagati "
"y’urufunguzo rwa sub-element n’imiterere yayo "
"(subelement__property) . Kurugero, ushobora kongeramo indanga (custom "
"attributes) cyangwa uko byiyitwara (states/logic y’uko bihinduka "
"kubera ibintu bibaye—conditional logic) ku tuntu twa “title” "
"ukoresheje “title__attributes” na “title__states”."

msgid ""
"Elements that collect multiple option values include multi-select, "
"checkboxes, and toggles."
msgstr ""
"Ibintu byegeranya indangagaciro nyinshi zirimo guhitamo byinshi "
"(multi-select), agasanduku k’itike (checkboxes), n’buto bwo "
"guhindura ukoresheje toggle."

msgid "Limit settings"
msgstr "Imipangire ntarengwa"

msgid ""
"Descriptions, which are only applicable to radios and checkboxes, can "
"be delimited using ' -- '."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro bifite akamaro gusa kuri radio na checkbox, bishobora "
"gutandukanywa bikoresheje “ -- ”."

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Installed)"
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Byashyizweho)"

msgid ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."

msgid "<a href=\":href\">Disable CDN warning</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":href\">Kuzimya imenyesha rya CDN</a>"

msgid ""
"@total libraries (@installed installed; @excluded excluded; @missing "
"CDN)"
msgstr ""
"@total ingurube (@installed zatanzwe; @excluded zahanzwe; @missing zo "
"kuri CDN zirabuze)"

msgid "Drupal Association"
msgstr "Umuryango wa Drupal"

msgid ""
"The below requirements are checked by the <a href=\":href\">Status "
"report</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ibyasabwa bikurikira bigenzurwa na <a href=\":href\">Raporo "
"y’imiterere</a>."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, all warnings about Webform SPAM protection will be "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Niba bidahagaritswe, ibyihutisho byose bijyanye no kwirinda Webform "
"SPAM bizahagarikwa."

msgid "Check that all entered values for this element are unique."
msgstr ""
"Emeza ko indangagaciro zose wateye muri iki kintu ari indangagaciro "
"zitandukanye (zitabana)."

msgid ""
"Check that entered values for this element is unique for the current "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Egenzura ko indangagaciro wateye kuri iki kintu ziba zidasubiranywa ku "
"isomo ryohererwa ririho."

msgid "Time step"
msgstr "Igihe cy’intambwe"

