msgid "Contact URL"
msgstr "Aderesi ya URL yo Kwiyandikisha"

msgid "Webforms: Submissions log"
msgstr "**Imbaduko z’udufishi (Webforms): Icyandikiro cy’itangwa**"

msgid "Default wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "Amazina asanzwe yo kwemeza wizard"

msgid "Default more title"
msgstr "Umutwe wihishe usanzwe w’inyongera"

msgid "Default section title tag"
msgstr "Amazina y’icyiciro asanzwe (default) tag"

msgid "Wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "**Amazina yo kwemeza (wizard)**"

msgid "Track wizard progress in the URL"
msgstr "Kurikirana uko wizard igeza imbere mu URL"

msgid "Schedule emails for all existing submissions"
msgstr "Rungika ubutumwa kuri email zose zisanzwe zihari"

msgid "Webforms: Templates"
msgstr "Amasanduku y’ubutumire (Webforms): Inyandiko-ziteguye (Templates)"

msgid "Emailing & handling submissions"
msgstr "**Kohereza ubutumwa kuri imeri no kwakira ibinyamakuru byoherejwe**"

msgid "Collecting webform submissions"
msgstr "Guteranya ibisubizo byoherejwe muri webform"

msgid "Understanding a webform submission"
msgstr "Kumvamahwa itangwa ry’urubuga (webform)"

msgid "Attaching webforms to nodes"
msgstr "Kuzamathiriza (attach) amafishi y’urubuga ku byanditswe (nodes)"

msgid "Placing webforms as blocks"
msgstr "Gushyira webform nka blokisi"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Templates</strong> page lists reusable templates that can "
"be duplicated and customized to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Templates</strong> rwerekana amashabeli ashobora "
"gukoreshwa yongeye agahindurwa kugira ngo hagireho ibindi "
"byiyandikishirwaho (webforms) bishya."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Forms configuration</strong> page allows administrators to "
"manage form settings, behaviors, labels, messages and CSS classes."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Imbonerahamwe y’imiterere</strong> rutuma "
"abayobozi bashobora gucunga igenamiterere ry’inyandiko (form), "
"imyitwarire yayo, amazina (labels), ubutumwa, n’amaclass ya CSS."

msgid "Configuration: Elements"
msgstr "Iboneza: Ibice"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable element types and manage element specific settings, "
"properties, behaviors and formatting."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Ibikorwa by’igenamiterere (Elements "
"configuration)</strong> rwemerera abayobozi gushyiraho ku buryo "
"ibintu/element zishobora kugerwaho cyangwa guhagarikwa, ndetse no "
"gucunga ibigenamiterere byihariye by’element, imiterere yabyo, "
"imyitwarire yazo, n’uko byandikwa."

msgid "Configuration: Options"
msgstr "Iboneza: Amahitamo"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Options configuration</strong> page lists reusable "
"predefined options/values available for select menus, radio buttons, "
"checkboxes and Likert elements."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Iboneza ry’Amahitamo</strong> rwerekana "
"amahitamo/indangagaciro bisubirwamo bishobora gukoreshwa bihari ku "
"mbonerahamwe zitoranyirizwamo (select menus), buto za radio, "
"agasanduku ko kwemeza (checkboxes) n’ibice bya Likert."

msgid "Configuration: Submissions"
msgstr "Iboneza: Ibigaragara byoherejwe"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to manage submissions settings, behaviors and messages."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Imbonezamasarwa y’itangwa</strong> rutuma "
"abayobozi bashobora gucunga ibihumuriza bijyanye n’itangwa, ingeso "
"z’itangwa n’utumwa."

msgid "Configuration: Handlers"
msgstr "Iboneza: Abakoresha ubufasha (handlers)"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handlers configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable handlers and configure default email settings and "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Uboneza bw’abakoresha (Handlers)</strong> "
"rutuma abayobozi bashobora gukora/kwemerera guhagarika abakoresha no "
"gutunganya iboneza ry’uburyo ibaruwa zoherezwa risanzwe (default) "
"n’ubutumwa."

msgid ""
"<strong>Handlers</strong> are used to route submitted data to external "
"applications and send notifications & confirmations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Abacunga</strong> bikoreshwa kuyobora amakuru boherereje ajya "
"mu zindi porogaramu zo hanze no kohereza imenyesha n’ibisubizo byo "
"kwemeza."

msgid "Configuration: Exporters"
msgstr "Iboneza: Abatumiza ibintu hanze"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporters configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable exporters and configure default "
"export settings."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Iboneza ry’abatumaho (Exporters)</strong> "
"rutuma abayobozi bashobora gukora/ guhagarika abatumaho no gutunganya "
"imiterere isanzwe y’ohereza (export)."

msgid ""
"<strong>Exporters</strong> are used to export results into a "
"downloadable format that can be used by MS Excel, Google Sheets and "
"other spreadsheet applications."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Abohereza hanze</strong> bikoreshwa mu kohereza ibisubizo mu "
"buryo bushobora gukururwa (download) kandi bukakoreshwa na MS Excel, "
"Google Sheets n’izindi porogaramu z’imbonerahamwe (spreadsheet)."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries"
msgstr "Iboneza: Ubitapo (Libraries)"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Libraries configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable libraries and define global custom "
"CSS/JavaScript used by all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Iboneza bya Libraries</strong> rutuma abayobozi "
"bashobora gukora/ guhagarika libraries no gusobanura CSS/JavaScript "
"yihariye ikoreshwa ku mbuga zose za webforms."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries: Help"
msgstr "Iboneza: Ibikoresho (Libraries): Ubufasha"

msgid "Configuration: Advanced"
msgstr "Iboneza: Izo kurwego rw’Ubuhanga"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Advanced configuration</strong> page allows an "
"administrator to enable/disable UI behaviors, manage requirements and "
"define data used for testing webforms."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Imbonezamubano yisumbuye</strong> rwemerera "
"umuyobozi gukora mu buryo bwo kwinjiza/kurandura imyitwarire ya UI, "
"gucunga ibisabwa no gusobanura amakuru bikoreshwa mu kwipimisha "
"webforms."

msgid "Configuration: Translate"
msgstr "Iboneza: Erekana ibisobanuro birahindurwa"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate configuration</strong> page allows webform "
"messages and labels to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Guhindura uko bigenewe</strong> rworohereza "
"guhindura ubutumwa bw’urubuga (webform) n’ibirango (labels) mu "
"ndimi nyinshi."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Element plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform element plugins."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’incantego ngenderwaho rwa <strong>plugins "
"z’Ibintu</strong> rwerekana urutonde rwose rw’ama plugins "
"y’ibintu by’urubuga (webform) aboneka."

msgid ""
"<strong>Webform Element</strong> plugins are used to enhance existing "
"render/form elements. Webform element plugins provide default "
"properties, data normalization, custom validation, element "
"configuration form and customizable display formats."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Imiyoboro (Webform) Y’igikoresho</strong> ikoreshwa mu "
"kuzamura ibintu bihari bisohoka/iforoma. Ibyiciro by’imiyoboro ya "
"webform bitanga indangagaciro zisanzwe, gupima no guhuza "
"(normalization) amakuru, igenzura rihariye ryo kwemeza ibisohoka, "
"ifishi yo kugena imiterere y’igikoresho, ndetse n’imiterere yo "
"kwerekana ishobora guhindurwa."

msgid "Plugins: Emails/Handlers"
msgstr "Amaplugins: Imeri/Abakoresha ibyabikorwa (Handlers)"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handler plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform handler plugins."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’incamake rwa <strong>inyuguti z’imicungire</strong> "
"(Handler plugins) rwerekana urutonde rwose rw’inyuguti zose "
"z’imicungire za webform ziboneka."

msgid "Plugins: Exporters"
msgstr "Amacomeka (Plugins): Abohereza hanze (Exporters)"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporter plugins</strong> overview page lists all "
"available results exporter plugins."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’ihuriro rusange rw’<strong>abashoramari b’ohereza "
"(Exporter plugins)</strong> rwerekana ibisubizo byose biboneka "
"by’abashoramari b’ohereza."

msgid ""
"The (View) <strong>Source</strong> page allows developers to edit a "
"webform's render array using YAML markup."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa (View) <strong>Source</strong> rutuma abatekinisiye ba "
"porogaramu (developers) bahindura “render array” y’urubuga "
"rw’ifishi (webform) bakoresheje imiterere ya YAML."

msgid ""
"Developers can use the (View) <strong>Source</strong> page to alter a "
"webform's labels quickly, cut-n-paste multiple elements, reorder "
"elements, as well as  add custom properties and markup to elements."
msgstr ""
"Abatekinisiye barashobora gukoresha urupapuro rwa (Reba) "
"<strong>Source</strong> kugira ngo bahindure amazina y’urubuga "
"(webform) vuba, bakore gukoporora/kwimura (cut-n-paste) ibice byinshi "
"icyarimwe, bongere uburyo bwo kongera ibice (reorder), ndetse "
"banongeremo ibyihariye (custom properties) n’ibice bya markup ku "
"bice."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Test</strong> form allows a webform to be tested using a "
"customizable test dataset."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi ya <strong>Test</strong> ituma urubuga (webform) rushobozwa "
"gupimwa hifashishijwe seti y’amakuru y’ikizamini ishobora "
"guhindurwa."

msgid ""
"The <strong>API</strong> form allows developers to test a webform's "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi ya <strong>API</strong> ituma abitezimbere bagerageza API ya "
"webform."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate</strong> page allows a webform's configuration "
"and elements to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Translate</strong> rutuma uko webform igirwamo "
"iboneza n’ibice byayo bishobora guhindurirwa mu ndimi nyinshi."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements</strong>  page allows users to add, update, "
"duplicate and delete elements and wizard pages."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Elements</strong> rufasha abakoresha kongera, "
"kuvugurura, kugurura (duplicate) no gusiba elements na wizard pages."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Emails/Handlers</strong> page allows additional actions "
"and behaviors to be processed when a webform or submission is created, "
"updated, or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Imeli/Imiyoboro (Handlers)</strong> rutuma "
"hakorwa ibikorwa n’imyitwarire by’inyongera bigakorwa iyo webform "
"cyangwa submission byaremwe, byavugururwa, cyangwa byahanaguwe."

msgid "Settings: General"
msgstr "Igenamiterere: Rusange"

msgid ""
"The <strong>General</strong> settings page allows a webform's "
"administrative information, paths, behaviors and third-party settings "
"to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’**Igenamiterere rusange** rukoreshwa mu guhindura "
"amakuru y’ubuyobozi bwa webform, inzira (paths), imyitwarire "
"(behaviors), n’ibindi byagenwe n’abatavuga rumwe (third-party "
"settings)."

msgid "Settings: Form"
msgstr "Igenamiterere: Ifishi"

msgid "Settings: Submissions"
msgstr "Igenamiterere: Ibyoherejwe"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> settings page allows a submission's "
"labels, behaviors, limits and draft settings to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’<strong>Igenamiterere rya Ibyoherezwa "
"(Submissions)</strong> rutuma bishoboka guhindura amazina (labels), "
"imyitwarire (behaviors), imbibi (limits), n’igenamiterere "
"ry’inyandiko igiteganyirijwe (draft) by’iyo wohereje."

msgid "Settings: Confirmation"
msgstr "Amahame: Kwemeza"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Confirmation</strong> settings page allows the submission "
"confirmation type, message and URL to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’**Igenzura ryemejwe** rufasha guhindura ubwoko bwo "
"kwemeza ko bwaroherejwe, ubutumwa, n’URL."

msgid "Settings: Assets"
msgstr "Igenamiterere: Ibikoresho (Assets)"

msgid ""
"The <strong>CSS/JS</strong> settings page allows site builders to "
"attach custom CSS and JavaScript to a webform."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rw’igenamiterere rya <strong>CSS/JS</strong> rutuma "
"abashiraho urubuga bashyiraho CSS na JavaScript byihariye kuri "
"webform."

msgid "Settings: Access"
msgstr "Igenamiterere: Uburenganzira bwo kugera"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> page lists all incoming submissions "
"for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Indangagaciro Ziturutse</strong> rwerekana ibyo "
"kwakiriye byose biva ku mbuga z’imenyekanisha (webforms)."

msgid "Submissions: Log"
msgstr "Ibyoherezwa: Icyabitsweho"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions log</strong> page tracks all submission events "
"for all webforms that have submission logging enabled. Submission "
"logging can be enabled globally or on a per webform basis."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Imiti y’uko ibiyoborwa byandikiwe (Submission "
"log)</strong> rukurikirana ibyabaye byose by’iyandikwa (submission) "
"kuri formulaire zose zo kuri urubuga (webforms) zifite uburyo bwo "
"kwandikisha iyandikwa bwahujwe. Kwemeza/kubushoboza iyandikwa "
"(submission logging) bishobora gutunganurwa ku rwego rwa yose cyangwa "
"bikabonerwa ku buryo bwa formulaire imwe imwe."

msgid "Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Ibyavuyeho: Indahiro zoherejwe"

msgid "Results: Log"
msgstr "Ibisubizo: Ibyavuyeho"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Results Log</strong> lists all webform submission events "
"for the current webform."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Inyandiko y’Inyandikwa ry’Indangagaciro</strong> igaragaza "
"ibyabaye byose by’uko ababizanye bashyize ibikubiyemo muri webform "
"kuri iyi webform iriho."

msgid "Results: Download"
msgstr "Ibisubizo: Kuramo"

msgid "Submission: View"
msgstr "Iyoherezwa: Reba"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Data (YAML)</strong> page displays a submission's raw data "
"as YAML."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Data (YAML)</strong> rwerekana amakuru mbisi "
"y’iyoherezwa nka YAML."

msgid "Submission: Log"
msgstr "Icyoherezwa: Uko byandikiwe"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Log</strong> page shows all events and transactions for a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Log</strong> rwerekana ibintu byose byabaye "
"n’ubwohererezanya (transactions) bijyanye n’ukoherereza rikozwe."

msgid "Submission: Edit"
msgstr "Iyandikwa: Shiraho / Hindura"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit</strong> form allows the administrator to update a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi ya <strong>Edit</strong> ituma umuyobozi ashobora kuvugurura "
"itangwa (submission)."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit all</strong> form allows administrator to update all "
"values for submission create from a multi-step form."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi ya <strong>Guhindura byose</strong> iha abashinzwe kuyobora "
"ubuyobozi (administrator) uburyo bwo kuvugurura indangagaciro zose "
"zifashishwa mu iyoherezwa ryakozwe bishingiye ku ifishi y’ingingo "
"nyinshi (multi-step form)."

msgid "Submission: Resend"
msgstr "Icyoherezwa: Ohereza ubundi bushya"

msgid "Submission: Notes"
msgstr "Icyifuzo: Inyandiko"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Notes</strong> form allows administrator to flag and "
"annotate a submission."
msgstr ""
"Ifishi ya <strong>Ibyitonderwa</strong> ifasha umuyobozi kuyitangariza "
"no kuyisobanurira (ukayishyiraho ibimenyetso n’ibitekerezo)."

msgid "Devel: Export"
msgstr "Devel: Kohereza hanze"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Schema</strong> page displays an overview of a webform's "
"elements and specified data types, which can be used to map webform "
"submissions to an external API."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Schema</strong> rwerekana incamake y’ibigize "
"webform hamwe n’uturango tw’imyaka y’amakuru byavuzwe, bishobora "
"gukoreshwa mu gufatanisha (map) ibisohoka byoherejwe kuri webform "
"n’API yo hanze."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Node</strong> allows webforms to be fully integrated "
"into a website as nodes."
msgstr ""
"A <strong>Webform Node</strong> ituma imbuga z’ubusaba (webforms) "
"zihuzwa neza n’urubuga nk’uko ari nodes."

msgid "Webform Node: References"
msgstr "**Webform Node: Indangagaciro**"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Reference</strong> pages displays an overview of a "
"webform's references and allows you to quickly create new references "
"(a.k.a Webform nodes)."
msgstr ""
"Imipapuro ya <strong>Reference</strong> igaragaza incamake "
"y’ibirebeka (references) bya webform kandi ikaguha uburyo bwo kurema "
"vuba ibindi birebeka bishya (ari byo bisanzwe bita Webform nodes)."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Webform Icyiciro: Ibisubizo: Ibyoherezwe"

msgid "Submissions can be reviewed, updated, flagged and annotated."
msgstr ""
"Ibyoherezwa bishobora gusuzumwa, kuvugururwa, gushyirwaho ibimenyetso, "
"no kunganirizwa ibisobanuro."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Log"
msgstr "Icyiciro cya Webform: Ibisubizo: Inyandiko"

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Download"
msgstr "Urubuga rwa Webform: Ibyavuye: Kuramo"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Download</strong> page allows a webform node's submissions "
"to be exported into a customizable CSV (Comma Separated Values) file "
"and other common data formats."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Download</strong> rutuma ibyoherezwa "
"(submissions) bya node ya webform byoherezwa mu dosiye ya CSV ishobora "
"guhindurwa (Comma Separated Values) n’abandi buryo bumenyerewe bwo "
"gusohora amakuru."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Block</strong> allows a webform to be placed "
"anywhere on a website."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Agasanduku ka Webform</strong> kemerera webform gushyirwa "
"ahantu hose ku rubuga."

msgid "Message: Webform UI Disabled"
msgstr "Ubutumwa: Imigaragarire ya Webform Irahagaritswe"

msgid ""
"Please enable the <strong>Webform UI</strong> module if you would like "
"to add easily add and manage elements using a drag-n-drop user "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka ushoboze module ya <strong>Webform UI</strong> niba ushaka "
"kongeramo byoroshye kandi ugacunge ibice ukoresheje interineti "
"y’ubukoresha ibasha gukurura no guta (drag-n-drop)."

msgid "Star/flag the status of this submission"
msgstr "Shyira inyenyeri/ikimenyetso ku miterere y’iyi nyandiko."

msgid ""
"Inline (reloads the current page and replaces the webform with the "
"confirmation message)"
msgstr ""
"Byihuse (ongera ufashe urupapuro ruriho kandi usimbuze webform "
"ubutumwa bwo kwemeza)"

msgid ""
"Modal (reloads the current page/form and displays the confirmation "
"message in a modal dialog)"
msgstr ""
"Modal (isubiramo ipaji/ifishi iriho kandi igaragaze ubutumwa bwo "
"kwemeza mu idirishya rya modal)"

msgid ""
"If checked, users will not be allowed to navigate back to the form "
"using the browser's back button."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, abakoresha bazahagarirwa kugenda basubira kuri fomu "
"babinyujije buto “back” yo muri mushakisha."

msgid "Track wizard progress in the URL by"
msgstr "Kurikirana uko inzira ya wizard ihagaze muri URL ukoresheje"

msgid "Page name (?page=contact)"
msgstr "Izina ry’urupapuro (?page=contact)"

msgid "Page index (?page=2)"
msgstr "Urutonde rw’impapuro (??page=2)"

msgid ""
"Properties do not have to prepended with a hash (#) character, the "
"hash character will be automatically added to the custom properties."
msgstr ""
"Ibintu (properties) ntibihagaze bisabwa gutangizwa n’ikimenyetso "
"c’akakoma (hash) (#); ikimenyetso # kizongerwa kinyuranye ku buryo "
"bwikora ku miterere (custom properties)."

msgid ""
"If saving of submissions is disabled, submission settings, submission "
"limits, purging and the saving of drafts will be disabled. Submissions "
"must be sent via an email or processed using a custom <a "
"href=\":href\">webform handler</a>."
msgstr ""
"Niba kubika ibikurikizwa byahagaritswe, iboneza by’ishyikirizwa, "
"imipaka y’ishyikirizwa, isukura (purging), n’ukubika imyandiko "
"y’akarorero (drafts) bizahagarikwa. Ibisabwa/ibyoherejwe bigomba "
"koherezwa hakoreshejwe imeri (email) cyangwa bikatunganywa "
"hifashishijwe <a href=\":href\">umuyobozi wa webform</a> w’igenzele "
"(custom)."

msgid "Convert anonymous user drafts and submissions to authenticated user"
msgstr ""
"Hindura ibitekerezo by’abakoresha bataramenyekana (anonymous) hamwe "
"n’ubusabe bwoherejwe bikabonerwa n’uwakoresha wiyandikishije "
"(authentifié)"

msgid ""
"If checked users will be able to update a submission using the "
"webform's URL appended with the submission's (secure) token."
msgstr ""
"Niba byagenzuwe, abakoresha bazemererwa kuvugurura iyoherezwa "
"hakoreshejwe URL ya webform iherekejwe n’iyo tokeni (ikurikiranwa "
"neza) yo kuri iryo yoherezwa."

msgid ""
"Only webforms that are open to new submissions can be updated using "
"the secure token."
msgstr ""
"Ni gusa urubuga rw’abakoresha (webforms) rufunguye kwakira ubusabe "
"bushya rishobora kuvugururwa hakoreshejwe itokeni yizewe."

msgid "All submission event are being logged for all webforms"
msgstr ""
"Amabwiriza yose yo gutanga arandikwa (logging) kuri buri fomu yo "
"gutangirwaho (webform)."

msgid ""
"Submissions accessed using the (secure) token will by-pass all webform "
"submission access rules."
msgstr ""
"Ukohererezwa amakuru hifashishijwe “token” (irinda) bizirengagiza "
"amategeko yose yo kwinjira mu kohereza ibibanza (webform)."

msgid ""
"Limit the number of submissions per user. A user is identified by "
"their user id if logged-in, or by their Cookie if anonymous."
msgstr ""
"Shyira imipaka ku bwinshi bw’ubusabe buri ukoresha. Ukoresha "
"amenyekanira kuri uyu ukoresha n’umwirondoro (user id) iyo yinjiye, "
"cyangwa kuri Cookie niba ari umukoresha utinjiye."

msgid "Above test data is keyed by element #type."
msgstr ""
"Ibyo byigeragezwa byavuzwe haruguru bishingiye ku gice "
"cy’ikimenyetso #type."

msgid ""
"Batch email size is used by any handler that sends out bulk emails. "
"This include the scheduled email handler."
msgstr ""
"Ingano ya batch y’imeri ikoreshwa n’uhandlere wesehereza ubutumwa "
"bwinshi. Ibi birimo na ihandlere y’imeri yateguwe."

msgid ""
"Allowed tags are applied to any element property that may contain HTML "
"markup. Element properties which can contain HTML markup include "
"#title, #description, #field_prefix, and #field_suffix."
msgstr ""
"Atagi zemewe zikoreshwa ku kintu cyose bifasha ku mpande z’inyandiko "
"zishobora kuba zirimo HTML. Ibiranga by’ikintu bishobora kuba birimo "
"HTML birimo #title, #description, #field_prefix, na #field_suffix."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the first default option for a required select "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Izina rigomba kwerekanwa ku buryo bwo kubanza bw’itondanga rya mbere "
"ryahisemo bisabwa (required) mu menu."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the first default option for an optional select "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Icyo icyitwa cyo kwerekana ku ihitamo rya mbere risanzwe mu "
"mbonerahamwe y’ihitamo (select) rihari ryihitamo ry’ubushake."

msgid ""
"Redirect anonymous users to login when attempting to access private "
"file uploads"
msgstr ""
"Ohereza abakoresha badakiniwe (anonymous) kwinjira (login) iyo "
"bagerageje kugera ku byohererezwa by’amadosiye bifite uburenganzira "
"bugenewe abayemerewe (private file uploads)."

msgid ""
"If checked, anonymous users will be redirected to the user login page "
"when attempting to access private file uploads."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, abakoresha batamenyekanye bazoherezwa ku rupapuro "
"rwo kwinjira mu buryo bw’umukoresha igihe bazagerageje kugera ku "
"bikoresho by’amadosiye byihariye byoherezwa."

msgid "Display collapse/expand all details link on all webforms"
msgstr ""
"Garagaza ihuza ryo kwagura/guhisha ibisobanuro byose ku zindi za "
"webform zose"

msgid ""
"If checked, an expand/collapse all details link will be added to all "
"webforms which contain two or more details elements."
msgstr ""
"Niba byagenwe, hazongerwaho ihuza ryo kwagura/kwikururiza ibisobanuro "
"byose kuri buri webform ifite ibintu bibiri cyangwa birenzeho by’ "
"ibisobanuro."

msgid ""
"The default email address that a recipient will see when they are "
"replying to an email. Leave blank to automatically use the 'From "
"email' address. Setting the 'Reply-to' to the 'From email' prevent "
"emails from being flagged as spam."
msgstr ""
"Aderesi ya imeri isanzwe umwakira azabona igihe asubiza ubutumwa "
"imeri. Fata ubusa kugirango ikoreshwe ubudahindutse aderesi ya «From "
"email» (Aboherereje). Gushyiraho «Reply-to» kuri «From email» "
"byirinda imeri kwifuzwa nk’iyanduye (spam)."

msgid ""
"The default email address to which bounce messages are delivered. "
"Leave blank to automatically use the 'From email' address."
msgstr ""
"Aderesi ya imeli ihambirwa ibinyuranye byoherezwa (bounce messages). "
"Siga ubusa kugirango ukoreshe uko bishakiye aderesi ya “From "
"email”."

msgid ""
"The default sender name which is used along with the default sender "
"email address."
msgstr ""
"Izina ryoherejywe risanzwe rikoreshwa hamwe n’imerero (email) "
"risanzwe ry’usohoye."

msgid ""
"Enter the amount of submissions to be purged during single cron run. "
"You may want to lower this number if you are facing memory or timeout "
"issues when purging via cron."
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo ingano y’ibyoherezwa (submissions) bigomba gusibwa mu gihe "
"kimwe cyo gukora cron. Ushobora kugabanya iyi mibare niba uhura "
"n’ibibazo by’uko hari kwibuka (memory) nke cyangwa igihe cyo "
"kugera ku iherezo (timeout) iyo usiba ukoresheje cron."

msgid "Multiple settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere byinshi"

msgid ""
"If checked, the composite sub-element titles will be displayed as the "
"table header labels."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoranijwe, imitwe y’utunegukuru dushyizwe hamwe (composite "
"sub-element) izerekanwa nk’amazina y’imitwe y’ameza (table "
"header labels)."

msgid ""
"This is used as the table header for this webform element when "
"displaying multiple values."
msgstr ""
"Ibi bikoreshwa nk’umutwe w’ameza (table header) y’iki kintu "
"cy’ifishi y’urubuga (webform) iyo hubahirizwa indangagaciro "
"nyinshi."

msgid "Number of empty items"
msgstr "Umubare w’ibintu bidafite aho bihuriye (bidafite agaciro)"

msgid "Number of add more items"
msgstr "Umubare w’ibindi byongera amahitamo"

msgid "If unchecked, the elements will no longer be sortable."
msgstr ""
"Niba itashyizweho, ibintu ntibizongera gutondekwa mu buryo bushobora "
"guhindurwa."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the add/remove (+/x) buttons will be removed from each "
"table row."
msgstr ""
"Niba bidashyizweho, buto zo kongeramo/kubakuramo (+/x) zizakurwaho mu "
"murongo wose w’imeza."

msgid "The click-able label used to open and close more text."
msgstr ""
"Icyapa (label) ushobora gukanda kugirango ufungure kandi ufunge andi "
"magambo menshi."

msgid "More text"
msgstr "Andi magambo"

msgid ""
"A long description of the element that provides form additional "
"information which can opened and closed."
msgstr ""
"Ibisobanuro birambuye by’iyo nyandiko ihuza amakuru y’inyongera "
"y’ifishi, ishobora gufungurwa ikongera igafungwa."

msgid ""
"Check that entered values for this element are unique for the current "
"user."
msgstr ""
"Egenzura ko indangagaciro wateye kuri iki kintu ziba zidasubirwamo ku "
"ukoresha uriho."

msgid ""
"If set, this message will be used when an element's value are not "
"unique, instead of the default \"@message\" message."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ubwo ubutumwa buzakoreshwa iyo agaciro k’igice "
"kitaringaniye (bidahuye), mu mwanya w’ubutumwa busanzwe "
"“@message”."

msgid "Item format custom HTML"
