"<a href=\":href\">text formats</a> the @tag must be added to the "
"allowed HTML tags."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Icy’ingenzi:</strong> Kugira ngo ukoreshe amahuza y’ "
"ibiganiro ukoresheje imiterere ya @labels <a "
"href=\":href\">imirongo</a> bisaba ko @tag yongerwaho mu tagi z’HTML "
"zemewe."

msgid ""
"Make this element non-editable with the user entered (e.g. via "
"developer tools) value <strong>ignored</strong>. Useful for displaying "
"default value. Changeable via JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Komeza iyi elementi itazemererwa guhindurwa n’agaciro umukoresha "
"yinjije (nko abifashijwemo n’ ibikoresho by’abateza imbere / "
"developer tools), aho <strong>ntizatabwe</strong>. Biba ingirakamaro "
"mu kwerekana agaciro gasanzwe. Bihindurwamo hakoreshejwe JavaScript."

msgid ""
"Make this element non-editable with the user entered (e.g. via "
"developer tools) value <strong>submitted</strong>. Useful for "
"displaying default value. Changeable via JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Bikorwa ko iki kintu kitabasha guhindurwa n’umukoresha uko yinjije "
"(urugero, ukoresheje developer tools) indangagaciro "
"<strong>submitted</strong>. Bikoreshwa mu kwerekana agaciro gasanzwe. "
"Bihinduka ukoresheje JavaScript."

msgid "Add more button label"
msgstr "Ongeramo izina ry’butoni ry’inyongera"

