msgstr ""
"Amatokeni ajyanye n’uruhare rw’abakoresha bashobora kwakira "
"imeyili. <em>Iri tokeni riboneka gusa kuwakiriye imeyili muri Webform, "
"ku “To”, “CC”, na “BCC” by’abahabwa imeyili.</em>"

msgid "Purge any submissions"
msgstr "Fagaza ibyoherejwe byose"

