msgstr "Kwinjizamo byoherejwe kuri…"

msgid "Filter by submitted to"
msgstr "Sefa ku byoherejweho n’abakoresheje"

msgid ""
"Batch export size is used when submissions are being "
"exported/downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Ingano ya batch export ikoreshwa igihe ibitekerezo birimo gusohoka "
"gukurwa mu buryo bwo gukuramo/downloada."

msgid "Batch update size is used when submissions are being bulk updated."
msgstr ""
"Ingano ya batch ikoreshwa igihe ibihuzwa bigezweho bigahuzwa mu buryo "
"bwinshi (bulk)."

