msgstr ""
"Amalinki yihariye ya dialogi ya webform azongerwaho kuri buri fomu "
"y’imyitozo ya webform."

msgid "Help title"
msgstr "Ifasha umutwe"

msgid "Defaults to the element's title"
msgstr "Bisanzwe bifata umutwe w’iyo elementi (title)."

msgid "Displays a read more hide/show widget below the element's description."
msgstr ""
"Erekana widget yo «Soma byinshi» yo kwerekana/kwihisha hepfo "
"y’ibisobanuro by’iyi elementi."

msgid "More title"
msgstr "Izina ry’inyongera"

msgid ""
"Apply classes to the element's wrapper around both the field and its "
"label. Select 'custom…' to enter custom classes."
msgstr ""
"Shyiramo amasomo (classes) ku gice gikuyeho (wrapper) kiri hagati "
"y’inyandiko y’iyo field n’izina (label). Hitamo “custom…” "
"kugira ngo winjize classes zihenze (custom)."

msgid "Create submission"
msgstr "Kurema iyoherezwa"

msgid "Enter 'name': 'value' pairs…"
msgstr "Kwinjiza ‘izina’: ‘agaciro’ …"

msgid ""
"You should consider using a dedicated Time element, instead of this "
"Date/time element, which will prepend the current date to the "
"submitted time."
msgstr ""
"Ugomba gusuzuma gukoresha `Time` yihariye, mu rwego rwo kudakoresha "
