msgstr ""
"Reka ihindurwe iyerekanwa rihabwa ku mugaragaro rwo kohereza (default "
"submission view)."

msgid "Default submission access denied message"
msgstr "Ubutumwa busanzwe bwo kwanga kwemererwa kohereza bwanzwe"

msgid "Default Algolia application id"
msgstr ""
"Agaciro gasanzwe ka nimero y’ikoranabuhanga ya Algolia (application "
"id)"

msgid "Controls if unused webform submission files should be marked temporary"
msgstr ""
"Igenzura niba dosiye zohererejwe z’idafite ikoreshwa muri webform "
"zigomba gufatwa nk’izo by’agateganyo."

msgid "Immediately deleted temporary managed webform submission files"
msgstr ""
"Byasibye ako kanya dosiye z’agateganyo zoherejweho mu buryo bwo "
"kwiyandikisha (webform) zicunzwe n’ikoranabuhanga ryo kuyicunga"

msgid ""
"Existing submissions that have conditionally hidden elements will have "
