msgstr ""
"Ibirego bisanzwe byabitswe bifite ibintu bihishwa by’agateganyo, "
"bizaba bifite amakuru y’icyo kintu bisibwa igihe ikirego gihindurwa."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Access group</strong> page lists reusable groups used to "
"access webform source entity and users."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Itsinda ry’Ububasha</strong> rwerekana "
"amatsinda yongera gukoreshwa bikoreshwa kugira ngo ubone uburyo bwo "
"kohereza (source) webform n’abakoresha."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Access type</strong> page lists types of groups used to "
"send email notifications to users."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Uburyo bwo kubona (Access type)</strong> "
"rwerekana ubwoko bw’amatsinda akoreshwa mu kohereza ubutumwa bwo "
"kubamenyesha kuri imeri (notifications) ku bakoresha."

msgid "Provides webform access controls for webform nodes."
msgstr "Itanga igenzura ry’icyinjira (access controls) kuri webform node."

msgid "Prevent scheduling past actions"
msgstr "Kubuza gutegura ibikorwa byabaye kera"

msgid "Ignore past:"
msgstr "Irengagize ibyabanje:"

msgid "Save + Add element"
msgstr "Bika + Ongeraho ikintu"

msgid "Webform access controls"
msgstr "Ibigenzura by’uburenganzira bwo kwinjira muri Webform"

msgid "Access Control | Tag1 Consulting"
msgstr "Igenzura ry’Uburenganzira | Tag1 Consulting"

msgid "Opening webforms in modal dialogs"
msgstr "Gufungura amafishi y’urubuga (webforms) muri modal dialogs"

msgid "This screencast shows how to open webforms in modal dialogs."
msgstr ""
"Ubu bujyana-bw’imbonerahamwe (screencast) bwerekana uko "
"wakwifungurira webforms mu buryo bwa modal dialogs."

msgid "Creating a modal in Drupal 8 | Befused"
msgstr "Kurema modal muri Drupal 8 | Befused"

msgid "Display forms in a modal dialog with Drupal 8 | Agaric"
msgstr ""
"Erekana imisuzuma (forms) muri modal dialog ukoresheje Drupal 8 | "
"Agaric"

msgid "Webform views integration"
msgstr "Guhuza kuranga (views) rya Webform"

msgid "D8 Webform and Webform Views Integration @ Drupalcamp Colorado"
msgstr "Kwinjiza Webform na Webform Views muri D8 @ Drupalcamp Colorado"

msgid "RateIt is used to provide a customizable rating element."
msgstr ""
"RateIt ikoreshwa mu gutanga igice cyo kugena amanota gishobora "
"kwihitirwamo."

msgid "more submission views"
msgstr "ibitekerezo byinshi byoherezwa"

msgid ""
"A webform submission embed display. The selected view should also "
"include contextual filters. "
"{webform_id}/{source_entity_type}/{source_entity_id}/{account_id}/{in_draft}"
msgstr ""
"Kwerekana iyoherezwa rya webform. Urugero rwatoranijwe (view) rugomba "
"kandi gushyiramo ama-filter ashingiye ku miterere (contextual "
"filters). "
"{webform_id}/{source_entity_type}/{source_entity_id}/{account_id}/{in_draft}"

msgid ""
"The name to be displayed in the URL when there are multiple submission "
"views available."
msgstr ""
"Amazina yo kwerekwa muri URL iyo hariho uburyo bwinshi bwo gutanga "
"ibisubizo."

msgid ""
"The title to be display in the dropdown menu when there are multiple "
"submission views available."
msgstr ""
"Umutwe ugomba kugaragara mu mbonerahamwe yo hasi (dropdown) iyo hariho "
"uburyo bwinshi bwo gutanga ibisohoka (submission views) butandukanye."

msgid "Replace the global results with submission views"
msgstr ""
"Banje ibisubizo rusange ku byo biva mu bice byo kohereza (submission "
"views)."

msgid "Replace the webform results with submission views"
msgstr ""
"Bihindure ibisubizo by’urubuga (webform) ubisimbuze n’iyerekwa "
"ry’itangwa (submission views)."

msgid "Replace the node results with submission views"
msgstr ""
"Simbuza ibisubizo by’inyandiko n’imbonerahamwe y’itangwa "
"(submission views)"

msgid ""
"Only 'Inline', 'Message', 'Modal', and 'None' confirmation types are "
"fully supported by Ajax."
msgstr ""
"Gusa uburyo bwo kwemeza `'Inline'`, `'Message'`, `'Modal'`, na "
"`'None'` burashyigikirwa neza na Ajax."

msgid "When a user is denied access to this webform"
msgstr "Iyo umukoresha yangiwe kwinjira kuri iri fomu y’urubuga"

msgid "Login (Redirects to user login form and displays message)"
msgstr ""
"Kwinjira (Itohereza kuri fomu yo kwinjira y’umukoresha kandi "
"igaragaze ubutumwa)"

msgid ""
"Will be displayed either in-line or as a status message depending on "
"the setting above."
msgstr ""
"Bizagaragara mu buryo bwo kugaragazwa mu murongo (inline) cyangwa "
"nk’itumanaho ry’uko byagenze (status message) bitewe "
"n’igenamiterere riri hejuru."

msgid "Access denied message attributes"
msgstr "Ikimenyetso cyo kwanga kwinjira (access denied)"

msgid ""
"For example, appending "
"<code>?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1</code> to a "
"webform's URL would set a submission's 'Submitted to' value to "
"'node:1'."
msgstr ""
"Kurugero, gushyiramo "
"<code>?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1</code> kuri URL "
"y’ifishi yohererezwayo (webform) byashyira indangagaciro z’uko "
"kohereza (submission) byashyizweho mu “Submitted to” bikaba "
"“node:1”."

msgid ""
"You can also append "
"<code>?source_entity_type=ENTITY_TYPE&amp;source_entity_id=ENTITY_ID</code> "
"and the <code>ENTITY_TYPE</code> and <code>ENTITY_ID</code> parameters "
"will automatically be replaced based on the current page's source "
"entity."
msgstr ""
"Ushobora kandi kongeramo "
"<code>?source_entity_type=ENTITY_TYPE&amp;source_entity_id=ENTITY_ID</code> "
"kandi ibipimo <code>ENTITY_TYPE</code> na <code>ENTITY_ID</code> "
"bizasimbuzwa mu buryo bwikora hashingiwe ku nzego (source entity) "
"by’ubu ipaji iriho."

msgid "When a user is denied access to a submission"
msgstr "Iyo umukoresha yanzewe uburenganzira bwo gutanga (submission)"

msgid "Page (Displays message when access is denied to a submission)"
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro (Eserura ubutumwa iyo uburenganzira bwanze kugera ku "
"cyohererezwe)"

msgid ""
"To expose your webform elements to your webform submission views. "
"Please install the <a href=\":href\">Webform Views Integration</a> "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Kugirango ibyo ukoresha mu ifishi y’ibisabwa (webform) ubigaragaze "
"mu mpapuro zerekana ibisubizo byayo (webform submission views). "
"Nyamuneka shyiramo modire <a href=\":href\">Webform Views "
"Integration</a>."

msgid "Create new submission view"
msgstr "Kurema rebo nshya yo kohereza ibyatumijwe"

msgid ""
"If checked, help text will be removed from every webform page and "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Niba byahitwe, inyandiko z’ubufasha zizakurwaho ku ipaji zose za "
"webform no kuri buri fomu."

msgid ""
"Files uploaded via the CKEditor file dialog to webform elements, "
"settings, and configuration will not be exportable."
msgstr ""
"Ama dosiye byoherejwe ukoresheje CKEditor muri idirishya ryifishi "
"(file dialog) bijyanye n’ibice bya webform, igenamiterere, na "
"konfiguresiyo ntibizabasha koherezwa (exportable)."

msgid ""
"It is recommended to use the <a href=\":href\">IMCE module</a> to "
"manage webform elements, settings, and configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Birashimwa gukoresha <a href=\":href\">module ya IMCE</a> kugira ngo "
"ucunge ibice bya webform, imiterere, n’amadosiye ya konfiguresiyo."

msgid "Randomize elements"
msgstr "Hindura ibintu ku buryo bwihitagurika"

msgid ""
"Randomizes the order of the sub-element when they are displayed in the "
"webform."
msgstr ""
"Ihindura uko ibintu bimeze mu buryo bw’ubusumbane (utuyunguruzo) iyo "
"bigaragara muri webform."

