msgstr ""
"Menya uko wakwerekana uburyo bwo kohereza amakuru ukoresheje modire "
"yitwa **Webform Node**."

msgid "The %handler email/handler for the %webform webform does not exist."
msgstr "Imeri ya %handler/umufasha ya %webform webform ntabwo ibaho."

msgid ""
"Testing the %webform webform %handler @type. <strong>All other "
"emails/handlers are disabled.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Kugerageza %webform webform %handler ku bwoko @type. <strongAndi "
"mabaruwa/ababayobozi bose birahagaritswe.</strong>"

