msgstr "@title ni @value"

msgid ""
"Creating custom conditional logic (Form API #states) with nested "
"conditions or custom selectors will disable the conditional logic "
"builder. This will require that Form API #states be manually entered."
msgstr ""
"Gushinga imyumvire yihariye ishingiye ku ndangagaciro (Form API "
"#states) hamwe n’ibisabwa bikurikiranye (nested conditions) cyangwa "
"guhitamo (custom selectors) bizazimya uburyo bwo kubaka (conditional "
"logic builder). Ibi bisaba ko Form API #states byandikwa n’intoki."

msgid ""
"The %selector element is used more than once within the %state state. "
"To use multiple values within a trigger try using the pattern trigger."
msgstr ""
"Ihuriro rya %selector rikoreshwa inshuro zirenze imwe muri %state "
"state. Kugira ngo ukoreshe indangagaciro nyinshi mu ihuriro (trigger) "
"gerageza gukoresha uburyo (pattern) wa trigger."

msgid ""
"Scheduled forms do not work as expected for anonymous users when "
"Drupal's <a href=\":page_cache_href\">Internal Page Cache</a> module "
"is enabled. This is a <a href=\":issue_href\">known issue</a>."
msgstr ""
"Amafishi yateguwe (Scheduled) ntabwo akora nk’uko byateganyijwe ku "
"bakoresha badafite konte (anonymous) iyo module ya Drupal yo kuri <a "
"href=\":page_cache_href\">Internal Page Cache</a> ikoreshejwe. Iyi ni "
"<a href=\":issue_href\">ikibazo kizwi</a>."

msgid "Display wrapper attributes"
msgstr "Garagaza indangakintu (attributes) za wrapper"

