"The <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> library is installed by the "
"<b><a href=\":module_href\">@module</a></b> module."
msgstr ""
"Ishakiro rya <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> rishyirwaho na "
"module ya <b><a href=\":module_href\">@module</a></b>."

