"'Date/time' minimum or maximum should not be used with 'Date' or "
"'Time' specific minimum or maximum."
msgstr ""
"«Itariki/igihe» ntibigomba gukoreshwa nka ntarengwa ntarengwa "
"cyangwa ntarengwa ntarengwa hamwe na «Itariki» cyangwa «Igihe» "
"bifite ntarengwa cyangwa ntarengwa byihariye."

