msgstr ""
"@title: Imeri yohererezwa @action na «@handler» igenewe koherezwa ku "
"@date."

msgid "@title: Email unscheduled for '@handler' handler."
msgstr "@title: Imeri ntirashyizwe ku gihe ku bwo '@handler' handler."

msgid "Webform Submission Log"
msgstr "Icyandikogahunda cyo Kwinjiza amakuru mu Webform"

msgid "Dedicated logging and reporting for webform submissions."
msgstr ""
"Ubwoko bwihariye bwo kwandikisha no gutanga raporo ku byoherezwa "
"(submissions) bya webform."

msgid "The element key %name on line @line_number is a reserved key."
msgstr ""
"Urufunguzo rw’elementi %name ruri ku murongo @line_number ni "
"urufunguzo rwabitswe."

msgid ""
"The webform submission log will track more detailed user information "
"including email addresses and subjects."
msgstr ""
"Igikoresho cyanditseho ibyinji byoherejwe muri webform kizakurikirana "
"amakuru arambuye y’abakoresha harimo aderesi z’imeri na "
"insanganyamatsiko."

msgid ""
"Enable the 'Webform Submission Log' module to better track and "
"permanently store submission logs."
msgstr ""
"Fasha gukora module ya “Webform Submission Log” kugirango ishoboze "
"gukurikirana neza no kubika burundu ibiti byoherejwe (submission "
"logs)."

msgid "Required elements defaults to: %required"
msgstr "Ibintu bisabwa bihita byishyirwa kuri: %required"

msgid "Optional elements defaults to: %optional"
msgstr "Ibintu bidahinduka (byihitirwamo) bihabwa indangagaciro: %optional"

msgid "Counter minimum or maximum is required."
msgstr "Inkingi ya minimum cyangwa maximum irakenewe."

msgid ""
"Use x-www-form-urlencoded if unsure, as it is the default format for "
"HTML webforms. You also have the option to post data in <a "
"href=\"http://www.json.org/\">JSON</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Niba utazi neza, koresha **x-www-form-urlencoded**, kuko ari yo ihuza "
"ihanzwe (default) ikoreshwa kuri HTML webforms. Ushobora kandi "
"guhitamo kohereza amakuru mu buryo bwa **<a "
"href=\"http://www.json.org/\">JSON</a>**."

msgid "@label text / description"
msgstr "@label Umutwe / ibisobanuro"

msgid "Select what happens when a user is denied access to this webform."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo icyo bibaho iyo umukoresha yanze kwemererwa uburenganzira kuri "
"iyi webform."

msgid ""
"Go to <a href=\":href\">submission settings</a> to select what happens "
"when a user is denied access to submissions."
msgstr ""
"Jya kuri <a href=\":href\">ibikorwa by’imyandikire</a> kugirango "
"uhitemo ibyo bibaho iyo umukozi asabwe kwinjira agahabwa uburenganzira "
"bwo kwinjira mu byo yohereza."

msgid "Select what happens when a user is denied access to a submission."
msgstr ""
"Hitamo icyo bibaho iyo umukoresha abangirijwe kwinjira mu rundi "
"rwandiko."

msgid ""
"Go to <a href=\":href\">form settings</a> to select what happens when "
"a user is denied access to a webform."
msgstr ""
"Jya kuri <a href=\":href\">ibishushanyo by’ifishi</a> kugira ngo "
"uhitemo icyo bigomba kuba byakozwe iyo umukoresha yangijwe kwinjira "
"muri webform."

msgid "Wrap long lines of text"
msgstr "Hindura imirongo miremire y’inyandiko"

msgid "200 OK"
msgstr "200 Nibyiza"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to enable 'Include files as attachments' for each "
"email handler that you want to send this attachment."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka menya neza ko ushoboza kuri buri email handler ushaka "
"kohereza iyi attachment guhitamo ryitwa “Include files as "
"attachments”."

msgid ""
"Please enter the attachment's file name with a file extension. The "
"file extension will be used to determine the attachment's content "
"(mime) type."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka shyiramo izina rya dosiye ya dosiye yometse, harimo "
"n’inyongera y’izina rya dosiye (file extension). Iyo nyongera "
"izakoreshwa mu kumenya ubwoko bw’ikirimo (mime) cya dosiye yometse."

msgid ""
"Make sure the attachment URL/Path is publicly accessible. The "
"attachment's URL/path will never be displayed to end users."
msgstr ""
"Menya neza ko URL/ inzira by’iyo nyandiko bihurirwa rubanda. Icyo "
"URL/ inzira by’iyo nyandiko ntizigera bigaragazwe ku bakoresha ku "
"mpera zabo."

msgid ""
"Webforms must first be <a href=\":href\">created</a> before "
"referencing them."
msgstr ""
"Amasanduku yifishi (Webforms) agomba kubanza <a "
"href=\":href\">gushyirwaho</a> mbere yo kuyakoresha cyangwa "
"kuyerekezaho."

msgid "Sending webform email attachments"
msgstr "Ohereza dosiye ziri mu imeri za webform"

msgid ""
"This presentation shows how to set up and add email attachments via an "
"email handler."
msgstr ""
"Iri somo ryerekana uko wategura kandi ukongeramo inyandiko "
"(attachments) z’ubutumwa bwo kuri email ukoresheje email handler."

msgid "How to send email attachments? | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Uko wohereza email ufite inyongeramusaruro (attachments)? | Drupal.org"

msgid ""
"Multiple test submissions can be created using the Devel generate "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Ibikorwa byinshi byo gutanga ibisubizo (test submissions) bishobora "
"kuremwa hifashishijwe module ya Devel generate."

msgid "Form access denied settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’ihagarikwa ry’uburenganzira bwo kubona fomu"

msgid "Form preview settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’imbere y’urupapuro (preview)"

msgid "Form custom settings"
msgstr "Ukoresha igenamiterere ryihariye ry’ifishi"

msgid "Form method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kohereza ifishi"

msgid "Form action"
msgstr "Igikorwa cy’ifishi"

msgid "Form custom properties"
msgstr "Imiterere yihariye y’ifishi"

msgid "Submission general settings"
msgstr "Amasomo rusange yo gutanga ibitekerezo"

msgid "Submission user settings"
msgstr "Amahina y’umukoresha wo kohereza ibigishwa"

msgid "Submission access denied settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo guta uburenganzira bwo kwinjira ku iyoherezwa"

msgid "Submission limit settings"
msgstr "Igenzura ry’umubare ntarengwa wo kohereza"

msgid "Submission draft settings"
msgstr "Amahame y’inyandiko y’icyitegererezo (draft) yo kuyishyikiriza"

msgid "Submission autofill settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo kuzuza amakuru ubihuje (autofill)"

msgid "Submission views settings"
msgstr "Amaso yo gutegura (settings) ya submission views"

msgid "Form confirmation settings"
msgstr "Amahame yo kwemeza imiterere y’ifishi"

msgid "Form dialog settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry’idirishya ry’ifishi"

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for a single element value. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"HTML igomba kugaragazwa ku gaciro k’agaciro kamwe (single element "
"value). Ushobora kongeramo HTML cyangwa <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. "
"Ushobora kwinjiza amakuru aturuka ku cyo wohereje (submission) uko "
"bimeze nk’uko byanditswe muri “variables” bikurikira."

msgid ""
"The text to display for a single element value. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Umwandiko wo kwerekana ku gaciro k’iki kintu kimwe. Ushobora "
"gushyiramo <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Ushobora kwinjizamo amakuru "
"uhereye ku cyo wohereje uko bikurikije “variables” zo hasi."

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for multiple element values. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"HTML igomba kugaragazwa ku ndangagaciro nyinshi z’element. Ushobora "
"gushyiramo HTML cyangwa <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Ushobora kwinjiza "
"amakuru atanzwe muri submission uko byakurikizwa nko mu "
"“variables” biri hasi."

msgid ""
"The text to display for multiple element values. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Umugani w’inyandiko igomba kwerekanyirizwa indangagaciro nyinshi "
"z’uturango. Ushobora gushyiramo <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Ushobora "
"kwinjizamo amakuru uhereye ku byo byoherejwe ukurikije “variables” "
"bikurikira."

msgid ""
"Editing webform source code allows users to alter and possibly break a "
"webform's render array."
msgstr ""
"Guhindura kode y’isoko rya webform bituma abakoresha babasha "
"guhindura kandi birashoboka ko bagatuma urudodo rwa (render array) rwa "
"webform ruba rwangiritse."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Upload</strong> page allows a CSV (comma separated values) "
"file or URL to be uploaded, converted, and imported into webform "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"Urupapuro rwa <strong>Gushyiramo</strong> rutuma urekera dosiye ya CSV "
"(amakuru atandukanijwe n’akamenyetso k’akawanditse “comma”) "
"cyangwa URL, bikoherezwa, bigahindurirwa (zikavanwamo) bikazinjizwa mu "
"bisohoka by’ibisabwa (webform submissions)."

msgid "Provides the ability to export and import submissions."
msgstr "Iha ubushobozi bwo kohereza no kongera gutumiza ibisubizo."

msgid "Unable to locate source entity (@entity_type:@entity_id)"
msgstr ""
"Ntibishoboka kubona ikigo ntangarugero fatizo "
"(@entity_type:@entity_id)"

msgid ""
"The upload directory %directory for the file element %name could not "
"be created or is not accessible. A newly uploaded file could not be "
"saved in this directory as a consequence, and the upload was canceled."
msgstr ""
"Ububiko bwo gukuramo %directory kuri element y’ifayela %name "
"ntibyashoboye kuremwa cyangwa ntibushobora kugerwaho. Kubera iyo "
"mpamvu, dosiye iherutse koherezwa ntibyashoboka kuyibika muri ubu "
"bubiko, kandi kohereza byahagaritswe."

msgid "Importing submissions is a new and experimental feature."
msgstr ""
"Gushyiramo ibihabwa (submissions) ni ibintu bishya kandi birimo "
"kugeragezwa."

msgid ""
"Please test and review your imported submissions using a "
"development/test server."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka gerageza kandi usuzume ibyo wanditsemo (import) ukoresheje "
"seriveri yo guteza imbere/iy’igeragezwa."

msgid "All submission properties and data is optional."
msgstr "Ibiranga byose byo kohereza n’andi makuru byose ni by’uhisemo."

msgid "If UUIDs are included, existing submissions will always be updated."
msgstr "Niba UUIDs zashyizweho, ibyoherezwa biriho bizahora bihindurwamo."

msgid ""
"If UUIDs are not included, already imported and unchanged records will "
"not create duplication submissions."
msgstr ""
"Niba UUIDs zitashyizweho, inyandiko zisanzwe zigeze gushyirwaho kandi "
"zidahindutse ntizizabyara ibisubizo byo kwiyongera."

msgid ""
"File uploads must use publicly access URLs which begin with http:// or "
"https://."
msgstr ""
"Iyoherezwa ry’amadosiye rigomba gukoresha URL z’uburyo bwo "
"kugerwaho n’abantu bose, zitangirira kuri http:// cyangwa https://."

msgid "Entity references can use UUIDs or entity IDs."
msgstr ""
"Aho ikintu gishingiye (entity) gishobora gukoresha UUID cyangwa "
"imyirondoro (entity IDs)."

msgid ""
"Composite (single) values are annotated using double underscores. "
"(e.g. ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"
msgstr ""
"Agaciro (rumwe) k’ingenzi kivanze byandikwa hakoreshejwe "
"uduteranyikirizo tubiri hasi (double underscores). (urugero: "
"ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"

msgid ""
"Multiple composite values are formatted using <a href=\":href\">inline "
"YAML</a>."
msgstr ""
"Uburyo bwinshi bugizwe n’ibice byinshi bufomatwa hakoreshejwe <a "
"href=\":href\">YAML iri mu murongo (inline)</a>."

msgid "Import maximum execution time limit is @time."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gukoresha (maximum execution time limit) ni @time."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">View</a> or <a "
"href=\":href_download\">download</a> an example submission CSV."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">Reba</a> cyangwa <a "
"href=\":href_download\">ukuramo</a> urugero rwa dosiye ya CSV yo "
"kwinjiza."

msgid "Import data source"
msgstr "Kwinjiza isoko y’imibare"

msgid "Upload Submission CSV file"
msgstr "Ushyiremo dosiye ya CSV yo kohereza iyandikwa"

msgid "Enter Submission CSV remote URL"
msgstr "Shyiramo URL yo kure (remote) ya CSV yo kohereza ama dosiye"

msgid "Remote URL could be a <a href=\":href\">published Google Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"URL yo hanze ishobora kuba <a href=\":href\">Urupapuro rwa Google "
"rwanditswe (published)</a>."

msgid "Submission CSV (Comma Separated Values) file"
msgstr ""
"Idosiye ya CSV (Inyandiko yegeranye hakoreshejwe utubari ngoto "
"dusangira indanga, ari na zo \"Comma Separated Values\")"

msgid "Are you sure you want to import @submissions?"
msgstr "Urashaka koko gutumiza @submissions?"

msgid ""
"No UUID or token was found in the source (CSV). A unique hash will be "
"generated for the each CSV record. Any changes to already an imported "
"record in the source (CSV) will create a new submission."
msgstr ""
"Nta UUID cyangwa itike byabonetse muri porogaramu imereweho (CSV). "
"Icapu/ubwoko bwihariye (hash) rizabikwa kuri buri rwandiko (record) "
"riri muri CSV. Impinduka zose zakozwe kuri rwandiko rigeze guteranywa "
"(imported) muri data yo hanze (CSV) zizakora isubiramo rishya "
"(submission)."

msgid "Import mapping"
msgstr "Kwinjiza ihuza rya mapping"

msgid "Importing submissions"
msgstr "Kwinjiza ibitangwa"

msgid "Imported @count of @total submissions…"
msgstr "Byatumijwe @count kuri @total by’itanzwe…"

msgid ""
"Submission import completed. (total: @total; created: @created; "
"updated: @updated; skipped: @skipped)"
msgstr ""
"Iyinjiza ryoherejwe ryarangiye. (total: @total; byaremwe: @created; "
"byavuguruwe: @updated; byasimbutswe: @skipped)"

msgid "Webform module now supports importing submissions | Drupal.org"
msgstr ""
"Urubuga rw’itumanaho (Webform) ruriho rwatangiye gushyigikira "
"kwinjiza ibisubizo | Drupal.org"

msgid ""
"Batch import size is used when submissions are being "
"imported/uploaded."
msgstr ""
"Ingano yo gutumiza mu buryo bw’inzego (batch) ikoreshwa igihe "
"iyoherezwa ryinjijwe/ritoherezwa (import/upload) rigikorwa."

msgid "If checked, users will be able search/filter images by their labels."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, abakoresha bazashobora gushakisha no kuyungurura "
"amashusho bishingiye ku nyandiko zwayo (labels)."

msgid "Filter placeholder label"
msgstr "Label ya placeholder yo kuyungurura"

msgid "Filter single item label"
msgstr "Sefa ikintu kimwe gusa witiriweho"

msgid "Filter plural items label"
msgstr "Icyiciro cyo kuranga ibintu byinshi byo muyungurura"

msgid "Filter no results label"
msgstr "Ihitamo: ntihaboneka ibisubizo"

msgid ""
"CSV data that can't be converted to submission data will display a "
"warning. If checked, these warnings will be treated as errors and "
"prevent the submission from being created."
msgstr ""
"Datalike ya CSV idashobora guhindurwa ngo ibe amakuru yo kohereza "
"izerekanwa itaburira. Niba bibaruwe, ayo maburira azafatwa "
"nk’amakosa kandi azabujya ko kohereza rikorwa."

msgid "Webforms for Healthcare"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kohereza amakuru (Webforms) mu rwego rw’ubuzima"

msgid ""
"This presentation discusses how healthcare organizations can leverage "
"the Webform module for Drupal 8."
msgstr ""
"Iyi disikuru isobanura uko inzego zita ku buzima zishobora gukoresha "
"module ya Webform muri Drupal 8."

