msgstr "Icyitegererezo: Porogaramu"

msgid "A demonstration of a very basic application form."
msgstr ""
"Igaragaza ry’urugero rw’inyandiko yo kwiyandikisha (application "
"form) rudasanzwe kandi rw’ibanze cyane."

