"A demonstration of a very basic application evaluation form. This form "
"is attached to the 'Demo: Application' using a Webform block."
msgstr ""
"Igeragezwa ry’inyandiko yoroshye cyane yo gusuzuma ubusabe. Iyi fomu "
"ihuzwa na “Demo: Application” hifashishijwe blok yitwa Webform."

msgid "Event date/time"
msgstr "Itariki/igihe cy’igikorwa"

msgid "Maximum number of registrants"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w’abiyandikisha"

msgid "Demo: Event Registration"
msgstr ""
"Icyitegererezo: Kwiyandikisha ku Cyumweru/Itariki y’Umunsi "
"w’Icyabaye"

msgid "A demonstration of an event registration form."
msgstr "Iserukiramuco ryerekana urupapuro rwiyandikisha ry’ibikorwa."

msgid "Demo: Region Contact"
msgstr "Demo: Ihuza ry’akarere"

msgid "A demonstration of a region based contact form."
msgstr ""
"Igaragaza ryerekana uburyo bwo guhamagara/kwandikirana hakoreshejwe "
"urupapuro rw’amakuru (contact form) rubishingiye ku ifasi (region)."

msgid "Employee: Email"
msgstr "Umukozi: Imeri"

msgid "Demo: Region Contact: Employee"
msgstr "Demo: Aho bahurira n’abo bazi: Umukozi"

msgid "Manager: Email"
msgstr "Umuyobozi: Imeri"

msgid "Demo: Region Contact: Manager"
msgstr ""
"Kwerekana: Aho ihurira n’Ubujyanama/Umurongo w’Abacamanza: "
