msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, hashyirwaho ihuza ryo guhisha/kwereka ibintu byose "
"kuri iyi webform igihe hazaba hari wizard/cards pages."

msgid "Wizard/cards show all elements label"
msgstr "Wizard/cards yerekana ibintu byose bifite amazina"

msgid "Wizard/card hide all elements label"
msgstr "Wizard/ikarita hisha ibintu byose (label)"

msgid "Webform Cards"
msgstr "Ikarita za Webform"

msgid ""
"Provides a 'Card' container element for fast clientside multistep form "
"pagination."
msgstr ""
"Iha agasanduku k’‘ikarita’ (Card) ko gukoresha vuba imbere mu "
"rubuga (client-side) ukwimura urupapuro rw’iformu yo mu ntambwe "
"nyinshi (multistep form pagination)."

msgid "Convert wizard pages to cards"
msgstr "Hindura impapuro z’iyakwirakwizwa (wizard) zibe amakarita (cards)"

msgid "Convert @title wizard pages to cards"
msgstr "Hindura impapuro za @title wizard uziyindishe muri cards"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to test the converted webform on a staging server "
"before using cards in production."
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka genzura ko webform wahinduriwe wakoreweho iperereza kuri "
"seriveri yo guhinduriraho (staging) mbere yo gukoresha amakarita muri "
"production."

msgid ""
"Cards provide an almost identical user experience to wizard pages, but "
"moving between cards is much faster. Cards use JavaScript for "
"pagination and client-side validation. Cards also support "
"auto-forwarding with conditional logic."
msgstr ""
"Amakarita atanga uburambe bw’abakoresha bugereranywa cyane "
"n’ubw’imyandikire ya wizard, ariko kugenda hagati y’amakarita "
"bikorwa vuba cyane. Amakarita akoresha JavaScript ku buryo bwo "
"guhindura urupapuro (pagination) no kwemeza ibisohoka kuruhande "
"rw’umukiriya (client-side validation). Amakarita ananone ashyigikira "
"kohereza byikora (auto-forwarding) bishingiye ku mategeko (conditional "
"logic)."

msgid ""
"Please confirm that you want to convert this webform's wizard pages to "
"cards"
msgstr ""
"Nyamuneka tanga icyemezo ko ushaka guhindura impapuro "
"z’iserukiramuco (wizard) z’uru rubuga rw’ifishi zibe amakarita "
"(cards)."

msgid "Wizard pages have been successfully converted to cards."
msgstr "Impapuro za wizard zimaze guhindurwa neza ziba amakarita."

msgid "Card settings"
msgstr "Amasanone y’ikarita"

msgid "Provides an element for a fast clientside pagination."
msgstr ""
"Itanga uburyo bwo gukora pagination yihuta ku ruhande rw’abakiriya "
"(client-side)."

msgid ""
"Pages and cards cannot be used in the same webform. Please remove or "
"convert the pages/cards to the same element type."
msgstr ""
"Aupaji (Pages) na kaardsi (cards) ntibishobora gukoreshwa muri webform "
"imwe. Nyamuneka wimure cyangwa uhindure pages/cards bikomere ku bwoko "
"bumwe bw’element."

msgid "Edit '@label' (@start of @end)"
msgstr "Hindura “@label” (kuva ku @start kugeza kuri @end)"

