"If checked, the wizard's progress bar's pages will be hidden or shown "
"based on each pages conditional logic."
msgstr ""
"Niba byatoraguwe, urubuga (pages) rwerekana uko inzira igenda igera ku "
"musozo ruri kuri wizeradi ruzahishwa cyangwa rugaragazwe hashingiwe ku "
"mategeko ngenderwaho (conditional logic) kuri buri page."

