msgid ""
"The 'tokenized' URL to view a submission will be available when "
"viewing a submission's information and can be inserted into an email "
"using the [webform_submission:token-view-url] token."
msgstr ""
"Icyitonderwa “rifite token” ku URL yo kureba itangwa (submission) "
"kizamene kuoneka mugihe uri kureba amakuru y’itangwa, kandi "
"gishobora gushyirwa mu ibaruwa ukoresheje token "
"[webform_submission:token-view-url]."

msgid ""
"The 'tokenized' URL to update a submission will be available when "
"viewing a submission's information and can be inserted into an email "
"using the [webform_submission:token-update-url] token."
msgstr ""
"URL ifite “token” yo kuvugurura iyishyikirizwa (submission) "
"izaboneka igihe uri kureba amakuru y’iyishyikirizwa, kandi ishobora "
"guterwa muri imeyili ukoresheje token "
"**[webform_submission:token-update-url]**."

msgid "User IP address tracking is disabled for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Gukurikirana aderesi ya IP y’umukoresha byahagaritswe kuri "
"formulaire zose za web."

msgid "If checked, a user's IP address will not be recorded for this webform."
msgstr ""
"Kihebuje niba byemejwe, aderesi ya IP y’umukoresha ntizajya ibikwa "
"kuri iyi webform."

msgid ""
"This is the \"To:\" email header which will be the person(s) "
"responsible for receiving this webform."
msgstr ""
"Iyi ni “To:” umutwe wa imeri (email) werekeza kuri uw(aba) "
"birekurirwa kwakira iyi webform."

msgid ""
"This is the \"From:\" email header which should come from "
"<em>you</em>.  It should be your brand, company, organization, or "
"website entity."
msgstr ""
"Uru ni rwo “From:” rwandiko rw’iposita rukomoka kuri "
"<em>wewe</em>. Rugomba kuba ari iryo shusho/ikirango cyawe, sosiyete "
"yawe, urwego rwawe, cyangwa ikigo cya webu bihagarariye."

msgid "Reply to (individual/organization)"
msgstr "Subiza (umuntu/urwego)"

msgid ""
"The \"Reply-To:\" email header is used for replying to the email that "
"is received.  For example, if you collect a customers email, you would "
"want to reply-to them. If you collect a lead generation form and want "
"to reply to the coordinator, you would reply-to them."
msgstr ""
"Umutwe wa email “Reply-To:” ukoreshwa mu gusubiza kuri email "
"wakiriye. Kurugero, niba wakusanyije imeri y’umukiriya, ushaka "
"kubasubizaho. Niba wakusanyije ifishi y’ikorwa ryo gushaka "
"abafatanyabikorwa (lead generation) kandi ukaba ushaka gusubiza "
"umuhuza (coordinator), washoboraga kubasubizaho."

msgid "Reply to:"
msgstr "Subiza:"

