"If checked, the next button will be hidden when the input is not "
"filled and can be auto-forwarded."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, buto ikurikira izahishwa igihe icyinjijwe kituzuye "
"kandi ikaba ishobora kwimenyerezwa ihite ikurikira."

msgid "Clear value(s) when hidden"
msgstr "Siba agaciro(ibya) bigaragara iyo bihishe"

msgid "Not between"
msgstr "Ntabwo biri hagati"

