"If unchecked, all warnings about the Webform Clientside Validation "
"will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Niba itashyizweho, ibihano byose bijyanye no kugenzura ku ruhande "
"rw’umukiriya rwa Webform Clientside Validation bizazimwa."

msgid "Show remove element button"
msgstr "Garagaza buto yo gukuraho (remove)"

msgid "If unchecked, the remove button will be removed from each table row."
msgstr ""
"Niba itagenzuwe, buto yo gukuraho izakurwaho kuri buri murongo "
"w’ameza."

