msgstr "<strong>@name</strong> @trigger."

msgid ""
"<strong>@name</strong> @trigger <strong>@min</strong> and "
"<strong>@max</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@name</strong> @trigger <strong>@min</strong> na "
"<strong>@max</strong>."

msgid "<strong>@name</strong> @trigger <strong>@value</strong>."
msgstr "<strong>@name</strong> @trigger <strong>@value</strong>."

msgid ""
"Auto-forward to next card when a card with a single click-able input "
"is completed"
msgstr ""
"Kohereza ku ikarita ikurikira ihita iyo ikarita ifite icyinjiriro "
"kimwe gishobora gukanda imaze kurangira"

msgid ""
"If checked, the used will be moved to the next card when a single "
"click-able input is checked (i.e. radios, rating, and image select)."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, ikintu cyatoranyijwe kizimukira ku ikarita "
"ikurikira iyo impyapapa imwe yo gukanda (urugero: radio, amanota, "
"n’iyo guhitamo amashusho) ihitanyweho."

msgid "Disable next submission number"
msgstr "Urahagarika nimero ikurikira yo kohereza"

msgid ""
"If checked the next number will be automatically set to the internal "
"submission id."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho ikibazo, nimero ikurikira izahita ishyirwaho "
"hakurikijwe indangamuntu yo kohereza imbere (internal submission id)."

msgid ""
"If checked, all submission properties and values  will be included in "
"the displayed debug information. This includes sid, created, updated, "
"completed, and more."
msgstr ""
"Niba byahitwemo, ibintu byose byerekeye ibirebana no kwiyandikisha "
"(submission properties) n’indangagaciro (values) bizashyirwa mu "
"makuru yo kugenzura (debug) agaragazwa. Harimo harimo sid, created, "
"updated, completed, n’ibindi byinshi."

msgid "Data format:"
msgstr "Imiterere y’amakuru:"

msgid "The URL or path to redirect the user to upon successful submission."
msgstr "URL cyangwa inzira bigomba kuyobora umukoresha nyuma yo kohereza neza."

msgid ""
"Paths beginning with a forward slash (/) will redirect be treated as "
"root-relative. Paths without a forward slash (/) will redirect be "
"treated as Drupal relative path."
msgstr ""
"Inzira zikorwa zitangirana n’inyuguti y’imbere (/) (forward slash) "
"(/) zizafatwa nk’uko zijya ku rwego rwa “root” (root-relative). "
"Inzira zitatangirana n’inyuguti y’imbere (/) zizafatwa "
"nk’izerekeza ku buryo bufitanye isano na Drupal (Drupal relative "
"path)."

msgid "Display element"
msgstr "Erekana ikintu"

msgid "Download attachments"
msgstr "Kuramo imikujyana (attachments)"

msgid ""
"If checked, the exported file and any attachments files will be "
"download in the archive file."
msgstr ""
"Niba byashyizweho, dosiye yoherejwe n’andi makomeka yayo (nka dosiye "
"zishingirwaho) bizakururwa bikomatanyijwe muri dosiye ya archive."

msgid "Tabby"
msgstr "Tabby"

msgid "Tabby provides lightweight, accessible vanilla JS toggle tabs."
msgstr ""
"Tabby itanga toggle tabs zoroshye kandi zifite uburyo bwo gukoresha "
"neza mu buryo bwa vanilla JS."

msgid "Tabby is used to display tabs in the administrative UI"
msgstr ""
"Tabby ikoreshwa mu kwerekana utubuto (tabs) muri interineti ikoreshwa "
"mu buyobozi (administrative UI)."

